window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3601,"title":"Chapter 3601: Level -2 Spiritual Overlord (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3601: Level -2 Spiritual Overlord (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","That’s right. Shouldn’t Feng Wu be the one facing the lightning tribulation? Why were they the ones doing it?","No one could figure it out, but they were indeed helping Feng Wu with the lightning tribulation.","BOOM!","Now that Feng Wu was a Level-2 Spiritual Overlord, the lightning tribulation she triggered was several times more powerful than before!","All the lightning bolts were heading toward the Spiritual Overlords in the courtyard.","‘Why?!","“Why is this happening?!”","Every Spiritual Overlord was shouting.","There were twenty Spiritual Overlords in the Zuo family, and ten of them had already fallen to the ground. They had turned into charcoal and were long dead.","There were fifteen Spiritual Overlords in the Hua family. Two of them had died in the previous chaotic battle, and three of them had been struck by the lightning tribulation. Only ten were still alive.","Among the itinerant cultivators in the Spiritual Overlord Stage, only seven were still alive.","Now, the second round of lightning tribulation was here!","“Damn it! It’s coming again!” Bukong wanted to cry. “And it’s even more powerful than before!","“If we can’t get out of the Zuo family, we’ll be trapped in this quagmire and have to endure the lightning tribulation for Feng Wu. Damn it!”","Everyone was in pain.","They had all gathered together to kill Feng Wu and take her head to Firmament Palace for the reward, but now... Why was this happening?","“Everyone, hit the wall! Let’s break it down! As long as there’s a gap, we can escape! ”","No one wanted to kill Feng Wu right now. All they wanted to do was run away.","The desire to escape united everyone.","When these 27 Spiritual Overlords were united, they were a huge force. They attacked the gate in unison.","The power of so many Spiritual Overlords put together was comparable to a Spirit Saint.","Just then...","The lightning river stopped for a moment. Everything calmed for a moment, and there was a suffocating dark fear.","Zuo Ming couldn’t hide his excitement. “Did the lightning tribulation... stop?” Everyone turned to look at Feng Wu.","Right now, Feng Wu was still sitting on the roof, her clothes fluttering in the wind. She looked cold and beautiful.","Her originally bloated body had already returned to normal.","Her eyes were tightly shut, and she looked like a goddess descending from Heaven. She was beautiful and noble.","“So... has that girl completed her breakthrough?” Bukong asked expectantly.","The surroundings were extremely quiet.","They weren’t the only ones who were guessing.","Many people were shocked by the activity in the Zuo family today.","Because the battle was confined to the Zuo family’s house, ordinary people didn’t feel anything.","However, cultivators did. The more powerful a cultivator was, the sharper their senses would be. At this moment, they all flew toward the Zuo family and watched from afar.","They didn’t get close because they didn’t want to alarm either side of the battle, in case they were dragged in.","Outside the Zuo family’s house, Yu Mingye and a group of Spiritual Overlords were guarding the formation, astonished by Feng Wu’s power.","From the moment they threatened to destroy the Feng clan, Feng Wu had taken control of the situation and killed nearly 20 Spiritual Overlords. That was a heroic act that made everyone excited.","Although she didn’t kill them herself.","“She was just a Spiritual King at first...” General Gao didn’t know what to say.","Both he and General Yuan had been selected from the imperial guards and assigned by the crown prince to protect Feng Wu. At first, they weren’t happy about the arrangement because Spiritual Overlords shouldn’t be guarding a teenage girl.."]},{"number":3602,"title":"Chapter 3602: Level-2 Spiritual Overlord (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3602: Level-2 Spiritual Overlord (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","If it weren’t for the fact that Jun Linyuan was very powerful and overbearing, the two of them would have quit their job.","After they followed Feng Wu around, they saw how busy the girl was and how many tricks she had up her sleeve. General Gao had even laughed at her for using tricks because she wasn’t strong enough. In the end, true strength was what mattered in this world.","General Gao admitted that he had had some opinions about Feng Wu before, but now, he felt he had been slapped in the face.","She had only been a Spiritual King, but after a series of mysterious actions, she had already killed more than 20 Spiritual Overlords.","The Zuo family, the Hua family, and the hired Spiritual Overlords all wanted to kill her, but things turned out to be the other way around.","General Gao asked, “How did she make all that happen?”","General Yuan was so impressed by Feng Wu that he almost fell to his knees. He kept praising her. “I told you before, didn’t I? Feng Wu is amazing, but you didn’t believe me. In fact, you only need to think about what kind of person the crown prince is. How can he fall for an ordinary person?”","General Gao was still very proud. “...There are still more than 20 people alive. Let’s see how she deals with them. This round won’t be as easy.”","General Yuan had a headache when he saw the twenty-odd Spiritual Overlord in the Zuo family’s yard. “I think little Feng Wu has a way.”","They were not the only ones watching this battle.","All the aristocratic families in the imperial capital were paying attention.","So were the people in the palace.","Standing on Star Pavillion, Emperor Wu clasped his hands behind his back an watched the Zuo family closely.","It was the tallest building in the palace and in the imperial capital. Standing here, one could see the scenery of the entire city.","At that moment, Emperor Wu was holding a long tube in his right hand and watching everything in the Zuo familys yard with his left eye half-closed.","Others might not be able to see it clearly, but Emperor Wu had the divine instrument in his hand, so he could see everything through the formation embedded in it.","Emperor Wu couldn’t help but smile when he saw Feng Wu, who was sitting the roof, and the Spiritual Overlords who had been defeated by the lightning tribulation. “How naughty! That’s so satisfying!”","“That’s because Your Majesty treats her well,” Master Gao said with a smile.","“Your Majesty, you sent someone to protect her.”","Emperor Wu waved his hand. “She’s a tough girl. She didn’t use those men I gave her.”","Master Gao smiled. “Your Majesty, those aren’t the only ones you sent. Don’t forget the Spiritual Saint hiding in the dark.","Emperor Wu said grumpily, “She’s the only crown prince consort I’ll ever acknowledge. I can’t just stand by and watch her get killed. Of course, I have to protect her.”","Emperor Wu said, “By the way, is Jun Linyuan back yet? I’ve already helped him so much. If he doesn’t make it in time for the feast, I’m going to be so mad!”","Master Gao pursed his lips and smiled. “I’ve already tried my best to rush him. I’ll definitely make it.”","“That’s good.” Emperor Wu clicked his tongue as he continued watching. “I didn’t expect this girl to be able to kill more than 20 Spiritual Overlords on her own.","“That’s as many as the Imperial College has accumulated since it was established,” Emperor Wu boasted to Master Gao.","Master Gao nodded with a smile.","“By the way, how is the empress dowager?"]},{"number":3603,"title":"Chapter 3603: Her Tribulation(l)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3603: Her Tribulation(l)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu asked Master Gao as he stared at the Zuo family’s yard.","Master Gao smiled bitterly. “Ever since Her Majesty came home, she hasn’t been in good health. She wakes up from nightmares from time to time. Master Chu has been waiting on her, but he said...","Emperor Wu frowned at Master Gao.","Master Gao smiled bitterly. “Master Chu says there’s nothing he can do, and only Miss Feng Wu can help.”","Emperor Wu stared at Master Gao. “If that’s the case... How could Xiao Wu not know why my mother went to the Hua family?”","Master Gao said, “That’s right.”","Emperor Wu waved his hand impatiently. “Let’s wait until this is over. Xiao Wu is in danger herself.”","Master Gao was confused. Didn’t His Majesty send a top expert to protect Miss Feng wu?","Emperor Wu frowned. There were some things that no one could take on for her.","The Zuo family.","When the lightning river stopped pouring down, everyone looked surprised, thinking that they had been saved.","But right at that moment...","“Holy crap! Is Feng Wu even human?! She’s trying to break through to Level 3 of the Spiritual Overlord Stage! She’s trying to rise to another level!”","“Is she crazy? That’s just insane! Why did she make a breakthrough so quickly?!","Isn’t she worried that her body can’t keep up?!”","“Isn’t she worried that she’ll be struck by lightning?! This is defying the heavens!”","“No, the most important thing is, why did she make so many breakthroughs in one go? Why?!”","Everyone else had been slowly making progress one level at a time, but this girl... How was she able to do that?","Everyone had gone crazy!","Earlier, when Feng Wu had reached Level 1 of the Spiritual Overlord Stage, she had caused a huge commotion with that sea of lightning that had poured down on them. They had already lost more than 20 Spiritual Overlords!","“Everyone, bombard this door. Hurry up!” All the Spiritual Overlords went crazy!","Hua Huaiyu and Zuo Ming had been mortal enemies, but now they were working together.","Everyone was asking Zuo Ming how to solve the formation, and they were all sweating profusely. Their voices were urgent, and they looked anxious.","Zuo Ming was on the verge of tears. “I have no idea. The Zuo family’s formation isn’t like this. We..","At this moment, the black thunderstorm that had been brewing in the sky for a long time rumbled, and thunderbolts poured down.","Before, it was still like a river that chased after everyone and shot them. Now, it wasn’t like that anymore. Lightning poured down like rain.","Little Phoenix turned pale in fright. It curled up in Feng Wu’s arms and looked out.","This sea of lightning formed a net, which was an abnormal phenomenon... This girl was going to cause big trouble! “Oh my god, this girl is crazy!”","“Stop, stop!”","“I don’t want to die!”","The Spiritual Overlords’ flesh and blood were blasted into pieces by the thunderstorm. However, they were imprisoned in this courtyard and couldn’t escape.","It was too terrifying!","Emperor Wu’s heart skipped a beat.","He subconsciously looked at the sky..","How could this thunderstorm be so terrifying?","By the time this thunderstorm ended, there was no longer anyone standing. Every single one of these 20-odd Spiritual Overlords had their flesh split open by the lightning. The pain was unbearable, and their bodies seemed to have been charred black...","Although they couldn’t move, they were still alive.","Bukong was so frustrated.."]},{"number":3604,"title":"Chapter 3604: Her Tribulation (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3604: Her Tribulation (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","More than 40 Spiritual Overlords had actually suffered a crushing defeat when dealing with a teenage girl whose strength was far inferior to theirs. How furious they must be!","Bukong immediately spat out a mouthful of blood, which instantly turned into black water.","Bukong said, “Feng Wu, you...","He wanted to speak, but just as he opened his mouth, the breath he exhaled carried the smell of charred flesh.","Bukong was speechless.","Was she really the chosen one?!","Was there really no one who could go against her?","Would anyone who went against her be struck by lightning? A look of reverence appeared on Bukong’s face.","Right at that moment...","Suddenly, an incomparably huge hole appeared in the sky.","Everyone looked up at the sky, only to see that there seemed to be something surging in the hole.","What was that?","Bukong felt so terrified that he was trembling. If he could, all he wanted to do now was run away. Neither killing Feng Wu nor the Spirit Diagram Sword was more important than his life.","Feng Wu was still sitting on the roof, her clothes fluttering in the wind, but her expression was turning grim.","She wasn’t the only one. Little Phoenix looked grim as well.","Little Phoenix sighed and complained, “I told you to take it easy and not make too many breakthroughs in one go, but you didn’t listen and insisted on making the breakthroughs. They can help you withstand the lightning tribulation, but how much can they withstand? It should be your lightning tribulation, and you have to bear it yourself.”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything, but it was obvious that her face was getting grimmer.","Looking at the hole in the dark sky, Little Phoenix was on the verge of tears. “It’s a sea of lightning... My little girl, it’s a sea of lightning. You won’t be able to withstand it! It’s over, it’s really over.”","As Little Phoenix had said, the hole was getting bigger and bigger...","In the end, the dark clouds above the Zuo family’s head were almost all gone. In the sky, there was a black sea of lightning that could cover the Zuo family. Electric arcs flashed, and thunderstorms surged. Whoosh","An electric current flashed and dripped to the ground.","It jumped on a Spiritual Overlord, and he immediately spat out a mouthful of blood from the pain. Everyone was dumbfounded.","“This is a purple electric arc!”","“This electric arc is much stronger than before!”","“Is the sea of purple lightning coming down? Look, it’s aiming at Feng Wu!”","“This time, it’s not aiming at us, but at Feng Wu. Is Feng Wu’s lightning tribulation finally here?!”","Bukong took a deep breath and a look of ecstasy appeared on his face.","He knew it. How could she be the chosen one? She had made so many breakthroughs in one go. How could there be no Heavenly Tribulation?","It wasn’t that there weren’t any, but that they were too powerful and came late.","Feng Wu..","She couldn’t take it.","Not only did Bukong think so, but the Spiritual Overlords outside the Zuo family also thought so.","Tears welled up in Yu Mingye’s eyes. He tried his best to rush in, but as a junior Spiritual Overlord, he couldn’t get in.","“Xiao Wu, please don’t die!” Yu Mingye’s eyes were bloodshot. He pounded his chest with his right hand and wailed.","The Dugu family.","Patriarch Gudu, who had been paying attention to this battle, slowly exhaled.","Next to him sat the old master of the family.","“Father, it seems that Feng Wu won’t be able to get away with it, ” Patriarch Dugu said.","Old Master Dugu nodded. “This child is too proud.. How can Nature allow such a person who destroys the rules of Nature to survive?"]},{"number":3605,"title":"Chapter 3605: Her Tribulation (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3605: Her Tribulation (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Old Master Dugu’s expression was indifferent as he said coldly, “Such a person will definitely die. There’s no justice if she lives.”","His son smiled.","Feng Wu was finally going to die.","He had gone from a Level-8 Spiritual King to Level-3 Spiritual Overlord in one go. What kind of talent was that? Even Jun Linyuan hadn’t made such a leap back then.","She had to die.","Master Dugu heaved a sigh of relief.","However, Emperor Wu’s pupils contracted. He couldn’t bring himself to see his daughter-in-law, who was supposed to have the Divine Phoenix Blood, die.","But no one could save her.","The only one who could save her...","No, there was no one left in this world that could save her.","Feng Wu looked up and saw the sea of lightning crackling in the sky. Purple electric arcs were sizzling.","Drip, drip, drip...","The electric arcs began to fall intermittently.","Whoosh!","A sea of lightning poured down on Feng Wu!","Finally... it was here.","Taking a deep breath, Little Phoenix told Feng Wu loudly, “I’ll teach you the Lightning Technique. Remember, follow the instructions and direct the lightning into your body. You... Anyway, remember, no matter how painful it is, you have to stick to it!”","“Yes.” Feng Wu nodded.","“The Path of Lightning is like drawing a bow. The capable ones will suppress it, and the...”","The Lightning Technique was the most powerful thunder element skill in the world, and Little Phoenix didn’t know about it at first. However, as if someone had clicked a button on its head, Little Phoenix suddenly heard the chant.","It recalled when it saw Master Mu use the Lightning Technique back then.","The lightning kept striking down, and Feng Wu was in pain. Gritting her teeth, she prompted Little Phoenix, “Keep going!”","Little Phoenix went on reciting the Lightning Technique to Feng Wu.","It was communicated through Feng Wu’s mind, which was why no one else knew about its presence.","They only saw Feng Wu, who had been buried by the lightning.","“Feng Wu is dead.” Bukong stared at the roof where Feng Wu couldn’t be seen anymore. They could only see the surging lightning. Hua Huaiyu was elated. “Are you sure she’s dead?”","Zuo Ming was equally elated.","The thunderstorm didn’t kill them. Right now, they were charred black, but they were still breathing. However, they couldn’t move.","One of Bukong’s arms was gone, and he smelled like burnt flesh.","There was a murderous look in his eyes.","“Don’t you remember? The lightning that hit us just then was nowhere nearly as powerful as this one, but look at what we’ve become.","Almost all the Spiritual Overlords were lying motionlessly on the ground. It was hard to tell if they were still alive.","Bukong said, “Feng Wu is nowhere near as capable as we are. How can she be alright? Her bones are probably charred by the explosion.”","“What a pity...” Bukong shook his head. “She’s so talented and the only person comparable to Jun Linyuan. She’s dead just like that...’","Bukong looked revered.","Before, he really thought that Feng Wu was just an ordinary girl, but after seeing her make four or five breakthroughs in a row, he finally realized how talented she was.","“We’ve killed a genius that’s as talented as Jun Linyuan. That’s something we can brag about for the rest of our lives.” Bukong smiled bitterly.","The Black and White Priest asked indifferently, “Did you forget the part where she almost killed all forty of us?”"]},{"number":3606,"title":"Chapter 3606: Her Tribulation(4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3606: Her Tribulation(4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Bukong didn’t know what to say.","“Is it possible that Feng Wu isn’t dead?” Zuo Ming frowned.","Everyone looked at him as if he was an idiot.","“That’s impossible. A thunderstorm like this can melt even a man made of iron, let alone someone like Feng Wu.” Bukong shook his head. “She has to be dead by now.”","Was Feng Wu really dead?","Following Little Phoenix’s instruction, Feng Wu activated the thunder element in her body and covered herself with a thin layer of it, temporarily blocking out the lightning.","But it would only be for a little while.","Small streaks of lightning kept seeping into her body, and the pain was indescribable.","Feng Wu felt as if her bones had been burnt to a crisp!","The lightning seemed to have burnt her skin off.","All Feng Wu could do was follow Little Phoenix’s instructions and cultivate according to the Lightning Technique.","However, there were simply too many lightning bolts, and it was too powerful for Feng Wu to handle.","Feng Wu’s skin was burnt, repaired, and burnt again.","However, with each repair, the power she could withstand gradually increased, although it wasn’t obvious.","But it hurt.","Every time her skin was torn open, Feng Wu felt as if she was going to be torn to pieces. The pain almost killed her, and she couldn’t stop trembling...","In the end, Feng Wu lost consciousness and couldn’t hold on much longer... “Feng Wu! Wake up! Feng Wu!”","Little Phoenix kept calling her name and jumping around in her head, trying to wake her up.","“Don’t go to sleep! You’ll be dead!","“Master Mu is waiting for you! Didn’t you feel you owed him? He’ll never wake up if you’re dead!”","Just when Feng Wu thought that the thunder was going to melt her, Little Phoenix’s voice woke her up.","That was right. Her beautiful master was still waiting for her to save him, and she couldn’t die...","Ding...","A drop of Divine Phoenix Blood flew out of Feng Wu’s forehead and hovered around her.","The Divine Phoenix Blood brought out ancient inscriptions that shone with a faint golden light and landed on Feng Wu’s body. As the words appeared, something amazing happened.","There was less lightning liquid on her.","How could that happen?","Little Phoenix was astonished as well, for the violent lightning liquid had flowed into the small hole between Feng Wu’s eyebrows, where the Divine Phoenix Blood used to be... Everything was sucked in at an incredible speed.","Little Phoenix was shocked. “What’s going on? Why did the Divine Phoenix Blood direct the lightning liquid to your forehead? Do you feel anything?” Feng Wu was drifting in and out of consciousness.","She didn’t feel much. She only felt a burning sensation between her eyebrows as if her head was going to explode.","“OMG!”","Just then, Little Phoenix cried out.","Feng Wu had been in so much pain that she couldn’t even move a finger. She could only look at Little Phoenix without saying a word.","“Is the Divine Phoenix Blood storing the lightning liquid for you and turning it into your Eye of Lightning?”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you mean?”","Little Phoenix said, “Aren’t you practicing the Lightning Technique? It’s a manual, but you haven’t learned the stances yet. That’s what the Divine Phoenix Blood is teaching you!","“It’s going to swallow the lightning liquid and turn it into your skill!”"]},{"number":3607,"title":"Chapter 3607: Level-3 Spiritual Overlord (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3607: Level-3 Spiritual Overlord (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu said, “I don’t really understand.”","Little Phoenix said, “Imagine when you’re going to hit someone. The third eye on your forehead will open, and lightning will shoot out! How does that feel?” Feng Wu was amazed, and that indeed sounded great.","“But won’t that turn me into Shiva?” Feng Wu looked curiously at Little","Phoenix.","Little Phoenix asked, “What’s Shiva?”","Feng Wu said, “Well, it’s someone with a third eye. Won’t it be ugly?”","Little Phoenix wanted to poke Feng Wu in the head, but it couldn’t, so it said grumpily, “Did you see any mark when you obtained the Divine Phoenix","Blood?”","Feng Wu shook her head.","Little Phoenix said, “Don’t worry. It won’t leave any trace. It’ll be your most lethal weapon.”","Feng Wu came back to her senses. “How do you know about the Lightning","Technique? And why can you teach it to me?”","Little Phoenix said proudly, “Don’t I recover my memory all the time? Consider yourself lucky. When I saw this sea of lightning, I was so worried that I remembered the Lightning Technique. Otherwise, you would have been dead by now.”","As the Divine Phoenix Blood put the thunder liquid into Feng Wu’s forehead, the lightning around Feng Wu grew less and less...","In the end, there was only a thin layer of electric current around her.","“Shit! Look! Feng Wu is...”","“She’s still here?! How can she still be alive?!”","Bukong stared at the girl on the roof in disbelief.","She was still there, and even her bright red dress was flapping in the wind.","She closed her eyes, revealing her fair skin that was as smooth as jade.","Was she still alive?","All the Spiritual Overlords in the Zuo family’s courtyard stared at Feng Wu in astonishment. They held their breaths, and their hearts raced. The people outside the courtyard watched this in astonishment as well.","Yu Mingye stopped yelling.","Feng Xun stopped banging his head on the wall.","Emperor Wu was over the moon.","The Dugu family...","“Father, Feng Wu is...” Master Dugu looked at his father in disbelief and hesitated.","There was a water pattern in front of them, which clearly reflected everything that was going on in the Zuo family’s courtyard.","Old Master Dugu was an old man with drooping eyelids. However, he was staring at Feng Wu in disbelief.","“The Lightning Technique! She’s cultivating it!” Old Master Dugu stared at Feng Wu’s forehead, and his pupils contracted.","“My father is overreacting, ” Master Dugu thought to himself.","At the old man’s age, the only people that could affect his mood were Spiritual Saints. How could Feng Wu make him so agitated?","“Father, is Feng Wu really dead?” Master Dugu asked curiously.","Instead of answering him, Old Master Dugu murmured, “Why did the Lightning","Technique and the Spirit Diagram Sword resurface in the imperial capital? Is God Mu still alive?”","Dugu Jue was shocked and stared at his father without saying anything.","God Mu was someone of an entirely different level that Dugu Jue couldn’t participate in the subject.","His father said, “Both techniques resurface in the imperial capital, and Feng Wu is involved in both incidents.. Can she really have a connection with God Mil?”"]},{"number":3608,"title":"Chapter 3608: Level-3 Spiritual Overlord (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3608: Level-3 Spiritual Overlord (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Dugu Jue’s heart skipped a beat.","If that were the case, Feng Wu must be a terrifying existence that couldn’t be offended.","Old Master Dugu said, “Now I hope Feng Wu isn’t dead.” “B-but she should be dead... right?”","Before he could finish, Feng Wu slowly opened her eyes.","Her eyes seemed to have been washed in ice. They were as cold as water and as bright as the stars.","In the courtyard.","“She’s opened her eyes!”","“Her eyes are moving. She’s not dead!”","“How is that possible?! Even we Spiritual Overlords can’t withstand the sea of lightning. Why can she?” “And she’s not injured. I don’t believe it!”","Was Feng Wu unharmed?","In fact, the injuries in her body were unprecedentedly serious!","The endless sea of lightning surged into her body, burning her blood vessels, meridians, and internal organs. Everything washed over, shattered, and healed over and over again...","Death by a thousand cuts was nothing. What Feng Wu had just experienced was countless times more painful.","Although she looked fine on the outside, in fact, her body was still constantly cracking and healing. She couldn’t even say a word, let alone move.","Little Phoenix was worried about Feng Wu. “How are you?”","Feng Wu said, “The worst part is over. It won’t hurt any more than before.”","Little Phoenix nodded. “But something worse has happened.”","Feng Wu said, “What’s that?”","“You can’t move, but those Spiritual Overlords are still alive.” Little Phoenix pointed at them.","After this series of thunderstorms, there were still more than 20 Spiritual Overlords who survived.","Little Phoenix said, “They’re still in shock, but they’ll come back to their senses soon. Without the protection of the lightning sea, you’re a lamb waiting to be slaughtered.”","Feng Wu only smiled and said nothing.","The Spiritual Overlords on the ground seemed to have realized what was going on.","Zuo Ming frowned.","Hua Huaiyu also took a deep breath. “I see how incredible she is now. She can even survive that kind of lightning! How can we kill her?”","Bukong stared at Feng Wu and noticed something.","Feng Wu’s expression hadn’t changed since she opened her eyes, and she hadn’t moved at all. Did that mean she couldn’t move?","Bukong was used to risking his life for opportunities, and this time was no exception.","“Feng Wu’s head is mine. Anyone wants to compete with me?”","Everyone looked at Bukong as if he was retarded. He still wanted to take Feng Wu’s head for his reward? Didn’t he know what kind of person Feng Wu was?","No one would fight with Bukong because they themselves were lying on the ground and couldn’t move.","The Black and White Priest stared at Bukong. “Don’t be too greedy.”","Bukong said fiercely, “I still have some spiritual essence left. I’m at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord Stage. How can I not be able to deal with a Level-3 Spiritual Overlord? Besides, I think Feng Wu is at the end of her rope. Don’t worry.”","As he spoke, Bukong forced himself to stand up.","Little Phoenix saw him.."]},{"number":3609,"title":"Chapter 3609: Level-3 Spiritual Overlord (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3609: Level-3 Spiritual Overlord (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Little Phoenix’s face darkened. “He’s standing up! This peak Spiritual Overlord can still fight. I didn’t expect him to be hiding his strength. These Spiritual","Overlords are so scheming!”","Bukong trudged toward Feng Wu.","He looked up at Feng Wu cautiously.","It was obvious that he was in awe of Feng Wu.","Everyone was looking at Feng Wu and Bukong, as was everyone else.","Bukong, who was at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord Stage, looked at Feng","Wu, who had just reached Level 3.","Feng Wu said to Little Phoenix, “Go undo the formation.”","These people were already seriously injured, but the dozen or so Spiritual Overlords she had left outside were still unharmed.","Little Phoenix nodded, then quietly jumped out of Feng Wu’s arms and went to work on the formation.","However, there was a time lag before the formation could be deactivated, and it would take at least five minutes. Would Feng Wu be able to stop Bukong’s attack during that time?","There were still many Spiritual Overlords here. What if a few of them still had the strength to fight?","No matter how weak they were, if any of them were willing to fight to the death, Feng Wu would be doomed...","Little Phoenix panicked a little and tried to deactivate the formation faster.","The formation that Feng Wu had set up was so complicated that Little Phoenix couldn’t solve it on its own. Feng Wu had to communicate with it through her mind and tell it the steps in detail.","In order to prevent the Spiritual Overlords from escaping, Feng Wu had been ruthless to both them and herself.","Even if she hadn’t found the pool of spirit essence, she could still have used the box of blood source crystals.","It was taken from the Hua family.","Feng Wu had planned to use the Hua family’s blood source crystals to upgrade herself to Level 1 of the Spiritual Overlord Stage, but the spiritual marrow turned out to be more efficient, and she was now a Level-3 Spiritual Overlord.","“Move three inches to the left and place two Spirit Stones.","“Put three spiritual rocks on each spot of the five elements.","“The four directions are marked by four divine beasts. Find the map I drew previously and put blood source crystals in their mouths. Yes, it must be blood source crystals.”","Feng Wu had to devote at least 70% of her energy to teaching Little Phoenix how to break the formation.","She couldn’t move a muscle.","However, Bukong was less than ten meters away from her.","Bukong looked Feng Wu up and down, his eyes full of curiosity. He had a stone in his hand and was ready to throw it at any moment.","“Your name.” Staring at the man in front of her, Feng Wu finally spoke.","Feng Wu was the first to break the silence, and Bukong was overjoyed.","The first to break the silence would be the loser. So, Feng Wu really couldn’t move!","Staring at Feng Wu, Bukong took another step forward. “I’m Bukong.” Who... was Bukong?","Feng Wu looked at him and shook her head. “... I’ve never heard of you.”","Bukong’s expression froze. This girl was showing him now respect. She really wasn’t afraid of offending him.","Bukong smirked, making a mental note of Feng Wu’s provocative tone. He then asked, “How on earth did you dodge the sea of lightning? Do you have a lightning-repelling weapon?”","For a moment, everyone’s attention was attracted by Bukong’s words.","A lightning-repelling weapon?","A divine artifact!","That was enough to make all the cultivators in the world jealous.","Even a Spiritual Saint would want to snatch it.."]},{"number":3610,"title":"Chapter 3610: Level-3 Spiritual Overlord (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3610: Level-3 Spiritual Overlord (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu suddenly smiled. “I didn’t know that a peak Spiritual Overlord would have to make up a story to turn me into the target of public criticism. Bukong, are you that afraid of me?”","Bukong’s expression was extremely ugly. He didn’t expect this girl to still be able to answer coherently. Was she really not injured?","As a matter of fact, what Bukong didn’t know was that the lightning waves were still washing over Feng Wu’s internal organs. It was so painful that Feng Wu almost couldn’t control herself. Even breathing was painful, let alone talking or smiling.","Feng Wu was able to keep a straight face because of her incredible self-control.","Bukong couldnt tell what Feng Wu was capable of, so he had to test her. “I’m afraid of you? Don’t make me laugh!”","As he spoke, Bukong threw the stone at the pillar under Feng Wu.","He didn’t hit Feng Wu because he was too big of a target. What if Feng Wu killed him instead? He was so badly injured that he couldn’t even handle a Level-3 Spiritual Overlord’s attack.","Everyone stared at the small stone that Bukong had thrown.","They were waiting to see Feng Wu’s reaction.","However, there was a loud bang.","The pillar in the room that Feng Wu was sitting on couldn’t hold it anymore, and it collapsed!","Feng Wu, who had been sitting on the roof, also fell from above.","Everyone widened their eyes at the scene in front of them..","Feng Wu didn’t even try to block the rock and just let it smash into the house.","Moreover...","After the house collapsed, Feng Wu didn’t fly away. Instead, she collapsed along with the house.","Dust filled the air.","When the dust settled, everyone saw that Feng Wu was still sitting on the pile of rubble with her cross-legged.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say...","The power of lightning in her body was almost completely absorbed by the Divine Phoenix Blood, but there was only the last bit left...","Her internal organs were badly damaged, and if she could dissect them, she would find that they were charred. Feng Wu could even smell the burning inside of her.","That had to be painful as hell...","It was so painful that it was as if every piece of flesh on her body was being roasted over a fire.","What kind of pain was that...","Feng Wu couldn’t find the words to describe it. All she could say was that she had never experienced such pain in her life.","However, she still needed to spend a lot of effort teaching Little Phoenix how to solve the formation. She also needed to deceive Bukong and the group of injured people in front of her. Once she showed weakness, these people would pounce on her like hungry wolves and tear her into pieces with their last bit of strength.","Now, these Spiritual Overlords were already sitting cross-legged and repairing their bodies. It was only a matter of time before they recovered enough to fight.","Bukong smirked when he saw Feng Wu fall to the ground, unable to fight back.","“I thought you were so powerful, but you’re just so-so,” Bukong smirked and took a few more steps forward, getting closer and closer to Feng Wu.","The other people in the venue looked vexed!","Especially the two heads of the Hua family and the Zuo family.","“I was really fooled by Feng Wu. If I had known that she was faking it, I wouldn’t have given this opportunity to Bukong.”","The others had the same thought. At this moment, they were extremely regretful.","But at this moment, Bukong was very pleased with himself.."]},{"number":3611,"title":"Chapter 3611: The Third Eye (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3611: The Third Eye (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Little girl, since you’re already exposed, fulfill my wish.”","Feng Wu frowned. “What do you mean?","Bukong said, “I’ve already said that I’m going to kill you, a peerless genius who’s as talented as Jun Linyuan, to make my name known because I’ll be able to brag about this for the rest of my life. So, you’re going to make my wish come true!”","With that, Bukong closed in on Feng Wu again.","Having tested Feng Wu before, he was much bolder now. He was only three steps away from her.","He could pick Feng Wu up with one hand.","Little Phoenix was so anxious, but it was still trying to undo the formation according to Feng Wu’s instructions.","According to Feng Wu, it was 90% done.","She wouldn’t have to wait much longer.","However, Bukong had already attacked.","He opened his palm, and a huge ax appeared in his hand.","Bukong didn’t take out his life-bound weapon from the beginning, but now that he had finally used it, it was obvious that he was still very wary of Feng wu.","“Die!”","Bukong raised his battle axe high.","The body of the ax was half a meter long, and the blade was very sharp.","If Feng Wu was struck.. Her head would be cut off!","“Xiao wu!”","“Feng WII!”","Yu Mingye’s eyes were bloodshot!","Feng Xun banged his head against the wall in frustration!","The Spiritual Saint sent by Emperor Wu, who had been hiding in the dark, was finally ready to make his move.","He had been unwilling to make a move because if he did, it would attract the attention of the other Spiritual Saints.","A Spiritual Saint would be breaking the rules if they participated in the Spiritual Overlords’ battle. Once the rules were broken, it would cause great damage to the cultivation of this Spiritual Saint and attract other Spiritual Saints.","That was why he had kept himself hidden until Feng Wu’s life was in danger.","At that critical moment, Whoosh !","Feng Wu opened her eyes.","It wasn’t her beautiful eyes, but the spot between her eyebrows that Little Phoenix had mentioned.","The Divine Phoenix Blood had been resting between Feng Wu’s eyebrows, but now, a ball of lightning and fire was spewing out!","Puff! Puff! Puff!","Thunder spat out like a spear!","From a close distance!","It hit Bukong between his eyebrows.","Bukong panicked and tried to avoid it. However, he was too close and couldn’t react in time. Therefore, although he managed to not let the lightning hit his forehead, his right eye was still shot!","“Ahhh!!!”","Bukong let out a miserable scream!","He lost his grip on the battleax, and it fell to the ground with a clang. As for himself, he rolled on the ground and flew away from Feng Wu. He covered his right eye with both hands and was in extreme pain.","Everyone was shocked by this sudden incident.","Zuo Ming said, “Feng Wu still has a trump card at this stage! Is she even human?!”","He felt so sorry for his daughter. What could she do against such an opponent?","Hua Huaiyu also looked like he was about to collapse. “Is this girl unkillable? There’s an eye between her eyebrows! She can even shoot out lightning? No wonder she’s not afraid of what happened earlier. It turns out that the lightning was absorbed between her eyebrows!”","The others also looked at Feng Wu in shock. They had never dreamed that a person could store lightning between their eyebrows...","But because of that, they finally understood why Feng Wu wasn’t afraid of lightning.."]},{"number":3612,"title":"Chapter 3612: The Third Eye (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3612: The Third Eye (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, they had confused the cause with the effect. Feng Wu had only learned the Lightning Technique today, which was why she had the third eye.","But it didn’t matter.","The most important thing was that Bukong was sent flying away by Feng Wu’s eye.","He was covering his eye and wailing.","That hurt..","And it wasn’t just pain.","The Black and White Priest pushed Bukong’s hands away and saw that his right eye had exploded. Blood was gushing out, and he couldn’t stop it no matter what... His head was almost pierced through, so there was no way to save that eye.","The Black and White Priest wasn’t doing well either, for he was the most powerful cultivator here, and the lightning tribulation had affected him the most. As a result, he had less than 10% of his original capability left.","He had stored the spiritual essence to deal with Feng Wu, but now, it could only be used to treat Bukong.","Bukong panted in pain, but he was still shouting, “Feng Wu is like an arrow at the end of its flight. She’s not going to make it. Let’s kill her together!”","About 20 Spiritual Overlords were severely injured after the lightning tribulation, and only a few were able to move around. Hearing what Bukong said, they turned to look at Feng Wu.","Bukong shouted, “Kill her! Kill her now! Don’t you want to take revenge for your friends and brothers? She brought the lightning tribulation here on purpose!","“She deliberately set up a trap in the Zuo family and used a formation to keep all of us inside. She then used the external force to rise to the Spiritual Overlord Stage and triggered the lightning tribulation. It was all her plan!”","No one would have believed it before.","But now...","They had no choice but to believe it.","Exactly how terrifying was Feng Wu?","Hua Huaiyu stared at Feng Wu. “You’re so young, but you’re already so vicious! What will you do when you grow up?!”","Feng Wu knew that Little Phoenix would be done soon, and all she needed to do now was stall.","The best way to do that was to talk.","Although every word Feng Wu said made her shudder in pain, she still smiled calmly.","“Hua Huaiyu, how dare you say such things about me? Have you forgotten what your family is up to?” Feng Wu smirked.","Hua Huaiyu who was going to charge toward Feng Wu, but he shuddered at those words!","An unbelievable idea struck him..","No, that couldn’t be. Feng Wu couldn’t have known.","However, Feng Wu only chuckled. “Your mother is the vicious one. She wants to wipe out the entire Feng clan.”","“How did you know that?!” Hua Huaiyu stared at Feng Wu.","Zuo Ming stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “What are you staring at? The Zuo family is just as bad! The Hua family and the Zuo family have joined hands to destroy the Feng clan. Didn’t your father and mother tell you that?”","Zuo Ming glared at Feng Wu. “Who told you that?!”","Feng Wu said, “What do you think? Obviously, I have someone in your manor. As for who they are... Are you all idiots? How many people know about this plan?”","Zuo Ming turned around and stared at the chief elder of the Zuo family.","The chief elder was very capable. He was at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord Stage and was about the same level as the Black and White Priest.."]},{"number":3613,"title":"Chapter 3613: The Third Eye (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3613: The Third Eye (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The lightning tribulation had backfired on him as well, and he was lying motionlessly on the ground.","Hua Huaiyu stared at Feng Wu. “You’re trying to drive a wedge between us!” Feng Wu chuckled. “Not only do I know that the Hua family wants to destroy my clan, but I also know that your vaults have been ransacked.”","Hua Huaiyu’s heart raced.","Quite a few people might know that the Hua family’s treasures had been stolen, but only a handful knew that both the treasure halls had been robbed!","Hua Huaiyu stared at his younger brother, Hua Wuyin.","Hua Wuyin’s stomach lurched, and he had a bad feeling.","Hua Huaiyu stared at Feng Wu. “How do you know that? Are you the robber? Did you do all those things to the Hua family?!”","Little Phoenix said anxiously, “Buy us some time! I’ll only need a few moments before deactivating the formation!”","Feng Wu smiled at Hua Huaiyu. “What are you referring to? The incident where","Hua Wushuang cut off Zuo Qingxi’s body part? Or when Mrs. Hua poisoned Zuo Qingxi so that no one could testify to it? Or the fact that the Zuo family has kidnapped Hua Wushuang to question her about the Spirit Diagram Sword? Or that the Hua family tried to destroy the Feng clan to frame the Zuo family? The Hua family has also decided to slander the Zuo family for having the Spiritual Diagram Sword and use the itinerant cultivators of the Zuo family? And there’s so much more.”","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Especially Zuo Ming and Hua Huaiyu!","Zuo Ming was the head of the Zuo family, and Hua Huaiyu was the head of the Hua family. Many things could be kept from other people, but not from them, for they were the ones who carried out the plan.","Zuo Ming stared at Hua Huaiyu. “So, the Zuo family is slandering the Hua family for having the Spirit Diagram Sword! You’ve brought so many people here to destroy us! No wonder you wouldn’t listen to my explanation! Damn it!”","Hua Huaiyu said, “Why did the Zuo family kidnap Wushuang?!”","Zuo Ming said, “Zuo Qingxi is dead!”","Hua Huaiyu said, “We didn’t do it!”","“It was indeed the Hua family.” Feng Wu smiled at Hua Huaiyu and said solemnly, “I’m telling the truth.” Hua Huaiyu smirked.","Feng Wu only gave him a half-smile.","Hua Wuyin didn’t dare to meet Feng Wu’s eyes.","An idea struck him, and he stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu chuckled. “Don’t you want to know the truth about Zuo Qingxi and","Hua Wushuang? That’s right. Ask your brother. He knows everything.”","Hua Huaiyu didn’t believe it at first, but Hua Wuyin’s reaction was so strange that he stared at him. “Wuyin!”","Hua Wuyin jumped.","All the Spiritual Overlords stared at Hua Wuyin.","The battle had gone on for no reason, and they were so frustrated that they wanted to know what had started it.","Hua Wuyin already had a guilty conscience. With so many Spiritual Overlords watching, he panicked. “Brother, I...’ Hua Huaiyu glared at him. “What are you waiting for? Speak!”","But Hua Wuyin still wouldn’t say anything.","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Gosh, why are you so stubborn? I sold your daughter that medicine myself. She can’t ignore me after the scars on her face disappeared.”","Hua Wuyin suddenly looked up and stared at Feng Wu with widened eyes.."]},{"number":3614,"title":"Chapter 3614: The Third Eye (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3614: The Third Eye (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Wuji’s face is cured by you... It was you...","Only then did Hua Wuyin realize how terrifying it was.","Hua Huaiyu stared at Hua Wuyin. “What’s going on? Tell me!”","Feng Wu didn’t want to tell the truth, but in order to buy some time, she had to do it. Seeing what Hua Wuji had done, Feng Wu knew she was also a tough character. She couldn’t let Mrs. Hua train her into a second Hua Wushuang.","Feng Wu smiled at Hua Wuyin.","The others stared at him as well.","Under such pressure, Hua Wuyin couldn’t take it anymore. He dropped to his knees and cried. “Brother...’","He had no choice but to tell the truth.","As it turned out, Hua Wushuang had ruined Hua Wuji’s face and made her lose the chance to be raised by Mrs. Hua. Hua Wuji resented the Hua Wushuang for that. Now that her scar had been healed, she took her revenge on Hua","Wushuang and planned the incident between Hua Wushuang and Zuo Qingxi...","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Hua Huaiyu and Zuo Ming were shaking from head to toe. They were so shocked that they didn’t know what to say.","All Feng Wu did was treat Hua Wuji’s face with some ointment, and everything else went as planned.","Hua Wuji had her own plan, so she went to see her parents.","Hua Wuyin and his wife helped Hua Wuji out.","Hua Wushuang and Zuo Qingxi were set up by Hua Wuji and her parents.","“Hua Wuyin! I can’t believe it! How could you do such a thing?!”","Hua Huaiyu stared at Hua Wuyin and slapped him.","He had never expected this.","Nor would Mrs. Hua...","Hua Wuji was the one at fault!","Little Phoenix admired Feng Wu as it dug. She was indeed as smart as she ever was. See? She had planned to drag Hua Wuji and her family down with her from the very beginning. And now, she was stalling to buy more time for the bird. How could she be so good at making good use of useless people?","The Hua family quarreled and wasted a lot of time.","Bukong was furious.","By then, the bleeding had been stopped, and his head was clearing up.","He kicked Hua Huaiyu in frustration. “Are you out of your mind? Why are you still arguing with your family? With everything that has happened, what good will it do to find out who did it? The most important thing now is to kill Feng","Wii!”","Bukong grew anxious as he went on. “The whole thing started because Feng Wu cured your daughter’s face. Why would she tell everyone about it? Wouldn’t the Hua family and the Zuo family take their revenge if she told them? But why did she tell them now? She’s just trying to annoy you!","“Are you killed by that information? If not, why would such a smart girl expose herself? There’s only one reason!","“She’s stalling, you idiots!","“Since she’s the one who has set up this formation, of course, she has a way to solve it, but I’m guessing it’ll take time!","“Have you forgotten? Feng Wu is also guarded by Spiritual Overlords!","“Do we still have the strength to fight? If we run into other Spiritual Overlords, we’ll die!","“If you still have strength, grab Feng Wu now. Don’t kill her.. Just take her hostage!”"]},{"number":3615,"title":"Chapter 3615: Hidden Master (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3615: Hidden Master (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Bukong said, “Take Feng Wu down! Don’t let anyone get in!”","But it was too late when Bukong said that because there was a loud bang.","The Spiritual Overlords couldn’t break the wall before, but it collapsed at that moment.","The walls of the Zuo family’s courtyard began to crack.","People charged in like shooting stars.","They were Feng Xun, Yu Mingye, and the other elders.","The first thing the elders did was to control the injured Spiritual Overlords.","Feng Xun and Yu Mingye’s first reaction was to run toward Feng Wu.","They reached for Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu smiled bitterly before they could touch her. “No.”","Feng Xun and Yu Mingye stopped abruptly and looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I’ll break...’","What?","They didn’t understand it at first, but when they saw the blood oozing out of Feng Wu’s mouth, they immediately saw light.","Tears rolled down Yu Mingye’s cheeks. “Xiao Wu, I’m so sorry...”","By then, the elders had all 20-odd peak-level Spiritual Overlords under control, and General Gao was here to ask Feng Wu what to do next.","Yu Mingye was filled with hatred. “She’s like this, and you’re still asking her? She’ll die!”","One touch could break her... How much pain did the girl have to be in? Yu Mingye wanted to cry again.","Feng Wu looked at Feng Xun. “Do you remember that bottle I told you to keep?”","Feng Xun nodded. “Of course.”","Feng Wu coughed.","Blood was still oozing out of the corner of her mouth, and Yu Mingye couldn’t bring himself to see her like this. He wiped the blood off her mouth right away. Feng Wu said, “In that porcelain bottle is the Intelligence Reduction Pill.”","Feng Xun was confused. “What Intelligence Reduction Pill?”","Meanwhile, Hua Huaiyu was staring at Feng Wu. “The Intelligence Reduction Pill?! You have it? I remember that the recipe is with the Hua family. How can you have it? You —","Had Feng Wu cleared out the treasure rooms?","Feng Wu glanced at Hua Huaiyu. “I bought it from someone. As for who I bought it from...","Feng Wu smiled. “Do you think I’m going to tell you?”","Feng Wu went on talking to Feng Xun. “Feed each of them a Concentration Intelligence Reduction Pill. Make sure they digest the pill and won’t vomit it out.","“Be careful. These Spiritual Overlords may have been struck by lightning, but some of them are definitely faking it. Don’t let anyone hurt you,” Feng Wu nagged.","Feng Xun felt even more sorry for her. “You’re so badly injured. Please don’t say anything. I understand what you mean!”","After that, Feng Xun distributed the pills. The dozen or so Spiritual Overlords he brought with him all started feeding their opponents.","It wasn’t Zuo Ming’s turn yet, and he was filled with questions. “What exactly is this Intelligence Reduction Pill?”","Because Hua Huaiyu looked like he was going to lose his mind.","The others didn’t know either and were all looking at the master of the Hua family in bewilderment, although they knew instinctively that the pill wouldn’t be good news for them.","Hua Huaiyu said, “It’s the Intelligence Reduction Pill! You can tell from the name! If you eat it, your mind will go blank, and you’ll be controlled by other people. You’ll become their tool!","“Don’t eat it! Don’t eat it!” Hua Huaiyu shouted.."]},{"number":3616,"title":"Chapter 3616: Hidden Master (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3616: Hidden Master (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“This Intelligence Reduction Pill is ineffective against people of other stages, but it’s very effective against Spiritual Overlords! After eating it, the person who refined it will become your master. You’ll do whatever they tell you to do!” Hua Huaiyu stared at Bukong.","At this moment, General Gao was feeding Bukong the Intelligence Reduction Pill.","When Bukong heard this, he struggled desperately.","However, after the lightning tribulation, Bukong’s strength had been severely damaged, and Feng Wu’s lightning eye injured his right eye. He was at the end of his rope.","General Gao was at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord Stage, so he grabbed Bukong like he was holding a chick and forcefully stuffed the Intelligence Reduction Pill into his mouth.","General Gao grabbed Bukong by the throat. After the Intelligence Reduction Pill was stuffed in, he quickly tapped the acupoints around Bukong’s esophagus, and the pill slid all the way into his dantian.","General Gao placed his palm on Bukong’s abdomen and injected hot spiritual essence into Bukong. In an instant, the pill melted and flowed into Bukong’s system.","Only then did General Gao let go of Bukong.","He used to be a high and mighty peak-level Spiritual Overlord, but he was lying on the ground like an old dog at this moment. He kept retching and tried to forcefully vomit out the Intelligence Reduction Pill, but it was useless...","The Gathering Intelligence Reduction Pill had already turned into a warm current and fused with his bones and blood. Unless he bled into his body and shattered his bones, there was no way to get it out.","The Intelligence Reduction Pill would shatter a certain part in the brain, making people forget about everything except for their cultivation. They would fight to the death.","Hua Huaiyu stared at Feng Wu. He knew that the Intelligence Reduction Pill was a pill used by the royal family in the previous dynasty to raise sacrificial soldiers. However, it was lost, and the Hua family found it by accident, but they hadn’t been able to make it...","To his surprise, Feng Wu had refined it.","“You only obtained the formula in the past few days because I saw this formula three days ago. It was in my family’s treasure vault.”","The old man stared at Feng Wu with a cold look in his eyes. “Am I right to conclude that you made so many Intelligence Reduction Pills in three days?” Feng Wu neither admitted nor denied it.","Hua Huaiyu said, “You obviously came prepared. You were the one who came up with the Intelligence Reduction Pills, the formation on the wall, and the lightning tribulation! Feng Wu, you planned this massacre!” As soon as Hua Huaiyu said this, the entire place fell silent.","They had suspected so, but they didn’t dare to admit it.","Because if they admitted that they couldn’t beat a weak girl like Feng Wu even if they worked together, they would think that they were retarded.","But now, the truth was right in front of them.","Feng Wu smiled at Hua Huaiyu.","Hua Huaiyu suddenly began to laugh and cry at the same time. “I’ve spent my entire life boasting of being smart and scheming. I didn’t expect that you, a teenage girl, would make me suffer a crushing defeat!","“You’re so...","Before Hua Huaiyu could finish speaking, he was so angry that a mouthful of blood rushed out of his mouth.","The lightning tribulation nearly killed him, and his brother had disappointed him greatly. Now that Feng Wu had revealed the truth, he was on the verge of a mental breakdown.","“Ahhh","Hua Huaiyu kept vomiting blood until he dropped dead.."]},{"number":3617,"title":"Chapter 3617: Hidden Master (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3617: Hidden Master (3)","Hua Huaiyu would rather die than be controlled as a killing machine.","Bukong glared at Feng Wu, his eyes flashing with fury.","Feng Wu said calmly, “Don’t worry. I won’t force you to do anything for my personal gain. I won’t humiliate the dignity of a Spiritual Overlord. So, even if you die, you’ll die a noble death.”","Gritting his teeth, the Black and White Priest stared at Feng Wu. “What are you going to do to us?!”","Feng Wu said calmly, “On the Peace Grassland, the Spiritual Overlords of Junwu and Dongsang are fighting to the death.”","Feng Wu stopped there, but many people didn’t understand what she meant. The Black and White Priest said, “You want to send us to the battlefield?!”","Feng Wu nodded. “As I said, I’ll make sure you die an honorable death.” Everyone fell silent.","The winner takes all. They had expected that Feng Wu would let them go, but to die like this...","“What if I don’t agree?” The Black and White Priest stared at Feng Wu. “I’m begging you to let me pay a ransom for my life!”","The other Spiritual Overlords nodded along.","Feng Wu smirked. “You people... The Zuo family has colluded with the Dongsang Kingdom, and the Hua family and Firmament Palace are best friends. And there are the itinerant cultivators, who have no intention of protecting the country.","“It’s impossible for you to protect your country, so I’ll give you a chance. Isn’t it good to let you live a great life and die gloriously?”","Oh no!","The stronger these Spiritual Overlords were, the more selfish they became. They only wanted to live for themselves and didn’t want to do anything for their empire.","“Give them the pills,” Feng Wu reminded General Gao.","Hence, the second batch of Intelligence Reduction Pills was distributed. Those Spiritual Overlords kept struggling, but they couldn’t do anything.","Feng Wu sighed inwardly. Why did these people have to mess with her? Didn’t they know how fierce she could be?","Just then, Feng Wu noticed a wary look in the eyes of one of the elders Yu Mingye had brought with him.","Wary...","Feng Wu smiled and said to the Spiritual Overlords on her side, “I’ll never use the Intelligence Reduction Pill on my own people. However, if you want to kill me, don’t let me get the chance. Otherwise, I’ll stuff the pills into your mouth!”","Feng Wu had heard of the formula for the Intelligence Reduction Pill, but she had never gotten her hands on it. That was why she had gone to the palace to look for Emperor Wu, and the two of them had talked for a long time in the imperial study. Emperor Wu had told her that the formula was with the Hua family.","That was why Feng Wu had set her sights on Hua Wushuang. She pretended to be Hua Wushuang and stole the Intelligence Reduction Pill’s formula from the treasure hall. With Emperor Wu’s support, she didn’t have to worry about the ingredients. After her seclusion, Feng Wu soon made a bunch of pills.","That was one of Feng Wu’s trump cards, and she had never told anyone about it.","The elder beside Yu Mingye was relieved to hear that. He had been worried that Feng Wu would use the Intelligence Reduction Pill on them if the Junwu Empire and the Dark Dynasty became enemies one day.","More than 20 Spiritual Overlords were forcefully fed the Intelligence Reduction Pills.","The pill was gradually taking effect, slowly corroding their brains and nerves...","The fear and pain of being controlled filled their minds, making them wish they were dead. At the same time, they regretted what they had done.","Why did they have to go against Feng Wu?"]},{"number":3618,"title":"Chapter 3618: Hidden Expert (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3618: Hidden Expert (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Why did they come here to kill Feng Wu?","Why was this mission so difficult?","Why wasn’t Feng Wu dead?!","At this moment, the sky was suddenly torn apart. Two figures rushed over like lightning.","Oh no!","Feng Wu’s paled a little.","The person in the sky struck out before she reached Feng Wu.","Like a shooting star, the energy streaked across the sky toward Feng Wu’s face!","A Spiritual Saint wanted to take the life of a Spiritual Overlord.","Mrs. Hua was going to kill Feng Wu!","The spiritual essence was rampaging!","The rolling clouds were torn to pieces!","Space distorted violently because of this majestic shock wave!","The spiritual essence surged with killing intent.","“Die!”","Mrs. Hua roared!","“Watch out!”","Seeing that, Yu Mingye rushed up to Feng Wu and shielded her.","Holding Feng Wu in his arms, Feng Xun used his back as a second barrier!","“Young master!”","Knowing that they wouldn’t be able to withstand the attack, Yu Mingye’s three elders stood in front of Yu Mingye and shielded him with their own bodies.","“Prince!”","The elders of the Northern Feng Manor did the same.","General Gao and General Yuan stood in front of Feng Wu as well!","One after another, the men used their bodies as a shield to protect Feng Wu.","Mrs. Hua’s face was hideous and distorted. Her power wreaked havoc like a storm and seemed like it could destroy the world!","Just then, the Spirit Saint sent by Emperor Wu suddenly raised his sword and blocked Mrs. Hua’s path.","The people below were instantly overjoyed!","A Spirit Saint had been hiding behind Feng Wu, protecting her!","Who was this person?!","“That’s an expert sent by the imperial palace,” one of Yu Mingye’s elders whispered.","It turned out that Emperor Wu had already sent a top expert to protect Feng wu.","To everyone else, it seemed that Emperor Wu and Feng Wu were working together this time with Emperor Wu operating behind the scene to take out the Zuo family and the Hua family all at once.","Seeing this, Zuo Ming thought he understood everything. He was in despair!","He hadn’t expected Emperor Wu to be involved.","Emperor Wu wanted the Zuo family dead!","Although the Zuo family was connected to the Dongsang Kingdom, it was for self-preservation! How could Emperor Wu destroy the Zuo family? Right now, Zuo Ming hated Emperor Wu to the core!","The itinerant cultivators were all extremely depressed.","It was obvious that Emperor Wu wanted to eradicate the Hua family and the Zuo family. How could they be so stupid as to get involved in such a fight?","No wonder Feng Wu was so confident. It turned out that she was just Emperor Wu’s bait!","In reality, this girl wasn’t as smart as they thought.","“That’s true. If she really turned the tables and killed more than 40 of our Spiritual Overlords at such a young age, she would really be incredible!” Bukong and the others found an excuse to convince themselves that they weren’t stupid.","However, what they didn’t know was that Feng Wu was the one controlling the situation, and Emperor Wu had only sent a few powerful cultivators to protect Feng Wu at this critical moment.","“We won’t be able to win against Emperor Wu’s Spiritual Saint.” Bukong gritted his teeth.","Black and White Priest said, “Unless Zuo Chengfeng comes to our aid now. I wonder if Mrs. Hua has killed him."]},{"number":3619,"title":"Chapter 3619: Jun Linyuan (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3619: Jun Linyuan (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","At this critical moment, Zuo Chengfeng descended from the sky!","“OMG!”","Everyone present was shocked!","Some were haDDV. while others were sad.","Everyone on Feng Wu’s side was shocked, and the Hua family of the Zuo family was overjoyed!","All of this happened in the blink of an eye.","The Spirit Saint had blocked Mrs. Hua’s attack, but he couldn’t stop Zuo Chengfeng in time.","The people closest to him were the Spiritual Overlords sent by Emperor Wu.","Behind them were Yu Mingye’s elders.","After that were the elders of the Northern Feng Mansion.","General Gao and General Yuan were behind them.","Finally, there were Yu Mingye and Feng Xun.","The first to be sent flying was the Spiritual Overlord sent by Emperor Wu.","The fist seemed to contain endless power, and everyone was sent flying to the sides!","The Spiritual Overlords sent by Emperor Wu were the first ones taking the hit. They were seriously injured and fell to the ground.","Then there were the three elders of Yu Mingye, who were also blown away by Zuo Chengfeng’s punch!","They had already tried their best to block Zuo Chengfeng’s attack but had failed.","The difference between the Spiritual Overlord Stage and the Spirit Saint Stage was like the difference between heaven and earth.","The Spiritual Overlords that were blown away were as fragile as glass in front of Zuo Chengfeng.","Their defense was negligible to Zuo Chengfeng.","The force of the punch didn’t stop because of their obstruction. It continued to charge forward with incomparable ferocity.","The elders of Northern Feng Mansion were also sent flying.","General Gao and General Yuan couldn’t hold their ground either.","Yu Mingye and Feng Xun were also sent flying.","The power of that punch was like a volcanic eruption!","It was unstoppable!","Killing intent soared to the sky!","Energy ran wild!","Zuo Chengfeng’s fist was about to reach Feng Wu!","“Xiao wu!”","Feng Xun cried out in shock!","He knew that Feng Wu had suffered serious internal injuries.","The energy of the punch only brushed past them, and they were almost torn to pieces.","Xiao Wu was already so badly injured. What should she do?","Zuo Ming was ecstatic. Finally, his father was here!","“We’re safe!”","Zuo Ming had been forced to swallow the Intelligence Reduction Pill, and now that he knew that Emperor Wu was going to destroy the Zuo family, he was overwhelmed. When he saw his father return, he was indescribably excited. The other Spiritual Overlords were also overjoyed. The pill had yet to take its full effect. They thought they still had a chance.","The Dugu family.","Dugu Ling looked at his father.","“Father, do you think Feng Wu will die?”","Seeing Zuo Chengfeng throw a punch at Feng Wu, Dugu Ling was curious.","It was just that Feng Wu was such a lucky girl. It seemed that no one could kill her, and her attackers always died so easily.","Old Master Dugu stroked his beard and smiled. “If she doesn’t die this time, it means that she’s the chosen one. Our family won’t dare to go against fate. Don’t worry, she’ll definitely die.”","How could Zuo Chengfeng, a Spirit Saint, not be able to deal with a little girl? Dugu Jue didn’t think that would happen.","However, in the next moment!","Soaring sword energy attacked like an angry dragon!","“Stop!”","The voice that came with the sword was like a thunderclap.","A streak of sword energy flew over from the distant eastern horizon at lightning speed.","It didn’t collide with the fist. Instead, it wrapped around the fist energy and turned it into a ball before kicking it in the direction where the punch came from. That was where Zuo Chengfeng was.","It could create a violent explosion.","The ball moved unbelievably fast.","Spiritual energy whizzed!"]},{"number":3620,"title":"Chapter 3620: Jun Linyuan (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3620: Jun Linyuan (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The air seemed to contort.","Boom! The most violent fist energy smashed toward Zuo Chengfeng, and the Old Master of the Zuo family couldn’t dodge it in time. His chest was hit, and the ball of power sank deep into his chest!","Only then did the tall figure slowly land in front of Feng Wu.","The teenager was nimble, handsome, and had twinkling eyes.","He turned to look at Feng Wu with a frown and looked concerned. In the end, he only said, “I went to the Firmament Palace.”","It was as if those words could explain why he hadn’t been around for a while.","Feng Wu took the hint right away.","For a moment, she felt conflicted.","With Jun Linyuan here, the battle was practically over.","The teenager stared at Zuo Chengfeng with a cold look in his eyes.","With a wave of his hand, he drew out Sky Destroyer.","There was only one Sky Destroyer, but it was as if ten thousand swol shooting out at the same time.","The sword energy was so powerful that it could make rivers roar, mountains collapse, and the ground crack. The sky seemed to change color.","Everyone was astonished.","The Dugu family.","Dugu Ling asked, “Father, are we still going to fight Feng Wu?”","Dugu Jue was speechless.","So was everyone else!","Zuo Ming had only just had a little hope, but it was extinguished before he could enjoy the moment.","“Jun Linyuan! Why is he here?!”","“Why is Jun Linyuan here? Why?!” Zuo Ming scratched his head. Bukong frowned. “Why would Jun Linyuan help Feng Wu?”","Zuo Ming gave Bukong a “you idiot” look. “You don’t know?”","Bukong asked, “What don’t I know?”","Zuo Ming said, “I hate to admit it, but Jun Linyuan is in love with Feng Wu. I’m sure you know that.”","Bukong was astonished. “Shit! How am I supposed to know that? I’m only a Spiritual Overlord, and I don’t know about such petty gossip! I would never have come here if I knew that Jun Linyuan was in love with Feng Wu! Jun Linyuan is so... Forget it.”","The Black and White Priest took a deep breath. “Is Jun Linyuan really in love with Feng Wu?”","Zuo Ming nodded repeatedly. “He really does.”","The Black and White Priests fell silent.","Bukong glanced at the Black and White Priests and said, “A few years ago, we couldn’t even withstand a single strike from Jun Linyuan. But now, we’re bold enough to try to kill his woman? We must have a death wish!” The Black and White Priest didn’t know what to say.","Zuo Ming asked, “Have you been beaten up by Jun Linyuan?”","Bukong smirked. “You sound as if you’ve never been beaten up by him before.”","Zuo Ming said, “I really haven’t...’","As soon as he said that, Bukong smirked. “Isn’t the Zuo family planning to destroy the Feng clan? Now that Jun Linyuan is here, you’ll get your ass kicked. Well, Jun Linyuan doesn’t beat people up. He only kills them.”","Master Zuo’s heart sank.","At the same time...","Feng Xun and Yu Mingye were so excited that they almost burst into tears.","“Jun Linyuan is finally here. If he hadn’t come, Xiao Wu would have been dead by now!” Yu Mingye was genuinely frightened this time, and tears rolled down his cheeks.","Feng Xun was equally shaken. “Although I had a feeling that Boss Jun would be here in time, he was almost late. We’re so lucky..”"]},{"number":3621,"title":"Chapter 3621: Jun Linyuan (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3621: Jun Linyuan (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Wait!”","With a wave of Jun Linyuan’s hand, spiritual essence fluctuated violently, and he charged at Zuo Chengfeng!","Yu Mingye turned around and glared at Feng Xun. “Is Jun Linyuan hitting Zuo Chengfeng?!”","Feng Xun looked at him in bewilderment. ‘What’s so strange about that?”","Yu Mingye said, “But... Zuo Chengfeng is a Spiritual Saint, isn’t he?”","Feng Xun said, “That’s right.”","Yu Mingye said, “But Jun Linyuan is hitting Zuo Chengfeng.”","Feng Xun asked, “What’s wrong with that?”","Yu Mingye said, “What’s wrong with that? It’s such a big deal! Tell me, what level is Jun Linyuan now?!”","Feng Xun said, “A Spiritual Saint, of course.”","Yu Mingye said, “Ahhh! I don’t want to hear it! Stop talking!”","Feng Xun found the Yu Mingye idiotic.","He knew why Yu Mingye had such a big reaction, for the little idiot had been comparing himself to Jun Linyuan, thinking that he was second only to Jun","Linyuan. As it turned out, Jun Linyuan had just become a Spiritual Saint, while Yu Mingye...","He was only a junior Spiritual Overlord.","Feng Xun felt sorry for Yu Mingye. “Of all the people you can think of, you have to compare yourself to Boss Jun. Don’t you know that he’s not like the rest of us? Don’t you know that he’s the Chosen One? He’s already a Spiritual Saint...”","Yu Mingye said, “Stop it! Stop it!”","Rubbing his nose, Feng Xun found Yu Mingye rather adorable at times. He then turned to look at his invincible Boss Jun.","Right now, Jun Linyuan was right in front of Zuo Chengfeng.","With a cold look in his eyes, the teenager grabbed Zuo Chengfeng with his left hand.","He clenched his right fist.","He didn’t give Zuo Chengfeng any chance to fight back. He picked up the old Spiritual Saint, who had been showing off his power for years, and punched him as if he was picking up a chicken.","He punched Zuo Chengfeng in the stomach.","All eyes were on Jun Linyuan’s right hand.","The hand seemed to have enough power to destroy heaven and earth!","The spiritual essence in the air seemed to distort and shatter with each punch!","Heaven and earth seemed to be shaken by his punch.","The teenager was too powerful.","There was no expression on his face, and the look in his eyes was as sharp as a sword. His eyes were so intimidating that the other people’s legs were trembling, and they wanted to kneel down at his feet.","Old Master Dugu suddenly rose to his feet and stared at the scene with bloodshot eyes.","Zuo Chengfeng was about the same level as Old Master Dugu, and Jun Linyuan had beaten Zuo Chengfeng up like beating up a chicken. Naturally, he could do the same to Dugu Jue. Old Master Dugu looked at Zuo Chengfeng as if he was looking at himself.","Just then, Jun Linyuan turned his sharp gaze on Dugu Jue.","Dugu Ling felt as if he had been stabbed between the eyebrows.","The water pattern exploded.","“Father!”","Seeing his father stumble, Dugu Ling reached out to steady him. Dugu Jue spat out a mouthful of blood when Dugu Ling steadied him.","“Father!” Master Dugu was exasperated.","Dugu Jue waved his hand, indicating that he was alright. However, his back was hunched, and he looked ten years older.","“What a capable teenager...”","Dugu Jue wiped the corner of his mouth and looked like he was crying. To Dugu Ling, his father looked so miserable.."]},{"number":3622,"title":"Chapter 3622: Jun Linyuan (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3622: Jun Linyuan (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Dugu Jue knew that Jun Linyuan had realized that he was watching through the water image, and that stare was a warning.","Of course, he wouldn’t look at Jun Linyuan again, but when he thought about Jun Linyuan’s capability, he felt so helpless.","One could say that Jun Linyuan had grown up under Dugu Jue’s watch.","More than a decade ago, he could easily break that boy’s neck. Now, that boy was capable enough to shake heaven and earth.","“How many people in the Junwu Empire are his match now? What about in the future?” Dugu Jue asked in despair.","“Father... Is Jun Linyuan that terrifying? What about the second prince...”","The Dugu family was where the second prince’s mother came from, and they had always supported him.","The second prince was so confident because he had the support of his grandfather, who was a Spiritual Saint.","Dugu Jue was filled with despair.","Recalling how relentless Jun Linyuan had been and how he had punched Zuo Chengfeng repeatedly, he closed his eyes and told Dugu Ling, “Tell your sister to give up on the throne.”","Dugu Ling shouted in astonishment, “Father!”","Dugu Jue didn’t want to explain further.","In a battle between Spiritual Saints, Jun Linyuan alone was more than enough to take on several Spiritual Saints like himself.","Dugu Jue couldn’t understand it. When Jun Linyuan fought Zuo Chengfeng last time, Zuo Chengfeng was at a disadvantage, but there wasn’t much difference in their cultivation levels.","Because Zuo Chengfeng had severely injured Jun Linyuan as well.","But it was different this time. Zuo Chengfeng couldn’t fight back at all.","He couldn’t even withstand Jun Linyuan’s first strike.","That was incredible! Duqu Jue was furious and desperate.","At the scene —","The people there felt the same way as Dugu Jue did.","Jun Linyuan’s fist was glinting and crackling with electric arcs. He was unbelievably powerful.","“Hm...’","Zuo Chengfeng couldn’t take it anymore and spat out a mouthful of blood.","“Let go of my father! Now!” Zuo Ming shouted.","The Spiritual Overlords of the Zuo family, the Hua family, and the itinerant cultivators all looked at Jun Linyuan as if he was a friend.","Jun Linyuan didn’t seem to hear anything. The thought of Zuo Chengfeng trying to kill Feng Wu made him want to kill the old man.","Thump!","In the end, Jun Linyuan punched Zuo Chengfeng in the head. The old master of the Zuo family, who had been tough all his life, shuddered violently and passed out.","Jun Linyuan let go, and Zuo Chengfeng fell from the sky.","There was a loud bang, and the impact created a big pit in the ground.","Meanwhile, Jun Linyuan was charging toward Mrs. Hua.","The mysterious Spiritual Saint from the imperial palace had always been protecting Emperor Wu. This time, Emperor Wu had asked him to protect Feng Wu, but Emperor Wu risked his own life.","If someone saw through that plan and tried to assassinate Emperor Wu now...","The mysterious Spiritual Saint nodded at Jun Linyuan and disappeared.","Mrs. Hua narrowed her eyes when she saw Jun Linyuan. Naturally, she had seen how Jun Linyuan dealt with Zuo Chengfeng. She immediately said, “Jun Linyuan, your grandmother has spoken. You’re the future grandson-in-law of the Hua family. Our families...”","However, Mrs. Hua’s opening line, which was supposed to be a way to show her connection with the empress dowager, completely infuriated Jun Linyuan.","With a cold look in his eyes, the teenager struck down at Mrs. Hua with his Sky Destroyer.","The Sky Destroyer shone with a mesmerizing blood-red light.."]},{"number":3623,"title":"Chapter 3623: His Royal Highness (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3623: His Royal Highness (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Sky Destroyer created a river of blood and struck down at Mrs. Hua. Mrs. Hua stared at Jun Linyuan. “Jun Linyuan, how dare you?!”","Mrs. Hua was very close to the empress dowager and thought that Jun Linyuan wouldn’t dare to touch her. However, she didn’t expect Jun Linyuan to be so merciless.","A streak of blood-red light swept across the air and reached Mrs. Hua in no time!","The blade was aimed at her heart.","Blood gushed out of Mrs. Hua’s chest like fireworks.","“Mother!”","With Hua Huaiyu dead, Hua Wuyin wailed.","“Grandma!”","Hua Wushuang, who had been confused, woke up as well.","Her mouth fell open.","That was her grandmother, the pillar of the Hua family. She was a Spiritual Saint, but she had been stabbed without being able to fight back!","And they weren’t the only ones that were astonished.","Even Mrs. Hua herself didn’t have time to react.","Looking down at the Sky Destroyer that had pierced her chest and was pulled out, she was dumbfounded when she saw the blood. “You’re not twenty yet...”","He was so young, but his capability was so terrifying!","Jun Linyuan stood in mid-air, and the Sky Destroyer seemed to have the power to destroy heaven and earth.","He stared at the pillar of the empire as if he was looking at a dead person.","“You shouldn’t have picked on her.” The crown prince was as taciturn as ever.","He stared at the old lady, who was a Spiritual Saint, and the look in his eyes gave one the creeps.","Mrs. Hua looked from her wound to Jun Linyuan and smiled in despair. “So, are you really going to kill me because of that girl?”","The crown prince looked at the Spiritual Saint and asked, “Who are you again?”","Mrs. Hua was surprised, but she seemed to realize something and burst into laughter.","As she guffawed, blood gushed out.","Yu Mingye was confused. He nudged Feng Xun with his elbow. “Hey, what’s that supposed to mean? Why is that old lady so mad?”","The others pricked up their ears as well because they didn’t understand it either.","Feng Xun snapped, “What’s there to be confused about?","“What Boss Jun means is that the old lady is nothing to him. Of course, he’s going to kill her for Feng Wu. Feng Wu is his girl. Who the hell does the old lady think she is? The empress dowager’s childhood friend? Haha! I’m sorry, but even his best friends don’t dare to pick on Feng Wu. Why did the empress dowager’s friend think she could?”","Yu Mingye looked at Feng Xun in resignation. “You’re humiliating the Hua family. You know that?”","Feng Xun looked over his shoulder and saw that everyone was indeed listening, especially the Hua family. They were infuriated by his explanation... Anyway, Hua Wuyin was already vomiting blood.","Feng Xun shrugged. “That’s what I meant. Otherwise, why was Mrs. Hua so angry? Well, that’s the way it is. If she wants to take advantage of her seniority, she has to have some dignity first. She wanted to kill Xiao Wu, but she’s also asking Boss Jun to respect her. How shameless!”","The Hua family was furious.","However...","Right now, the Hua family was defenseless. They could only listen to Feng Xun, but couldn’t fight back.","“What are you talking about? I’m the crown prince’s fiancee! Feng Wu is nothing! Don’t be ridiculous!”"]},{"number":3624,"title":"Chapter 3624: His Royal Highness (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hua Wushuang snapped back to her senses and scolded Feng Xun.","Feng Xun, Yu Mingye, and the others all looked at Hua Wushuang strangely. Was there something wrong with this woman’s head?","Hua Wushuang could only remember the last time she fought Feng Wu. Since then, she had been defeated and locked up. Later, Feng Wu confused her memory, so she didn’t know what happened after that.","Seeing that Jun Linyuan wanted to kill her grandmother, Hua Wushuang jumped to her feet and waved at him. “Jun Linyuan, you can’t kill my grandmother! ”","However, the crown prince ignored her.","The Sky Destroyer’s energy was awe-inspiring, and its killing intent soared!","Mrs. Hua was powerless to defend herself and was stabbed in the chest again. More blood spurted out.","Hua Wushuang flushed and yelled at Jun Linyuan, “Jun Linyuan, you can’t do that! That’s my grandmother! She’ll be your grandmother in the future! How can you be so disrespectful?!”","However, apart from attracting the strange looks of everyone, her pleading was useless.","“Wushuang...” Hua Wuyin wanted to remind Hua Wushuang not to embarrass herself again. The crown prince really liked Feng Wu, and she had always been the one he liked.","Hua Wuyin didn’t expect that he would really say this aloud in a moment of desperation.","Hua Wushuang stared at her uncle. “No matter what, the crown prince is already my fiancé. How can he do that to the Hua family?! Even if he likes Feng Wu, he can just take her as his concubine! I’m the real wife!”","Feng Wu looked at Hua Wushuang as if she was retarded.","She had indeed given Hua Wushuang hallucinogens, but she didn’t mess with Hua Wushuang’s intelligence. Why did she sound like an idiot?","Mrs. Hua heard Hua Wushuang crying, so she was sure that Jun Linyuan heard it too.","Mrs. Hua looked at Jun Linyuan. “Did you hear that?”","The crown prince frowned and ignored Mrs. Hua’s words.","Despair filled Mrs. Hua’s heart. “Can’t you hear the cry of a girl who loves you to the bone? Jun Linyuan, you’re so cruel.’","Frowning, Jun Linyuan looked at Mrs. Hua in confusion. “Who are you talking about?”","Mrs. Hua’s chest tightened. “Wushuang, your fiancée.”","The crown prince frowned. “The empress dowager said so?”","Mrs. Hua almost fainted.","When the two of them were fighting, they didn’t lower their voices, so everyone below could hear them.","Mrs. Hua gritted her teeth. “You should honor your grandmother’s decision regarding your marriage...”","As a matter of fact, the empress dowager was interrupted before she could","make the announcement. Right now, Mrs. Hua was just trying to trick Jun Linyuan.","Seeing the frown on Jun Linyuan’s face, Mrs. Hua was relieved. Jun Linyuan really had no idea.","Mrs. Hua said, “You can kill me, but I only want one thing from you. Treat Wushuang well. She’s innocent. Let her bear your children and live safely.” Those were her last words.","She made herself look rather noble. For the future of the Hua clan, she was willing to die.","However...","The crown prince stared at Mrs. Hua coldly. “Don’t you know?”","Mrs. Hua looked at Jun Linyuan in confusion.","The crown prince said, “If the empress dowager’s promise is worth anything, there are at least a hundred wives in my residence now..”"]},{"number":3625,"title":"Chapter 3625: His Royal Highness (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3625: His Royal Highness (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","What did he mean by that?","Staring at Jun Linyuan, Mrs. Hua had a bad feeling.","Jun Linyuan said calmly, “I don’t know if the empress dowager made a promise, but even if she did, why would you believe her?”","Mrs. Hua asked, “Why...”","Jun Linyuan said, “If her promise is worth anything, I’ll have hundreds of wives by now. Didn’t the empress dowager tell you that?”","Mrs. Hua was speechless.","Jun Linyuan frowned. “The empress dowager didn’t even tell you that. How close can you be?”","Mrs. Hua was shocked.","Jun Linyuan smirked. “That’s what you get for using the empress dowager to intimidate me!”","As he said that, Jun Linyuan slashed at Mrs. Hua’s neck with the Sky Destroyer!","For a moment, a blood mist that was as dazzling as fireworks splattered in the sky.","Mrs. Hua’s eyes widened, and she glared at Jun Linyuan. Meanwhile, her head was completely separated from her body.","Thump!","Mrs. Hua’s body fell to the ground first.","Then, there was another bang. Her head fell to the ground and bounced over Zuo Chengfeng’s feet.","Zuo Chengfeng stared at Jun Linyuan in disbelief.","He did... He actually did it...","Jun Linyuan sheathed his sword and flew through the air. When everyone looked up, he had already landed in front of Feng Wu.","The young man was surrounded by terrifying ripples of energy that emitted destructive pressure.","“Grandma!”","Hua Wushuang almost fainted when she saw the decapitated Mrs. Hua.","She rushed over and held Mrs. Hua’s headless body. “Grandmother!","Grandmother!”","She was really going to break down.","“What the hell is going on?","“What happened?","“Why did they fight? What’s all this about?”","Hua Wushuang was on the verge of losing her mind. She looked at Jun Linyuan in despair. “The empress dowager is going to make us husband and wife! Isn’t the Hua family part of the royal family now? Why did you kill my grandmother? I’m your fiancée! How could you do this to me? Jun Linyuan, how could you?!”","However, Jun Linyuan acted as if she wasn’t there.","He didn’t even flinch as he stared at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun said in a hurry, “Boss Jun, don’t listen to Hua Wushuang. What fiancée? There’s no such thing! The empress dowager never announced anything like that!”","Hua Wushuang’s face paled. The empress dowager indeed hadn’t announced anything, but...","“Look at the dragon and phoenix jade bracelet. The empress dowager gave it to me. She said that it represented the crown prince’s consort. I already...” However, before she could finish, Jun Linyuan’s eyes widened.","The dragon and phoenix jade bracelet on Hua Wushuang’s fair wrist shattered with a crack, and it turned into a powder that scattered onto the ground. “Ah!” Hua Wushuang screamed, “My bracelet! My bracelet!” However, she only had a handful of powder in her hand left. The bracelet was","“Your Royal Highness...” Hua Wushuang was desperate.","Ever since her grandmother proposed to marry her off to the crown prince, she had been dreaming about it. She had dreamed about the son of her and Jun Linyuan taking the throne. When she saw the crown prince, she was even more infatuated with him, but now, she had finally woken up from that dream.","Jun Linyuan showed the empress dowager no respect. He said straightforwardly, “Since the empress dowager promised you that, you can ask her to find you a husband. There’s only one person I’ll ever marry!” Under everyone’s gaze, Jun Linyuan turned around and stared at Feng Wu.."]},{"number":3626,"title":"Chapter 3626: His Royal Highness (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3626: His Royal Highness (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","No one here was a fool.","Not only that, but they were also the smartest people in the empire. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have cultivated the Spiritual Overlord Stage.","They followed Jun Linyuan’s gaze and looked at Feng Wu. All of a sudden, they understood everything.","Feng Wu felt uncomfortable under Jun Linyuan’s gaze.","What was that supposed to mean? Why was Jun Linyuan staring at her? It was as if she was his...","Jun Linyuan stared at the red-dressed girl’s flushed face, and only then did he turn to look at Hua Wushuang. “You’re not even fit to carry my shoes, and you want to be my wife? Are all people of the Hua family so delusional?”","No matter how much Hua Wushuang lied to herself, she had to face reality now.","She looked at Jun Linyuan in despair. “Your Royal Highness, have you never cared about me?”","Jun Linyuan gave her a strange look as if he couldn’t understand why she would ask such a question.","Hua Wushuang was extremely embarrassed!","If she couldn’t win his heart, what about...","“What about Zuo Qingluan? Your Royal Highness must have feelings for her.” Hua Wushuang wanted to humiliate Feng Wu.","However...","The crown prince, who had always been a taciturn person, seemed to have figured something out after his return. He kept his eyes on Feng Wu as he answered Hua Wushuang.","In the past, he wouldn’t even bother to answer. He would just draw his sword.","The teenager stared at Feng Wu with his bright eyes and asked calmly, “Zuo Qingluan? Who’s that?”","Everyone was too familiar with these words.","That was what the crown prince liked to ask when he didn’t like someone.","So what he meant was...","Hua Wushuang shook her head in shock. “That’s impossible! Everyone says the crown prince is crazy about Sister Qingluan and loves her as much as his life!”","Many people turned to look at Jun Linyuan.","That’s right. They had all heard of it before.","Hua Wushuang pointed at Jun Linyuan. “Your Royal Highness, you’re replacing your old love with new ones. You’ve found a new lover and abandoned Sister Qingluan. Don’t you think that’s a disgrace to your reputation as the crown prince? And that bitch who seduced you, how dare she...’","Hua Wushuang’s words infuriated Jun Linyuan.","Feng Xun frowned as well. It was strange that Hua Wushuang wanted to die when she could live.","As expected, in the next moment...","Jun Linyuan was furious!","He raised his finger slightly, the pressure made everything feel that they couldn’t breathe!","Staring at Hua Wushuang, Jun Linyuan gave her a cold look.","He said, “You’ve succeeded in pissing me off.”","Hua Wushuang panicked when she met Jun Linyuan’s cold eyes... She regretted her carelessness, but it was too late.","The next second, Jun Linyuan pulled out Feng Xun’s sword and threw it at her.","The blade sank into Hua Wushuang’s chest!","The crown prince said in an emotionless voice, “No one is allowed to slander her.”","Her? Who was he referring to? “Zuo Qingluan is nothing!”","Jun Linyuan said indifferently.","So, he definitely wasn’t referring to Zuo Qingluan.","“I didn’t care about the stories you made up before, but from now on I’ll kill anyone who does that again!” Jun Linyuan turned around and stared at Feng Xun. “Got it?!”","Feng Xun nodded immediately. “I’ll keep that in mind.”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say much, but it was obvious what he meant!","Zuo Ming was so embarrassed that he wanted to dig a hole and hide in it.."]},{"number":3627,"title":"Chapter 3627: End of Battle (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3627: End of Battle (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zuo Ming was so embarrassed that he wanted to dig a hole and hide in it.","Only the Zuo family knew that the crown prince had been in love with Feng Wu the whole time. Zuo Qingluan had to turn her unrequited love into a love story...","The crown prince hadn’t cared about the rumor before, but now, Hua Wushuang had forced him to clarify things.","Zuo Qingluan’s reputation would be ruined!","At that thought, Zuo Ming’s hatred for Hua Wushuang surged. Hearing this, the surrounding people were dumbfounded.","so...","Was everything Zuo Qingluan’s wishful thinking? Had she spread the rumor herself? That was really..","Hua Wushuang was also shocked. She really didn’t expect that the sacred lady of the Firmament Palace would do such a thing...","No one would question Jun Linyuan’s words because he was too powerful to lie.","The surroundings were silent and it was a little awkward.","Ignoring Hua Wushuang, Jun Linyuan asked Feng Xun, “What’s going on with these people?”","Jun Linyuan was asking about the itinerant cultivators, the Spiritual Overlords.","Feng Xun knew that Boss Jun was away on an errand and didn’t know much about the current situation. He told Boss Jun about how the Zuo family and the Hua family had joined forces to exterminate the Feng clan while he was away and how Feng Wu was wanted by the entire continent.","The more Feng Xun said the more intimidating Jun Linyuan became. Everyone was terrified.","They had no intention of fighting back against someone as powerful as Jun Linyuan... It was hopeless!","“I thought it was only the Zuo family and the Hua family. I didn’t know there were so many of them.” Jun Linyuan frowned.","Feng Xun asked, “Then these people...”","They were all Spiritual Overlords!","There weren’t many itinerant cultivators in the Spiritual Overlord Stage, to begin with. It was really rare for so many of them to gather here.","Bukong’s heart skipped a beat. He would rather be sent to the battlefield than be stared at by Jun Linyuan as if he was a dead man. The fear was worse than dying.","“Kill them all.” Jun Linyuan waved his hand.","Killing over twenty Spiritual Overlords? That was a big deal!","Even Emperor Wu wouldn’t be able to do something like that. At that moment, someone walked up to Jun Linyuan. “Your Royal Highness.” It was Qin Yan, the captain of Emperor WII’s personal guards.","He greeted Jun Linyuan and told him about Emperor Wu’s order. “His Majesty said... these people will be brought to the Peace Grassland.”","Jun Linyuan stared at Commander Qin with a cold look in his eyes.","Qin Yan didn’t dare meet Jun Linyuan’s eyes because there was a murderous look in those eyes.","It probably wasn’t directed at him...","It should be for His Majesty.","Qin Yan said, “That’s part of Miss Feng Wu’s plan. She’s already made arrangements for the Spiritual Overlords. ”","Apart from one person, no one could change Jun Linyuan’s decision.","When Jun Linyuan turned to look at Feng Wu, there was no coldness in his eyes.","“Do you have any plans for them?” When he looked at the girl in the red dress, there was a tender look in his eyes.","No one could deny the fact that Jun Linyuan was in love with Feng Wu when they saw his expression.","Everyone could tell what the crown prince was thinking. Unfortunately, it was too late for them to see that.","Bukong pounded his chest and stomped his feet. “I was tricked by Zuo","Qingluan!”","If Zuo Qingluan hadn’t been spreading false rumors to make them believe that Jun Linyuan liked her and not Feng Wu... If they had known that Jun Linyuan treated Feng Wu that way...","How would they dare to come here?","How would they dare to try to kill Feng Wu?"]},{"number":3628,"title":"Chapter 3628: End of Battle (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3628: End of Battle (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Not only would they not dare to kill Feng Wu, but they would also worship her as their little Master.","Jun Linyuan’s gaze was so intense that Feng Wu felt a little awkward.","“Yes,” she replied. “I’ve already made arrangements for them. Feed them the Intelligence Reduction Pill and let them defend the Junwu Empire on the Peace Grassland.","“If they’re lucky enough to survive, they can atone for their sins. Once the Dongsang Kingdom is defeated, I’ll give them the antidote and let their minds recover.”","Feng Wu’s breathing was unsteady when she said that, and she was trembling a little.","When Jun Linyuan wasn’t around, Feng Wu had to hide her weakness because she couldn’t afford to let it show. Otherwise, everything would go out of control.","No one knew if the Dugu family’s Old Master would participate. If he did, things would go south for her.","Hence, Feng Wu tried her best not to show any pain on her face.","But now that Jun Linyuan was here...","Feng Wu couldn’t take it anymore and fell to the side...","Jun Linyuan reacted quickly and scooped Feng Wu up into his arms.","“She’s hurt!” Yu Mingye rushed over and said to Jun Linyuan in a hurry. “She’s badly hurt. You’ll make it worse. Let me carry her!”","However, Jun Linyuan didn’t even glance at Yu Mingye. Resting a hand on Feng Wu’s back, he infused his spiritual essence into her body and checked her insides.","Jun Linyuan’s face turned livid.","He had never been so angry before!","Feng Wu could feel Jun Linyuan’s murderous intent!","“Don’t kill them... Help me...” Feng Wu fell into Jun Linyuan’s arms, feeling that all the tension and anxiety had been relieved. She didn’t need to hang on even though she was in so much pain.","“It hurts...” Her lips were dry and pale.","Jun Linyuan turned around and stared at the people around him.","All those people were under the crown prince’s murderous gaze!","He had the power to kill them all.","He only needed to raise his hand, and his spiritual essence would erupt, turning everyone to dust. He really had the power to destroy the world!","“It hurts...” Feng Wu tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve and looked at him pitifully.","In the end, his anger was stopped by the look in her doe-like eyes. He took a deep breath and said, “I’ll spare you lot for the time being.”","Who was he referring to?","Did he mean the Zuo family, the Hua family, and the other Spiritual Overlords?","General Gao and General Yuan felt a little uneasy too.","Jun Linyuan carried Feng Wu and soared into the sky, disappearing without a trace.","They arrived at Jun Linyuan’s residence, which was near the imperial city.","He never went to his residence in the palace and only lived in the mansion outside.","“Granny Gong, prepare some hot water.”","Feng hurried in after Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan turned around and stared at Feng with a cold look in his eyes.","Feng knew that Jun Linyuan was blaming him for not staying by Feng Wu’s side.","“The Zuo family is working with the Dongsang Kingdom. Whenever the Zuo family makes a move, the Sun Castle will take action,” the steward said in resignation. “What happened this time was the same as last time.”","The steward added- “Von went to the Firmament Palace If I hadn’t gone to","Nest, it would have been destroyed now..”"]},{"number":3629,"title":"Chapter 3629: End of Battle (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3629: End of Battle (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The look on Jun Linyuan’s face was as grim as ever, and the pressure he exerted was terrifying.","He refused to see Feng, so the steward had to rub his nose and wait outside.","Granny Gong had finished preparing the hot water, and when she passed by the door, she saw the steward and couldn’t help but glance at him.","Feng shook his head. Jun Linyuan was still in a state of rage. It would be fine if Feng Wu could recover, but if she couldn’t... Emperor Wu would be in trouble.","Jun Linyuan put Feng Wu on the bed and examined her carefully.","When they were at the Zuo family’s house, Jun Linyuan had only done a cursory check. But now, he went from Feng Wu’s hair to the last acupuncture point on the sole of her foot. After that, the teenager fell silent.","She was like a ragged doll.","The girl on the bed had her eyes closed, and her face was pale. Even her breathing was so weak that it almost stopped.","Once she relaxed, her heartbeat would be negligible. It would only beat once after a long time to maintain the most basic vital function.","She was still alive, but her body was already in a rotten state. It was even worse than a 100-year-old man who had never cultivated.","Granny Gong carefully wiped Feng Wu’s body as if she were a porcelain doll. She didn’t dare move too much, for fear that she would break the porcelain doll in her hand.","Seeing the frown on Jun Linyuan’s face and sensing his mood, Granny Gong knew that the situation was dire.","“Miss Wu... how is she?” Granny Gong was very concerned.","Jun Linyuan pursed his lips and looked anxious. He shook his head. “It’s much worse than I thought.”","“Is it... life-threatening?” Granny Gong asked. Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything. His face was grim.","“Should we call Master Chu over?” Granny Gong asked. Jun Linyuan frowned. “He’s not good enough.”","Granny Gong said, “Then Master Linghu is our only option.”","Jun Linyuan shook his head. “Master Linghu is in seclusion somewhere. I can’t find him. ”","Granny Gong was in despair.","Staring at Granny Gong, Jun Linyuan said, “No one is allowed to disturb me for the next three days. Don’t knock on my door even if the empire is falling apart!”","Granny Gong was shocked. Was it that serious?","Without another word, Granny Gong nodded and left in silence.","After Granny Gong left, Jun Linyuan helped Feng Wu up and sat her down cross-legged on the bed, while he sat down opposite her.","He raised Feng Wu’s slender hand and slashed a dagger across it. Blood oozed out of her palm, and it smelled like burnt flesh.","Jun Linyuan closed his eyes, took a deep breath, and finally calmed down.","He cut Feng Wu’s other hand as well.","After that, he did the same to his palms.","He pressed his palms against hers, and a ray of light passed from his hands to her body.","At first, the light was thin because he was afraid that Feng Wu wouldn’t be able to withstand it.","But slowly, the lustrous light began to increase in number and speed. In the end, it stopped at a steady pace.","If anyone outside saw this...","If a Spirit Saint saw this scene, he would definitely go crazy! Only a Spiritual Saint could refine the Spiritual Saint Liquid.","It could repair the body and soul.","A Spirit Saint wouldn’t have too much of it. A junior one might have one or two drops, an intermediate one might have dozens of drops, and a senior one might have over a hundred or maybe more, but there was a limit. The Spiritual Saint Liquid was the life force of a Spirit Saint.."]},{"number":3630,"title":"Chapter 3630: End of Battle (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3630: End of Battle (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Spiritual Saint Liquid was the life force of a Spiritual Saint.","But now, Jun Linyuan was passing the Spiritual Saint Liquid to Feng Wu, and he didn’t hold back at all.","The Spiritual Saint Liquid kept flowing out and floating in the air. There were even wisps that floated out of the house and into the courtyard.","Granny Gong was talking to the steward in a low voice when the latter’s eyes widened.","Granny Gong asked, “What’s with that look on your face?","She was just asking if Miss Wu’s life was in danger, but Feng actually glared at her. It was as if she was asking a retarded question.","Staring at the Spiritual Saint Liquid, Feng waved his hand, and the liquid reached his palm.","The steward took a look at it, and his face was grim.","“What did His Royal Highness tell you?” He stared at Granny Gong.","Granny Gong said, “His Royal Highness said that no one should disturbed in the next three days even if the empire is falling apart.”","Feng said, “He really is.. ”","Granny Gong looked at the steward in confusion.","Feng opened his hand and gave Granny Gong the drop of Spiritual Saint Liquid. “He’s given his own Spiritual Saint Liquid to Feng Wu. A Spiritual Saint without the Spiritual Saint Liquid means he’ll have no replenishment in battle. If the enemy finds out, they’ll set up a trap to kill him!","“Furthermore, the Spiritual Saint Liquid contains his cultivation principle. By giving it to little Feng Wu, he’s exposing his weakness to her. His life would be at her mercy!”","Granny Gong said, “Miss Xiao Wu is trustworthy.”","Feng said, “Of course I know she’s trustworthy, but did you see that? I picked up a wisp of his Spiritual Saint Liquid out here. What does that mean? Miss Feng Wu didn’t absorb all of it, and it leaked out.","“If anyone with ill intention picks up the Spiritual Saint Liquid, it’ll be very dangerous.” As he spoke, Feng raised his hand to seal the room so that the Spiritual Saint Liquid wouldn’t leak out.","Granny Gong said seriously, “I can tell that His Royal Highness has already decided that Miss Wu is the one. What he is doing is his promise. I hope Miss Wu can understand His Royal Highness’s efforts.” Fengs steward said, “But... the Spiritual Saint Liquid might not work.” Granny Gong stared at the steward in surprise.","Feng smiled bitterly. “Do you think I’m joking? No, I’m telling the truth.","“His Royal Highness is using desperate measures this time.","“Every Spirit Saint can indeed refine the Spiritual Saint Liquid, but this Spiritual Saint Liquid is used to repair their own bodies. It may not be as effective when used on other people.","“Besides, there’s a huge gap between their cultivation levels. His Royal Highness’s Spirit Saint Liquid might not be very useful.” Feng became more and more frustrated as he spoke.","Granny Gong said, “That shows how much His Royal Highness is in love with","Miss wu.”","Feng rolled his eyes at her. “I thought you wouldn’t like Miss Xiao Wu anymore.”","Granny Gong smiled bitterly. “Why wouldn’t I? I watched His Royal Highness grow up. How could I not care about him? Now that I see how much he loves Miss Wu, I can’t wait to help him. Why would I stop him?”","Granny Gong sighed. “It’s not easy for His Royal Highness to fall in love with someone. If he misses Miss Wu, he might be destined to be alone for the rest of his life. So, we have to do our best..”"]},{"number":3631,"title":"Chapter 3631: Injury (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3631: Injury (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Although Granny Gong and Feng were very supportive of Feng Wu, her recovery was very slow.","Over the past three days, Jun Linyuan had never let go of her. He kept sending her the Spiritual Saint Liquid until he couldn’t hold on any longer.","When Jun Linyuan transferred the last drop of Spiritual Saint Liquid he could condense into Feng Wu’s body, he finally collapsed and laid Feng Wu down on the bed.","After examining Feng Wu, Jun Linyuan didn’t look any better.","Feng Wu had woken up. She had been conscious for the past three days, but she couldn’t make a sound. It was only now that she could speak again.","Feng Wu couldn’t help but laugh when she saw the pale-faced teenager sitting there. A few days ago, he had been so arrogant that he could destroy the world, but now, he was as depressed as a little boy.","She put her hand on his, and a smile appeared on her pale face. “Don’t be depressed. You’ve already done a great job.”","Feng Wu struggled to speak because she still felt very weak.","Jun Linyuan looked at her. His mood didn’t improve because of her words. Instead, it worsened.","He lay next to Feng Wu, and Feng Wu stroked his hair.","“Once I become a Divine medicine refiner, I’ll be able to cure myself. So, don’t worry, okay?” Feng Wu was still very optimistic.","However, she had examined herself and realized how serious her situation was.","This time, it was beyond expectations.","She had made too many breakthroughs, and the heavenly lightning tribulation was too ferocious.","However, if it wasn’t fierce enough, it wouldn’t have been able to suppress those Spiritual Overlords.","Hence, Feng Wu had no choice but to try her best to make more breakthroughs and attract even stronger lightning tribulations. That was why she couldn’t withstand the lightning tribulation anymore.","The Divine Phoenix Blood had already helped her absorb the lightning liquid. Without it, Feng Wu would have died on the spot.","“I cultivate the Lightning Technique. My body will recover slowly.” Feng Wu stroked his hair and said calmly, “Don’t worry about me.”","Jun Linyuan was even more frustrated.","She had always been a lively and enchanting person. He had never seen her like this, lying there sickly and talking in such a calm voice.","They both knew that Feng Wu’s life was saved, but her internal organs were destroyed.","In the future, she would be extremely weak, and she would pant with every step she took.","Jun Linyuan couldn’t stand it. He stood up and walked out.","“Where are you going?” Feng Wu had a bad feeling.","“I’ll avenge you!” The youth was furious.","He was furious because he couldn’t do anything else.","Feng Wu nagiclced “Come hack","However, the young man had already strode away and was nowhere to be seen.","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead. Was Jun Linyuan going to start a massacre this time?","As soon as Jun Linyuan left, Feng Wu heard footsteps outside.","“Xiao WII!”","It was Feng Xun and Yu Mingye.","Yu Mingye was stopped outside, and only Feng Xun could make it in.","“Xiao Wu, how are you doing?” Feng Xun was only able to get in because of Feng.","“I’m fine...” Feng Wu struggled to sit up on the bed and leaned against the cushion. She was exhausted.","Feng Xun almost burst into tears. “Why...”","This time, almost all the danger was directed at Feng Wu. She was deep inside her own trap, but the people protecting her were unharmed. The more Feng Xun thought about it, the more frustrated he became.","“You’re not fine at all...”"]},{"number":3632,"title":"Chapter 3632: Injury (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3632: Injury (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Tears welled up in Feng Xun’s eyes. “You’re not fine at all...’","Feng Wu smiled. “What’s wrong with me? I’m fine.”","Feng Xun said, “No, you’re not! I can’t sense any spiritual essence from you.","How can you be fine?”","Feng Wu was rendered speechless.","Frustrated, Feng Xun sat down next to her and asked in a hurry, “Have you lost your cultivation ability? I can’t sense your spiritual essence!”","As he spoke, he checked her pulse, which made him even more anxious!","Feng Wu said with a wry smile, “I haven’t lost my spiritual essence, but I can’t use it. I’m too weak.”","She pointed at her internal organs. “The lightning liquid has washed them over and over again, and they’re almost useless. They haven’t recovered yet.”","Feng Xun asked in a hurry, “When will they recover?","Feng Wu said, “I don’t know.”","“How could you not know? Aren’t you a Semi-divine medicine refiner? You don’t even know? How can you not know?!”","Feng Wu comforted him. “Don’t worry...”","Feng Xun became even more anxious. “Then when can you recover? I saw Boss Jun storm out just now. If you weren’t so badly injured, why would he be so angry? You’re the only one who can piss him off now.”","Hearing that, Feng Wu said in a hurry, “He said he’s going to avenge me. Who can he get revenge on? Where are the people of the Hua family and the Zuo family?”","“It’s been three days. How could they still be here? They’ve already been sent to the Peace Grassland. My father is so happy that he’s saying the best things about you.”","After a pause, Feng Xun said, “He doesn’t know about your injury yet.”","She said, “Don’t tell him yet. It’s a critical moment in the war. In fact, Jun","Linyuan should be on the battlefield right now, but I’m holding him back...”","Feng Xun stared at her. “What are you blaming yourself for? Do you know that you turned the tables by sending over twenty Spiritual Overlords?!”","Feng Wu asked, “So soon?”","“It’s been three days, so it won’t be long now. We only had a limited number of Spiritual Overlords on the grassland because we were training our troops. We didn’t really fight. This is a life-and-death battle now, so we won’t limit the number of people. We’ll just have to send as many Spiritual Overlords as we can.”","Feng Wu asked in a hurry, “What’s the situation now?”","Feng Xun said, “We’re closing in, and the enemy is losing ground. We’ll be able to take down the Sun Castle in a few days.”","She smiled. That was good.","Feng Xun said excitedly, “Father said that it’s all thanks to the twenty-odd fighters you sent over. They’re really soldiers of sacrifice now. All they care about is killing people. They won’t stop at anything. The people of Dongsang are so ruthless, but they’re so scared now...","“By the way, my father told me to listen to you. He said that it was all thanks to your medicine. Did you give him anything?” Feng Xun asked curiously.","Feng Wu nodded. “My godfather was injured when he fought with Xue Zhibei last time. I left him some medicine to help him recover and level up. Did he make a breakthrough? He was one level lower than Xue Zhibei and was always suppressed by him. Now that he’s so excited, I think I know...”","Feng Xun nodded. “Nothing gets past you..”"]},{"number":3633,"title":"Chapter 3633: The Fiend (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3633: The Fiend (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu came to her senses. “If those Spiritual Overlords went to the Peace Grassland, I don’t think Jun Linyuan will go after them. Then he...”","“I think he went to his father,” Feng Xun said grumpily.","Feng Wu looked at him. “Why do you look so angry?”","Feng Xun snorted. “I’m mad because I remembered something! You were talking about that plan with His Majesty in the imperial study when I sent you to the palace!","“He was willing to put you at such a risk because you’re not his own daughter. He wouldn’t have agreed to it.","“You’re only a Spiritual King, and you were fighting over 40 Spiritual Overlords! How could he let you do such a thing? I’m getting goosebumps just thinking about it. I was so scared that I’m having nightmares.","“When I asked you earlier, you kept telling me that you had a plan. Is that why you’re bed-ridden now?","The more Feng Xun spoke, the angrier he became. He felt so sorry for the girl.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “It’s not like that...”","Feng Xun said angrily, “It’s just not right! His Majesty has everything, but you’re IY1ng nere ana can’t move. Does your ramuy Knowr wnere?s Alaoqlf Where’s your mother...”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t tell Xiaoqi. I don’t want him to come here.” Feng Xun snorted.","Feng Wu said quietly, “There has to be a way... There has to be.”","In the palace.","Feng Wu and Feng Xun were right. Jun Linyuan had gone to Emperor Wu.","The emperor’s study.","Emperor Wu frowned.","By then, Jun Linyuan had smashed his study.","All the maids and eunuchs were kneeling on the ground, and the empress, the second prince, and the third princess didn’t dare to come in.","The Imperial study...","Who else would dare to destroy that study? That would be seen as a revolt!","And Jun Linyuan had put his sword on Emperor Wu’s neck!","Emperor Wu looked at Jun Linyuan in resignation. “The girl came up with the plan herself...”","Jun Linyuan’s eyes glinted coldly.","Emperor Wu smiled bitterly. “I didn’t know it would be so dangerous. The girl said she could handle it, and I’ve sent someone to protect her.","“I’ve even sent Situ Mingjing to protect her...”","Jun Linyuan’s aura filled the entire imperial palace.","The teenager was simply too terrifying.","It was as if he could destroy heaven and earth with a wave of his hand!","Even Emperor Wu was intimidated.","The empress dowager was still sick. Hearing that something had happened to Emperor Wu, she rushed to the study without putting on her outer robe.","“Junjun, what are you doing?!”","Only the empress dowager dared to enter the study.","The door was smashed open, revealing what was going on inside. Empress Dugu looked up involuntarily and was astonished.","And she wasn’t the only one.","Jun Linshen and Jun Wuxia saw it as well.","Jun Linyuan’s Sky Destroyer was right at Emperor Wu’s throat!","He was their emperor!","After the initial shock, Empress Dugu was filled with despair.","How was she supposed to fight for the throne for Jun Linshen? Even His Majesty couldn’t do anything to Jun Linyuan...","Jun Linshen paled as well and was on the verge of collapsing.","Jun Wuxia tugged at Jun Linshen’s sleeve. “Brother Linshen, please don’t offend the crown prince again. I’m scared...”","Who wouldn’t be afraid of a murderous fiend?"]},{"number":3634,"title":"Chapter 3634: The Fiend (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3634: The Fiend (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The energy Jun Linyuan gave off was terrifying.","No one dared to offend him.","Jun Wuxia said in a trembling voice, “I heard... I heard that the old lady of the Hua family was a Spiritual Saint, but Brother Linyuan cut her throat open and decapitated her!”","Jun Linshen glared at Jun Wuxia. “Stop it! Stop it!”","Jun Wuxia shuddered. “I heard that Hua Wushuang was scared out of her wits. She’s like a crazy person now... Brother, if you still want to compete with the crown prince for the throne, I won’t help you. Please let me live.”","Jun Linshen said, “Shut up! Stop talking!”","Empress Dugu didn’t know what to say. It was obvious that everyone saw Jun","Linyuan as a fiend now.","The empress dowager rushed into the study, grabbed Jun Linyuan, and said sternly, “Your Royal Highness, do you have any idea what you’re doing? Put down your sword! That’s your father!”","Jun Linyuan ignored her.","The empress dowager was furious. “Jun Linyuan! I order you to put down your sword!”","The crown prince had pointed his sword at the emperor, and that wasn’t usurping the throne. He should be executed!","However, the teenager’s eyes were cold, and there was a grim look on his face.","“You can’t do that to someone I care so much about!","“She’s not alone! I’ll get it back for her!","“Jun Potian, this is the last time.”","Putting away his sword, Jun Linyuan turned to leave.","Emperor Wu remained silent as he watched Jun Linyuan leave.","“Emperor, are you alright? Are you hurt?” The empress dowager was really angry at Jun Linyuan this time. He didn’t even talk to her when he left.","“What’s going on with the crown prince? Is he infatuated by Feng Wu? Why is he pointing a sword at his father? How can he do that?","“I think it’s all because of Feng Wu. She’s such a jinx!","“If it hadn’t been for her, Yuerou wouldn’t have died... I hate her so much!” The empress dowager expressed her anger without hesitation.","Mrs. Hua was the empress dowager’s childhood friend, and the empress dowager was the one who had spread the rumor that Hua Wushuang was going to be the crown prince’s wife. As a result, the Hua family was almost wiped","out...","“Mother!”","Emperor Wu stared at the empress dowager. “Watch your language!”","The empress dowager said, “This is the imperial palace, and I’m the empress dowager. What should I say? I...”","Emperor Wu gestured at Gao to show the others out.","After the others left, Emperor Wu looked at the empress dowager and took a deep breath. “Mother, haven’t you realized it by now? Did the crown prince really aim his sword at me?”","The empress dowager asked, “What are you talking about?”","Emperor Wu closed his eyes in pain. When he opened them again, his eyes were very cold.","“Mother, didn’t you order the Hua family to kill Feng Wu?” Emperor Wu finally asked the question.","The empress dowager stared at Emperor Wu. “What are you talking about? I would never do such a thing!”","Emperor Wu looked at the empress dowager. “Are you sure? You didn’t even give her a hint?”","The empress dowager blanched, but she still shook her head. “No! I didn’t!”","Emperor Wu turned away from the empress dowager and said seriously, “Mrs. Hua is dead, and no one can testify what you did. It doesn’t matter if you’ve given her a hint.. It’s just that from now on...”"]},{"number":3635,"title":"Chapter 3635: Master Linghu (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3635: Master Linghu (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu stared at the empress dowager. “But from now on...”","The empress dowager denied it outright. “No! I didn’t hint at that! I didn’t!”","Emperor Wu rubbed his forehead. “Alright. If His Royal Highness asks you in the future, just use the same attitude.” That rendered the empress dowager speechless.","“Mother, please leave,” Emperor Wu said weakly.","The empress dowager wanted to say something, but she was terrified when she saw the cold look in Emperor Wu’s eyes.","She seemed to have lost something very important...","When Emperor Wu was genuinely angry, the empress dowager didn’t dare to defy him. She took a few steps toward the door when she heard Emperor Wu’s low voice.","“Feng Wu, a mere Spiritual King, fought off over forty Spiritual Overlords. In the end, she sent the surviving twenty to the battlefield.","“With these twenty-odd Spiritual Overlords, the Junwu Empire is gaining ground against our enemy.","“Mother... Feng Wu is a thousand times better than you think.”","The empress dowager wanted to say something but hesitated.","She had never hinted to Hua Yuerou to kill Feng Wu, let alone destroy the Feng clan. Why should she do that? At her age, she didn’t like taking lives anymore. She wanted a good reputation.","However...","Was it possible...","Had someone really given Hua Yuerou a hint in her name? The empress dowager decided not to take the blame. She had to look into it!","“You... think about it.” Emperor Wu was obviously disappointed with the empress dowager. He sat down on the broken stairs and waved at her weakly.","The empress dowager felt sorry for him.","Jun Linyuan left the imperial palace without hesitation. Instead of going back to his residence, he turned around and headed for Wandering Temple.","Since Jun Linyuan could tear apart the imperial study, he could do the same to Wandering Temple.","The abbot was almost in tears when Jun Linyuan demolished the courtyard behind Wandering Temple, where Master Linghu used to live. He came out in a hurry.","“Your Royal Highness, please don’t do this. Please don’t.”","Jun Linyuan smirked. “Didn’t that old monk say that he couldn’t leave","Wandering Temple? Where did he flee to?”","Master Linghu was the most capable cultivator of the Junwu Empire and the savior of the empire. No one else but Jun Linyuan dared to talk about him in that way.","The abbot smiled bitterly. “It’s true. Master Linghu isn’t in Wandering Temple anymore. No one can tell where he is now. Your Royal Highness, it has something to do with the fate of the Junwu Empire. Please don’t ask.”","Jun Linyuan smirked. “He’s just a monk. If he doesn’t abandon his worldly desires, he’ll never reach perfection in his cultivation!”","The abbot felt his blood curdle.","Jun Linyuan said, “If that’s the case, what good will Wandering Temple do? Why don’t we tear it down?","He was a teenager with the power to destroy heaven and earth. With a wave of his hand, he could move mountains and overturn seas. The abbot really couldn’t stop him.","“Your Royal Highness!”","Seeing that Jun Linyuan was going to destroy the temple, the abbot said in a hurry, “Your Royal Highness, Master Linghu left a pouch behind before he left.” The teenager glared at the abbot.","The look gave the abbot the creeps. He immediately took out a pouch from his chest pocket and handed it to Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan stared at him. “Why didn’t you take it out earlier?”","The abbot smiled bitterly. “Master Linghu said that we could only take it out if you really want to destroy the Wandering Temple.. Otherwise...”"]},{"number":3636,"title":"Chapter 3636: Master Linghu (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3636: Master Linghu (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan frowned. “Otherwise, what?”","The abbot smiled bitterly. “Otherwise, I can’t take it out because it would mean that you’re not sincere enough.”","Jun Linyuan wanted to slap someone!","The abbot stumbled back. “Your Royal Highness, please open it. Is it what you need?”","Jun Linyuan couldn’t be bothered to deal with the abbot anymore. He opened the pouch right away.","It was quite a long note.","The first line read, “Traveling the mortal world will help her to stabilize her cultivation level and reduce the difficulty of the lightning tribulation in the future.","Something clicked in Jun Linyuan’s head when he saw the words.","It was referring to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu had made too many breakthroughs in one go, which had made the lightning tribulation so difficult. Jun Linyuan had been worried that Feng Wu would be marked, and the lightning tribulation would all be so difficult in the future. That was so frustrating.","But why could traveling in the mortal world reduce the lightning tribulation? Even someone as smart as Jun Linyuan couldn’t figure it out for the time being.","He went on reading.","The second line read, “I know Huyan Yanbo, a Semi-divine medicine refiner, has a Divine-level pill. He’ll show up at the Northern Yan Palace in three months.”","The look on Jun Linyuan’s face was indecipherable.","He needed to be in the Northern Yan Palace in three months’ time.","Feng Wu needed to travel the world, so he was taking her with him this time.","Jun Linyuan was lost in his thoughts. Should he take Master Linghu’s words literally?","When Jun Linyuan looked up, he saw that the abbot of Wandering Temple had run away as fast as a rabbit, fearing that Jun Linyuan would beat him up.","Back at the residence.","Jun Linyuan was still hesitating.","As sharp as Feng Wu was, she asked Jun Linyuan when she saw that he was lost in his thoughts.","Jun Linyuan had wanted to keep it a secret, but Feng Wu made him hand over the pouch with a few words.","“Traveling the world?” Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan in bewilderment. “What does that have anything to do with my lightning tribulation?”","For the first time in his life, the crown prince shook his head in front of the girl he loved.","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead. “And the second line. Go to the Northern Yan’s royal palace in three months to see Huyan Yanbo. Have you heard of that name before?”","Jun Linyuan nodded. “I have.”","Feng Wu was surprised. “Who is it?”","“Do you remember the last time in the Peace Grassland when someone stopped me from fighting Xue Zhibei?” Jun Linyuan asked slowly.","Feng Wu nodded. “Of course I do.” He was her third senior brother.","Jun Linyuan said, “That was Chu Tianxiao, the prime minister of the Dongsang","Kingdom. He’s even more prestigious than the master teacher. He’s Mu","Jiuzhou’s third pupil.”","Feng Wu nodded. She knew that. From Bu Jingyu’s portrait, she also knew that her third senior brother had been looking for her. Jun Linyuan said, “Huyan Yanbo is Master Mu’s sixth pupil.”","Feng Wu asked, “What?!” Was that her sixth senior brother?","Jun Linyuan nodded solemnly. “And this Huyan Yanbo was the previous emperor of Northern Yan. He was only an emperor for a day before he gave the throne to his nephew, who is the current emperor of Northern Yan.”","Jun Linyuan frowned. “But I’ve never heard of this Huyan Yanbo being a Semi-divine medicine refiner. Why does he have such a pill? Did Master Mu leave it with him?","“But how does Master Linghu know that? And what’s his relationship with Huyan Yanbo?” Jun Linyuan frowned and felt that something was off.","Feng Wu thought, “Does it have something to do with both my Sixth Senior Brother and my beautiful master?”"]},{"number":3637,"title":"Chapter 3637: Master Linghu (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3637: Master Linghu (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu had her doubts about the pouch as well, but Little Phoenix was thrilled when she asked it.","“Oh my! Is it little Yanbo? I remember him. When my master brought him back, he was barely three years old.","“He was so dumb and such a slow learner. The others picked on him a lot. “But his hard work can make up for his lack of talent. His cultivation was so arduous that he became as capable as your third senior brother.","“Personality? Well, he’s kind and honest.”","To Little Phoenix, Huyan Yanbo was a humble man, but he was one of the most powerful men in the world and the pillar of Northern Yan.","Because of him, Northern Yan was able to stay as stable as a rock. There were a lot of mineral veins in Northern Yan, but no one dared to take advantage of them.","It was all because Northern Yan had such a powerful cultivator.","Feng Wu then thought about her beautiful master. With the help of her senior brothers, would it be so much easier for her to find the third and fourth broken star pieces?","After all, her senior brothers were all top cultivators.","At that thought alone, Feng Wu tugged at Jun Linyuan’s wide sleeve. “Let’s go.","Shall we?”","Of course, he wouldn’t turn her down.","“Sure.”","Jun Linyuan was the most efficient person Feng Wu had ever met.","They had only just decided to leave at noon and everything was ready for their trip that afternoon.","Naturally, Feng would go with them.","Granny Gong stayed behind to guard the manor.","Feng Wu and Feng Xiaoqi met for a while, but before long, Feng Xiaoqi was dragged away by Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu didn’t see her mother because she was still cultivating in seclusion.","Feng Wu felt uneasy, but she couldn’t sense anything, so she had to put it aside for the time being.","The most important thing for her now was to cure her broken body and recover her cultivation ability. Otherwise, everything would be for nothing.","Hearing the news, Feng Xun arrived as fast as he could.","“Are you leaving? Take me with you!” Feng Xun wouldn’t let go of Feng Wu’s sleeve. “Take me with you! I’ve never been away from Boss Jun for more than a month!”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes. “Go ask him yourself, then.”","Feng Xun shook his head. “No, I won’t. He won’t listen to anyone but you. One word from you is more useful than ten thousand words from me. Dear sister, am I not a good brother to you? Aren’t you going to take me with you?”","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead. “We’re going to be in danger...”","Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “Going out with Boss Jun is dangerous? Kiddo, do you have so little faith in your future husband?”","“What future husband? Feng Xun, don’t call him that.” Feng Wu threw a dirty look at him.","Feng Xun was astonished. “Boss Jun still hasn’t succeeded yet?”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t talk about it again, or I won’t take you with me!”","Feng Xun said, “Alright, alright. Take me with you, then.”","Feng Wu smacked her forehead. Was this really her brother, the Young Lord","Feng that was so proud and respectable in front of all the other young lords?","Feng Wu had no choice but to say, “Fine, fine. But there are three rules. One, you can’t make too much noise.”","Feng Xun nodded immediately. “Yes, no problem.”","Feng Wu said, “Two, don’t make trouble.”","Feng Xun said, “Of course. Even if you don’t kill me, Boss Jun will.” Feng Wu said, “Three, you can’t do anything I don’t want you to do..”"]},{"number":3638,"title":"Chapter 3638: Master Linghu (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3638: Master Linghu (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu said, “Three, you can’t do anything I don’t want you to do.”","Feng Xun nodded immediately. “Alright, alright. I’ll do it.”","Just then, Jun Linyuan walked in.","He had a little boy with him.","It was Bao Er.","Bao Er looked eagerly at Jun Linyuan, but the teenager shook his head. “You can’t go.”","Suppressing her desire, Bao Er nodded and lowered her head.","Jun Linyuan said solemnly, “Take her back. Teach her well these days. Don’t miss a day.”","Granny Gong knew what the crown prince was like, and he meant every word.","She nodded and led Bao Er away.","Seeing the book stuck into Bao Er’s belt, Feng Wu was speechless.","Feng Wu still remembered her additional task. She had to make sure that Bao Er liked her. That way, her beautiful master would wake up for a longer time, but now was obviously not the time. She would have to wait.","“Do you want to train Bao Er into a scholar?” Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan in bewilderment.","Jun Linyuan shook his head. “No.”","Feng Wu said, “Then why did you make her read so many books? She’s not well enough.”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu. “She can’t cultivate.”","Feng Wu was confused. “How can that be? She has the Dragon Phoenix Blood from you and the Divine Phoenix Blood from me. She should be the most talented person in the world. Why...”","Jun Linyuan stopped in front of Feng Wu’s bed and looked into her eyes. He said in a serious tone, “She has two rare bloodlines at the same time, but she’s just an ordinary person. As expected, her body can’t take it. In the end, her body simply sealed them up, making it impossible for her to cultivate.”","Feng Wu sighed. “What a pity...’","Jun Linyuan was worried that Feng Wu would think too much, so he explained, “Her parents are just ordinary people and aren’t very talented. It’s only natural that she can’t withstand such great power. I’ve made plans for her future. Don’t worry.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Fearing that Feng Wu would overthink it, Jun Linyuan added, “If both parents have strong bloodlines, their babies won’t be weak either. A baby born from the Dragon Phoenix Blood and the Divine Phoenix Blood won’t be like Bao Er.”","Feng Wu nodded again, looking distracted.","Feng xun almost relt sorry ror BOSS Jun.","Boss Jun had made it so obvious, but Feng Wu was absent-minded.","What Feng Xun didn’t know was that Feng Wu was trying to figure out what to say to make Jun Linyuan agree to take Feng Xun with them.","“Ahem...’","Feng Xun reminded his silly sister.","Feng Wu glanced at Feng Xun. Of course, she remembered. He didn’t need to remind her.","Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan. “Are we leaving this afternoon?”","“Yes.” Jun Linyuan’s tone remained emotionless when he talked to Feng Wu, but that was as far as he could go. Under normal circumstances, the crown prince was the most arrogant person.","Feng Wu asked, “Can we take Feng Xun with us?”","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun felt a chill run down his spine.","Tugging at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve, Feng Wu asked eagerly, “Can we bring him along?”","How could Jun Linyuan say no to such a request?","The teenager rubbed her head. “Yes..”"]},{"number":3639,"title":"Chapter 3639: Travel (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3639: Travel (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The carriage set off in the afternoon.","Feng Xun and Feng had to ride their horses, while Feng Wu sat lazily in the carriage.","This carriage had definitely undergone shock-absorbing measures.","The carriage sped along the way, but Feng Wu didn’t feel any bumpiness on the road.","The interior of this carriage was more than twice the size of an ordinary one.","Two-thirds of the space was occupied by a soft couch. Feng Wu could still lie down and even roll around.","There were a total of eight windows, and when they were opened, the sunlight shone on her face, making her sleepy.","There were all kinds of mechanisms on the wall, and tea and snacks were all prepared and within Feng Wu’s reach.","Jun Linyuan only spent a few hours preparing for this trip, but everything was very well-prepared. Nothing was out of the way.","Jun Linyuan sat in the carriage with Feng Wu. There was a book in his hand. His eyes were lowered, and he kept reading.","The teenager had well-defined features and was already unbelievably beautiful. Now that the sun was shining on his face, he looked even more ethereal and graceful. It was impossible to describe how beautiful he was.","All the spiritual essence in the world seemed to have concentrated on him. The Creator really liked him.","Sensing Feng Wu’s gaze, the teenager looked away from the book. “You’re awake.”","His voice was clear, deep, and refreshing.","He didn’t look as terrifying as before.","“Ahem...” Feng Wu struggled to get out of bed, but she was too weak. The next second, Jun Linyuan was by her side and put a cushion behind her.","The cushion was specially made trom the tinest natural silk cotton. It was so soft that it almost wrapped around Feng Wu.","“How are we going to get there?”","The two of them were so close that Feng Wu changed the subject involuntarily.","The teenager who had dared to point his sword at the emperor carefully tucked Feng Wu in with a duvet, fearing that he might miss anything.","He moved carefully and sincerely, as if he was doing something very important.","After tucking the duvet in, he sat down, glanced at Feng Wu, and tossed her a booklet. He said coldly, “Read it yourself.”","Feng Wu thought to herself, “What? He was so gentle when he tucked me in, but he’s being so rough now.”","However, Feng Wu was used to Jun Linyuan’s ‘two-faced” behavior, so she wasn’t offended. Instead, she read the map carefully. They had decided on the time and purpose of their trip. Three months later, they would meet Huyan Yanbo at the Northern Yan Palace.","But they hadn’t figured out how to get there yet.","“What would you have gotten there if it were up to you?” Feng Wu looked up from the map and asked Jun Linyuan curiously. “I’ll fly there,” Jun Linyuan said succinctly.","Feng Wu nodded. She knew it.","Jun Linyuan was simply too powerful. As a Spiritual Saint, he was indeed capable of taking her all the way to Northern Yan by air. Moreover, it would save her a lot of time.","“But Master Linghu said that we have to travel the world.” Feng Wu grinned at Jun Linyuan. “Are you mad?”","Jun Linyuan only looked at her without saying a word.","Feng Wu answered for him as she flipped through the booklet. “You must be very angry.”","Crossing his arms, Jun Linyuan glanced at her. “Why do you say that?”","Feng Wu snapped.."]},{"number":3640,"title":"Chapter 3640: Travel (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3640: Travel (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu said grumpily, “You hate trouble. Now that I’ve brought you so much trouble, I bet you don’t like me very much.”","The teenager sat down in front of Feng Wu and kept his gaze on her.","Feng Wu lowered her head. “In the end, you’re going to travel with me for three months. That’s not traveling at all. It’s so boring. Am I right?”","Jun Linyuan kept his gaze on Feng Wu and looked very serious.","Feng Wu said, “Why are you looking at me like that? Am I wrong? We’re going to meet so many weak people, and you’re going to be so bored. You won’t have that kind of patience. If I were you, I would be so annoyed.”","“I’m not annoyed.” The teenager remained aloof.","Feng Wu said, “No one said that you had to go with me to find that medicine, but you still did it. I owe you one, and I’ll remember it.”","Jun Linyuan frowned and narrowed his eyes.","Feng Wu was still mumbling. “But since I’ve sent so many Spiritual Overlords to help our empire, no matter how reluctant you are, you have to help me. I’ve done you a great favor.”","She looked up at Jun Linyuan as she spoke. Her big eyes were clear and bright.","Jun Linyuan had never met anyone like her.","One moment, she was murmuring apologetically, and the next, she was making a bold request...","“Yes.” He couldn’t help but rub her head. “I owe you.”","Now that Feng Wu didn’t feel she owed Jun Linyuan anything, she became curious. “I’m going to have a great tour of the Junwu Empire on my way there. You have no idea how hard I’ve been working in the past decade since I came here. I’ve never stopped to savor the real world. I haven’t had a chance to enjoy anything!”","“Since you came here?” Jun Linyuan asked.","“Ahem!” Feng Wu threw a dirty look at Jun Linyuan. “That’s how long I’ve been born for. Are you picking on me now?”","Anyone else who dared to stare at Jun Linyuan would probably be dead by now. However, under Feng Wu’s clear gaze, Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything and only nodded.","Feng Wu said excitedly, “Can we not travel by road all the time? We’re near the Nanyang River, right? The narrow part of the river is hundreds of meters wide, and the widest part is thousands of meters wide. Hey, how about we take a boat and head west for a while?”","Jun Linyuan liked to hear Feng Wu’s soft voice, so he crossed his arms, raised his chin, and said indifferently, “No.”","As expected, the girl tugged at his sleeve and pleaded with her doe eyes.","“Please?”","Jun Linyuan remained silent.","Feng Wu grew anxious. “Let’s go. It’s so boring in a carriage. I’m tired of all the scenery around the imperial capital, and the road is so bumpy. It’s not very comfortable. Let’s take the waterway. It’ll only take us a few days. After that, we won’t have any waterway on our way west. Alright?”","Jun Linyuan gave her a little tap on the head. “You’re such a sweet talker.”","Feng Wu wouldn’t admit it.. “I’m not! It was a negotiation! Negotiation!”"]},{"number":3641,"title":"Chapter 3641: Travel (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3641: Travel (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan only smiled when he heard the girl’s protest.","Outside, Feng Xun and Feng exchanged looks and both gave each other wry smiles.","They decided to let the two of them carry on like this, wondering if this trip would make them realize how they felt about each other.","“I think Boss Jun has made up his mind. He just won’t admit it. He’s made it very obvious.” Feng Xun lowered his voice.","Feng nodded. “We’ll wait for Miss Wu to admit her true feelings. Well, I won’t stay in their way.”","Feng turned to leave after that.","He was soon out of sight.","Feng Xun thought to himself, “He’s an incredible cultivator.”","“Wait, they’re still talking about whether to travel by land or water and haven’t reached a conclusion yet. Where did Feng... “By water.” Feng’s voice reached Feng Xun’s ears.","Feng Xun agreed.","Every negotiation between Feng Wu and Boss Jun ended with Feng Wu winning.","Yongzhou Pier.","Feng had the boat ready when they arrived, and he was reporting to Jun Linyuan.","“Flying Star is His Majesty’s dragon boat. It’s 13m tall, 60m long, and has four floors. The top floor consists of the main hall, the inner hall, and the eastern and western courts. The middle floors are richly decorated and have 50 rooms in total. The lower floor...","Jun Linyuan nodded.","However, the more Feng Wu listened, the more confused she became. Such a big and luxurious dragon boat...","“How many of us are there?” Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan in bewilderment.","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu, but before he could say anything, Feng said,","“Just the four of us.”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “Are the four of us going to take such a big dragon boat together? That’s a lot of attention. Plus, we’re here to travel the world, not to show off...”","She looked eagerly at Jun Linyuan and tugged at his sleeve.","Jun Linyuan looked at her in resignation. ‘What do you want, then?”","The girl smiled, her bright eyes like crescent moons. “How about we share a boat with other people? We’ll pretend to be ordinary people. Don’t ordinary people always share a boat with others?”","Jun Linyuan rubbed his forehead in resignation. As the crown prince of the empire, he had never known how to share a room with the common people.","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng.","Feng smiled. “I’ll make the arrangements, then.”","After Feng left, Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu in resignation and saw that the girl was very excited. ‘Wherever there are people, there’s action. I’d like to see what it’s like.”","Jun Linyuan crossed his arms and said grumpily, “You won’t like that world.”","Feng Wu said, “But it’s very real. Just think about it. You’re the crown prince, and everyone will show you the side you prefer when they see you. It’s not their true side.","“But now that we’re in the crowd and dressed like ordinary people, everything we see is real. Moreover...” Feng Wu gave it some thought and said slowly, “I want to know if Master Linghu’s plan is what I think it is.”","Jun Linyuan patted her head. “I’m glad you like it.”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Jun Linyuan, you’re so fairy-like. You should be more down to earth.”","The crown prince didn’t say a word.","Feng Wu said, “This is the land you’re going to rule in the future. These people are all your people, and you’ll only realize that they’re real when you’re among them..”"]},{"number":3642,"title":"Chapter 3642: Travel (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3642: Travel (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“People from all walks of life will all have their own stories. Some are fake, and some are true.” Feng Wu was full of anticipation. “I want to feel the truth. I think our cultivation should be built on the truth.”","Jun Linyuan was dazed for a moment, as if Feng Wu’s words had touched him. Something seemed to click in his head.","Feng soon came back.","“A commoner’s boat, Soaring Wing, will set sail in 15 minutes. It’s neither too big nor too small.","“There are ten luxurious rooms on the upper floor and twenty ordinary ones on the lower floor. Apart from four luxurious rooms on the upper floor, all the others are occupied...”","“What’s the route?” Feng Wu asked.","Feng said, “It’ll take us eight days to reach the end of the river.”","Feng Wu raised her chin and asked Jun Linyuan, “How about we take this Soaring Wing?”","Of course, Jun Linyuan wouldn’t say no to her. He nodded in agreement.","Feng knew it. He smiled and said, “I’ve paid the deposit. We can board the boat now.”","As for the luxurious carriage, Feng would have someone drive it all the way to the end of the river to wait for them to finish their journey before setting off on the road again.","Soaring Wing.","Feng Xun and Feng would take care of everything so that Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu didn’t have to.","Jun Linyuan reached out to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu shook her head. “I... I’ll try. Maybe I can walk on my own.”","The crown prince put down his hand and waited for her outside the carriage.","Feng Wu struggled to sit up, but she was too weak to do anything. Her chest hurt, and after a few struggles, she could only lean back on the cushion and look at Jun Linyuan in resignation.","Jun Linyuan didn’t say a word. He only crossed his arms and looked at her with his brooding eyes. He had no intention of helping her.","In the end, Feng Wu had no choice but to give the teenager a pleading look. “It hurts...”","Jun Linyuan smiled a little, but he didn’t move.","Feng Wu was almost in tears. She reached out to Jun Linyuan for help. “I can’t stand up.”","Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan in frustration. She knew what Jun Linyuan was waiting for. He was waiting for her to beg him. How annoying.","Feng Wu looked around and saw that Feng Xun had already jumped into the boat. Feng wasn’t here either, and Jun Linyuan was the only one she could turn to.","She looked at him and said softly, “Brother Jun, please help me.”","Pursing his thin lips, Jun Linyuan finally went up to her and picked her up with gentle movements.","Feng Wu snorted and complained in a low voice. “You like it when I beg you. I knew it.”","Jun Linyuan didn’t speak, but he was obviously very pleased.","Feng Wu said, “I won’t have to beg you after I get better. Gosh, how can I be so stupid? I should have brought Qiuling with us... How could I have forgotten about her? Jun Linyuan, I want Qiuling. Have Feng bring her to me.” Feng Wu swayed his arm back and forth and pleaded in a low voice.","But the crown prince only frowned and shook his head.","“Why not? It’s very inconvenient for me without Qiuling.” Feng Wu frowned.","“Very, very inconvenient.”","A few steps away, Feng estimated the distance in his head. It would take him less than five minutes to fetch Qiuling and come back.","However, Jun Linyuan shook his head. “Feng has left.” Feng, who was about to step out, was dumbfounded.."]},{"number":3643,"title":"Chapter 3643: Together (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3643: Together (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng was speechless.","Rubbing his forehead, he took a few steps back.","Feng Wu was as confused as Feng was. “Where did Feng go? Didn’t he have to look after us all the way?","Jun Linyuan said indifferently, “He’s going to drive the carriage to Yong City at the end of the river. Yes, he’ll wait for us there.” Feng Wu asked, “Why didn’t I know that?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Feng only listens to me.”","Feng Wu had no choice but to accept reality. “Alright...”","Feng rubbed his nose. Yong City it is. He was on his way.","“Come here.” Feng Xun waved at Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu. “I’ve seen all the rooms. You can have the most luxurious one.”","Feng Wu suddenly remembered. “Feng said earlier that he had booked four rooms...”","Jun Linyuan said calmly, “He booked too many.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan had a suite with two rooms facing the river. They could see everything along the way.","Feng Xun looked out. “Wait, where’s Feng?”","Feng Wu sighed. “Feng needs to drive the carriage. He’s waiting for us in Yong","City.”","Feng Xun was confused. “What? Feng said...”","Feng Xun saw the look in Jun Linyuan’s eyes and came back to himself right away. He smacked his forehead and said, “Hey, how could I forget? Feng told me that he had to take the carriage there. You can’t just find a special carriage like that anywhere.”","Feng Wu mumbled, “Can’t we put the carriage in the storage space and take it there?”","“We need to have those special horses too. Well, that’s the way it is.” Feng Xun changed the subject. “I asked around just then. There are all kinds of people on this boat.”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “I’m not that interested in other people.”","After a pause, Feng Wu asked with twinkling eyes, “Who are they?”","Feng Xun chuckled and told Feng Wu, “Yours is the second largest suite on this ship, and there’s the most luxurious one on your left. 1,000 gold coins a night.” Feng Wu said, “That’s really expensive. Most people can’t afford it.”","Cultivators like them could afford it because 1,000 gold coins were equivalent to one spiritual stone.","Feng Wu even had blood origin crystals, so spiritual stones didn’t mean much.","“He’s a government official,” said Feng Xun with a smile. “He’s Zhao Yi, the new mayor of Yong City, and he’s a friend of the Dugu family.”","“The Dugu family...” Feng Wu frowned. “Old Master Dugu wasn’t involved last time, which means that he’s pretty decent...”","However, Jun Linyuan snorted before Feng Wu could finish. “Not necessarily.”","Feng Wu said, “What’s that?”","Jun Linyuan said, “He watched the battle of the Zuo family the whole time. That old man has always taken advantage of the situation and never got involved. If he finds an opportunity, he’ll show no mercy.”","Feng Wu said, “So, he’s very timid and cautious.”","Jun Linyuan nodded. “And he’s very good at waiting. He’s still alive when all his contemporaries are dead.”","Feng Wu nodded. “Does Master Zhao know any of you?”","Feng Xun said, “Master Zhao never worked in the imperial capital before. He used to be a deputy in Yong City, and the former governor of Yong City is dead. He used his connection with the Dugu family to fill the gap. Anyway, I think there’s something fishy about the death of the former governor of Yong City, but I can’t say for sure without any evidence..”"]},{"number":3644,"title":"Chapter 3644: Together (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3644: Together (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun said, “The second passenger is quite interesting. It’s Qin Qi, the second son of Earl Nanfeng.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Do you know him?”","Feng Xun chuckled. “We all grew up in the imperial capital, and I’ve met him a few times. I’m sure he’ll recognize me. As for Boss Jun... I don’t think he has.”","“He’s a scholar who’s said to be better at reading books than dealing with the real world. However, after all these years, he hasn’t gotten any position in any official institute, nor has he passed any official exams. His eldest brother will inherit his father’s title. I don’t know what will become of him.","“The third passenger is a local squire. He’s round and chubby. One look and you could tell that he’s from a wealthy family.","Feng Xun then introduced the rest of the passengers to Feng Wu. “But they don’t seem to be on friendly terms with each other.”","Feng Wu asked, “What? Is there a problem between them?”","Feng Xun said, “Not really, but I think that local esquire is fawning on Zhao Yi. As for Qin Qi, I don’t think he’s very keen on Zhao Yi. I think they’ve had a row.”","Jun Linyuan rubbed his forehead in resignation. Why was the girl interested in these people? Why was she so energetic?","“You’re not strong enough. Having something to eat and get some rest.” Jun Linyuan tucked Feng Wu in.","Feng Wu wasn’t really interested in the conflicts between these people. She just wanted to experience the real world and see how ordinary people lived. She had been cultivating for too long.","That time in Northern Border City was when Feng Wu felt that she was alive.","After dinner, Jun Linyuan gave Feng Wu the Spiritual Saint Liquid again.","Whenever he created something himself, he would give it to Feng Wu.","Although the Spiritual Saint Liquid couldn’t treat Feng Wu’s wounds, it was still beneficial to her health.","The next day, with Jun Linyuan’s help, Feng Wu was able to get out of bed.","The boat had been sailing for a while, and Feng Wu kept looking at the water. She was intrigued at first, but soon, she grew tired of it.","The so-called “river scenery” was actually quite boring after a while.","Just then, they heard some noise outside.","Many people were shouting.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","Jun Linyuan looked at her in resignation. The girl was curious again...","Feng Wu tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve. “Let’s go have a look. There’s a row going on outside.”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu in resignation.","Feng Wu said, “It’s so boring on the boat. Let’s go have a look. It’s human nature to enjoy the show. Why are you looking at me like that? I’m just curious.","Let’s go have a look, shall we?”","In fact, he enjoyed the process. Hearing her soft voice, he was so satisfied.","Having no other choice, he picked Feng Wu up and was going to carry her out.","“Just hold my arm. I think I can walk on my own now. I mean it. Let me try.” Feng Wu was very stubborn.","If she could walk with her own legs, she wouldn’t need to ask Jun Linyuan for help.","Jun Linyuan sighed and said yes in the end.","Someone was indeed making a racket on the deck, and it turned out to be Qin Qi, whom Feng Xun was talking about.","A lot of people were discussing among themselves when Feng Wu came out.","Meanwhile, Qin Qi’s minion was glaring at the ship’s first mate.. “No! You have to solve the problem for us! Otherwise, this ship isn’t going anywhere today!”"]},{"number":3645,"title":"Chapter 3645: Together (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3645: Together (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Although the Soaring Wing wasn’t an imperial ship, it was still a big one. The deck was narrow at two ends, and there was a courtyard in the middle. There were statues, trees, and plants, as well as wooden tables and chairs where one could sit down and have some tea.","Feng Wu walked closer with Jun Linyuan’s help and saw that the seats had been taken.","“Xiao Wu, over here.” Feng Xun waved at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu couldn’t believe it.","No one could run faster than Feng Xun when it came to enjoying a good show.","Feng Wu could only walk very slowly now. It took her forever to reach Feng","Xun.","As it turned out, Feng Xun had ordered a pot of tea, and there were snacks and pastries on the table. Feng Wu was speechless.","As soon as Feng Wu sat down, she heard a middle-aged woman talking next to her.","“What’s that pageboy doing? I think he’s been asking the boatman for an explanation.”","Someone else said, “Well, it’s all because of what happened last night. Don’t you know?”","“Know what?”","“That scholarly man really is... He brought a girl onto the ship. You saw that, right? But she stole his money last night and jumped off the ship. Right now, he’s asking the boatmen to give him back his money.”","Feng Wu looked at Feng Xun in surprise. Was that even possible?","Feng Xun nodded at Feng Wu as he ate the snacks. That was true.","Qin Qi’s servant wouldn’t let go of the first mate. “I don’t care. It was stolen on the boat. You have to take responsibility. Pay me back! ”","Frustrated, the chief mate threw a dirty look at him. “Who knows if that girl is on your side or not? Maybe you’re putting on a show together!”","Qin Cai was furious. “What did you say? We’re in it with that girl? Do you know who my young master is? He’s the second son of Lord Nanfeng. Why would he do something like that? Don’t we have better things to do?”","The chief mate frowned.","He looked at Qin Qi. “Are you really the second son of Lord Nanfeng?”","Qin Qi flapped his fan and looked down at the first mate.","The first mate hesitated. If the passenger was from Lord Nanfeng’s family... That was a problem.","He couldn’t make the decision, so he had to summon the captain.","The chief officer’s duty was to supervise the daily work of the deck, and the captain’s responsibility was to manage and steer the ship.","The captain’s surname was Wu, and he was soon escorted out.","He saw the token Qin Qi handed him and knew that the latter was the second son of the Qin family. Despite his bad luck, he still smiled obsequiously. “Young Master Qin, would you like to talk inside?”","There were so many people watching. How were they supposed to talk it over?","However, Oin Qi acted as if he was trying to make a scene. He sat down, crossed his legs, and said arrogantly, “Let’s not talk in the room. Let’s do it right here.How do you think we’re going to handle this?”","Captain Wu smiled bitterly. “May I ask what’s missing?”","Qin Qi still had his legs crossed and was fanning himself. He then glanced at Qin Cai.","Qin Cai raised his voice. “My young master has lost 100 spiritual stones! Pay it back! ”","Spiritual stones?!","Captain Wu was frightened. “Spirit Stones? So many...”","Qin Cai said, “Of course. Earl Nanfeng isn’t just anybody. Do you think my young master will travel with gold coins? He uses spiritual stones, of course!” Captain Wu frowned.. “Have you checked everything? Is it really missing?”"]},{"number":3646,"title":"Chapter 3646: Together (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3646: Together (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Cai looked down on Captain Wu. “What do you mean? If you don’t believe me, bring people to search our room!” Captain Wu asked, “What’s Young Master Qin’s request, then?”","Qin Cai looked at his young master","Qin Qi smirked and said casually, “First of all, you’ll have to pay back my 100 spiritual stones. Secondly, take the ship back to the pier from yesterday.” Before Captain Wu could say anything, the onlookers shook their heads.","“No, you can’t do that. Young Master Qin doesn’t own this ship. He can’t make it return just because he says so.”","“That’s right. I’m in a hurry to get to Yong City, and it’ll take me two more days if the ship goes back to that pier. I’m in a hurry to get married!”","“My mother is seriously ill, and we can’t afford even a day’s delay. Captain, we can’t go back.”","Almost everyone objected.","Qin Qi’s face darkened, and he gave the others a threatening look.","But there were all kinds of people on this ship, and not everyone was intimidated by the power of the Earl of Nanfeng.","In the end, Captain Wu said, “We can’t go back. Since we’ve sailed out, we’ll only carry on our journey. Young Master Qin, I’m sorry about that.","“As for the spiritual stones,” Captain Wu said with a frown. “Since Young","Master Qin brought the thief himself, it has nothing to do with our ship. Young Master Qin, you can solve the problem yourself. Soaring Wing will help you look for that girl.”","As for if they could find her, that wasn’t Captain Wu’s concern.","Qin Qi didn’t expect Captain Wu to be so stubborn. He smacked the table and said, “You don’t know who you’re dealing with!”","Infuriated, Qin Qi activated his spiritual essence.","Although Feng Wu couldn’t activate her spiritual essence now, she could still recognize it.","“Is he... a Level-3 Spiritual Master?” Feng Wu asked Jun Linyuan, sounding uncertain.","Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Wu said, “How nostalgic. I was a Level-3 Spiritual Master only a short while ago. Looking back now, it feels like a lifetime ago.”","The Spiritual Master Stage was only the entry-level. After that, there were the stages of Spiritual Grandmaster, Spiritual Elder, Spiritual Lord, Spiritual King, Spiritual Overlord, and so on. Qin Qi was only a Level-3 Spiritual Master, and he was already showing off his power on this ship.","His fist cracked the table in front of him.","Qin Qi smirked. “If you don’t go back now, I’m going to break this ship into pieces. Everyone will die!”","Captain Wu glared at him.","Qin Qi smirked. “That’s how willful I am. So what? Bite me.”","Everyone was displeased.","The middle-aged woman behind Feng Wu said, “Young lords are so arrogant! None of them are decent people!”","Feng Wu glanced at Feng Xun and saw that he was indeed angry. He rose to his feet and was ready to beat Qin Qi up.","Just then, Captain Wu said, “This ship belongs to the Northern Feng Mansion.","It used to be an official ship, but it has become a civilian one. Young Master","Qin, are you sure you want to oppose the Northern Feng Mansion?”","Feng Wu looked at Feng Xun in bewilderment and mouthed, “Is it yours?”","Feng Xun said, “Wing is indeed my mother’s business, and this Soaring Wing is my family’s.”","Feng Wu said, “Why are you watching the show as a bystander, then? Didn’t they recognize you?","Feng Xun said, “My mother has at least a hundred businesses, not to mention that this is only one of the ships. It’s only normal that they don’t know me..”"]},{"number":3647,"title":"Chapter 3647: Comfort the Teenager (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3647: Comfort the Teenager (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Qi didn’t expect that Captain Wu would bring up the Northern Feng Mansion, and he frowned. “Stop trying to scare me!” Captain Wu smiled bitterly. “I’m telling the truth.”","Qin Qi asked, “Then why haven’t I heard of it before?","Captain Wu said, “We’ve always kept a low profile and wouldn’t abuse our power. It’s only normal that Young Master Qin hasn’t heard about us before. Many people on board don’t know about it either.”","Qin Qi said, “So what if you’re the Northern Feng Mansion’s business? I lost my spiritual stones!”","Captain Wu said, “That’s your own business. Plus, did the girl you brought just steal your spiritual stones?","Qin Qi was shocked. “What do you mean?! ”","Just then, a voice rang out. “I’ve lost fifty spiritual stones, too!”","“I’ve lost a hundred!”","“I lost 1,000 spiritual stones last night! Young Master Qin, did that girl you brought steal all our spiritual stones?”","“Young Master Qin, don’t go. Since you brought the thief aboard, you have to give us back our spiritual stones.”","“Young Master Qin...”","Qin Yan was so frustrated that he didn’t dare to stay here. He and Qin Cai hid in their room and didn’t dare to come out again.","The first mate went up to Feng Wu and thanked her in a low voice.","As it turned out, the passengers started saying they had lost spiritual stones because Feng Wu came up with that idea.","Feng Wu waved him off. “You’re welcome. I just don’t like that arrogant man.”","Once the first mate was gone, Feng Xun said angrily, “He’s the one who has ruined the reputation of all the young lords. He’s just a Level-3 Spiritual Master. How dare he act so arrogantly? Why hasn’t he been killed yet?","“Xiao Wu, if you hadn’t made that move, I would have taught him a lesson,” said Feng Xun grumpily.","Feng Wu chuckled. “If you beat him up, you’ll blow your cover and become the center of attention on this ship. Do you like that feeling?","Feng Xun agreed with her.","Qin Qi was scared out of his wits when Captain Wu mentioned the Northern Feng Mansion. If Feng Xun showed up in person, Qin Qi would probably jump off the ship right away.","Feng Wu smiled. “I remember when that Young Master Qin left, he talked to Captain Wu about how he and Young Lord Feng were good friends. Do you really know each other?”","Feng Xun smiled bitterly. “We’ve only met once in a while from a distance away. We’re not friends at all. I won’t have such an arrogant and cowardly buddy. How dare he.”","Feng Wu chuckled. “Captain Wu doesn’t seem convinced.”","Feng Xun said, “Captain Wu is a cautious man, isn’t he? Well, I need to warn","Qin Qi, so that he won’t ruin my reputation.”","Feng Wu was still laughing when she heard a cold voice. “Enjoying yourself?”","Only then did Feng Wu remember that Jun Linyuan was with her. She had been too busy enjoying the show to notice him.","Seeing the smile on her face, Jun Linyuan couldn’t understand why she and Feng Xun were so happy. They could have all the fun they wanted, but he couldn’t get involved.","The more he thought about it, the darker his face became.","“Hey, why is it getting darker? Clouds are rolling in.. Is there going to be lightning and thunder?”"]},{"number":3648,"title":"Chapter 3648: Comfort the Teenager (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3648: Comfort the Teenager (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“It’s like this in the middle of the year. One minute, it’s sunny, and the next minute, there’s a downpour. Come, let’s go back to our rooms.” The sun was so bright...” The old lady behind Feng Wu sighed and led her grandson back to the lower cabin.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Looking around, she saw that everyone had run off in such a short time, fearing that they might get caught in the rain. Even the first mate had come out to urge Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan to go inside. A storm was coming. Feng Wu said, “Yes, of course. We’ll go in right away.”","But in fact, Feng Wu had been looking at Jun Linyuan the whole time. Feng Wu looked up at the sky, then at his stunning face again.","“Are you... in a bad mood?” Feng Wu asked gingerly.","Jun Linyuan didn’t even look at Feng Wu. He only stared at the surging river outside the ship.","Feng Wu watched as the river suddenly rose ten meters into the air. The water then splashed onto the deck and overturned a tree.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She tried to appease him. “Well... are you hungry? Let’s go eat.”","Jun Linyuan bit his lower lip and wouldn’t look at her.","Thunder rumbled, and streaks of purple lightning flashed across the sky. It was a terrifying scene.","Feng Wu licked her lips. Somehow, she felt that the abnormal phenomenon had something to do with Jun Linyuan’s mood.","Feng Wu feigned a complaining tone. “What’s wrong with Feng Xun? Why is he so interested in these things? I’m not. I have no interest in them at all. What’s so interesting about these strangers? I’d rather talk to Boss Jun.”","“Don’t call me that.” Jun Linyuan wasn’t very happy.","“Brother Jun. I mean, Brother Jun.” Feng Wu tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve. “My legs are a little numb...","As she spoke, Feng Wu tried to stand up, but she stumbled and fell in Jun Linyuan’s direction.","Jun Linyuan patted her head in resignation. “Are you an idiot? You can’t even walk.”","He then picked her up.","Feng Wu said, “I can walk. Let me walk.”","Jun Linyuan snorted. “Are you sure?”","He looked like he was going to let go.","Feng Wu tugged at his clothes in a pitiful manner.","Seeing the panic-stricken look on the girl’s face, Jun Linyuan smiled and seemed to be in a good mood.","When he carried Feng Wu back to her room, the dark clouds dissipated, and the sky was clear again.","The water was so calm that it wouldn’t stir up waves that were dozens of meters high.","The first mate was finally relieved. He said to Captain Wu, “The weather is so strange, and so is the river... There’s something so mysterious about this trip.”","Captain Wu nodded. “Pass down the order. Keep your eyes open, and don’t slack off!”","The first mate asked curiously, “Do you think there’s something wrong with this trip as well?”","Captain Wu nodded. “It’s true. The journey has been very strange, and we have to be very careful. Everything else is fine. We have to deliver the cargo without a scratch.”","At the mention of the cargo, the chief officer straightened his back and said solemnly, “That’s right. We can’t afford to lose anything. Otherwise, I’m afraid we won’t get off this ship alive.”","Only Captain Wu and his first mate seemed to know about the “cargo”.","However, ordinary people would never know how acute a cultivator’s hearing could be.."]},{"number":3649,"title":"Chapter 3649: Comfort the Teenager (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3649: Comfort the Teenager (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","For instance, Jun Linyuan heard their conversation.","But he didn’t like to meddle in other people’s business, so he ignored them.","Feng Xun heard it as well.","He rushed into the room. “Xiao Wu, Xiao Wu...”","Xiao Wu was trying to let the crown prince have something to eat.","Hearing Feng Xun’s yelling, Jun Linyuan frowned.","Seeing this, Feng Wu said in a hurry, “I’m sure Feng Xun has something important to say. I’ll answer the door.”","Feng Xun came in, sat down in front of Jun Linyuan, and said cheerfully, “Teehee, I just found out. There’s going to be a good show tonight.”","Feng Xun grinned after that.","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment. “What show?”","Only then did Feng Xun realize that Feng Wu was there. He waved at her and said, “It’s not appropriate for a young lady. Go get me something to eat.” Feng Wu stared at Feng Xun with a half-smile. “Feng Xun, what did you say?”","She was so close to grabbing him by the ear.","Feng Xun realized right away that his sister wasn’t just any young lady...","“Alright, enjoy your meal.’","He dashed off after that.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She looked at Jun Linyuan in bewilderment. “What on earth is he doing, running up and down the ship?”","After that, Feng Wu opened the window and looked down. She saw that Feng Xun and Qin Qi were walking down the stairs together. It was almost dark, and the deck was lit up by candles.","Feng Wu asked Jun Linyuan curiously, “What are Feng Xun and Qin Qi talking about?”","Jun Linyuan could hear their conversation.","Being a Spiritual Saint, nothing on this ship could get past him.","He glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu knew that as well, so she went up to Jun Linyuan and tugged at his sleeve. “Just tell me. What’s Feng Xun doing? It looks so mysterious.”","Jun Linyuan patted his head. “Why are you so curious? You should go to bed.”","Feng Wu wouldn’t have it. “Why should I go to bed so early? I can’t sleep...","Just then, they heard voices outside.","Feng Wu looked out of the window curiously and saw that quite a few pretty boats were approaching.","The boats weren’t as tall as the Soaring Wing, so people kept putting down ladders.","Feng Wu saw dozens of beautiful women in flovvy dresses, and many men were sitting around them.","The women were dancing gracefully. As they danced, they took off their thin clothes until they were down to their underwear.","Leaning against the window, Feng Wu looked down and was amazed. “I didn’t","know you had such exciting activities here!”","Feng Wu had seen it before. In modern times, it was called a striptease. Back then, she had visited a stripper club in person.","A pretty woman used to dance around Feng Wu’s legs to liven up the mood. Feng Wu even generously stuffed some cash into the girl’s bra. It was an interesting experience.","Jun Linyuan didn’t even need to look to know what was going on down there. He rubbed his temples when he saw Feng Wu’s eyes light up.","What a rebellious girl.","No daughter of a good family would be amazed by such things.","Not only was Feng Wu enjoying the show, but she was also pointing around and making comments. “The one next to Feng Xun must be the most popular woman. She has such a tiny waist..”"]},{"number":3650,"title":"Chapter 3650: Comfort the Teenager (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3650: Comfort the Teenager (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Qin Qi is such a dog! The dancer on his lap is the hottest and has the most ample breasts. Look at those long legs. She’s so sexy!","“Wait, isn’t that Mayor Zhao? Isn’t he supposed to be very reserved? Why is he on the deck now?","“Jun Linyuan, look! Mayor Zhao wants that dancer next to Qin Qi, and he’s trying to seduce her with money. Look, he’s stuffed a stack into her bra!","“Gosh, has Qin Qi really been stolen or did he try to trick Captain Wu? He still has spiritual stones with him! Look, he stuffed them into that dancer’s bra! Do both of them like big boobs?!”","Feng Wu looked from herself to the dancing girl and was frustrated.","Jun Linyuan stared at the girl as if she was a monster. He had no idea that Feng Wu had this side!","When she talked about traveling the world, she was so absorbed in it that she didn’t even think about cultivation. However, Jun Linyuan felt that she was as wild as a cat.","Feng Wu wouldn’t stop egging him on. “Shall we go down there? Jun Linyuan, how about we have some fun together?”","Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu, looking displeased.","Feng Wu didn’t notice his displeasure and was only immersed in her excitement. “It’s such a rare event. We won’t know when we’ll see it again. I’m just curious. I wonder if it’s any different from what I knew before.”","Jun Linyuan rolled his eyes at her. “Are you sure they’ll keep dancing when you go down there, looking like this?”","Feng Wu was too beautiful to be ignored. Those women would definitely be affected.","Feng Wu agreed. The people here probably weren’t used to girls watching such dances and would find it astonishing. Although she had always been indifferent to other people’s opinions, Jun Linyuan didn’t like it...","“Shall I disguise myself as a man, then?”","She got to work right away.","Without waiting for Jun Linyuan’s reply, Feng Wu began to dress herself up as a man. It was a piece of cake for her.","Soon, Jun Linyuan saw a handsome teenager. She was as good-looking as Jun Linyuan was.","Moreover, the girl loved to smile, which was as warm and bright as the sun. It cheered up those who had dark thoughts.","Jun Linyuan was a little taken aback when he saw Feng Wu dressed as a man. Even in such a disguise, she was still breathtaking. Feng Wu took Jun Linyuan’s hand. “Help me walk. I may trip.”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu in resignation.","Feng Wu pouted. “I can’t use my spiritual essence, and it’s been so boring. If I don’t find something to do, I’ll be bored to death. I’m so miserable...”","Jun Linyuan didn’t know what to do with her. He sighed and said, “This is the last time.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up, and she nodded happily. “No problem!”","Jun Linyuan knew that she was only saying that to get what she wanted, but every time she pleaded in her soft voice, he would grant all her requests. Feng Wu tugged at his sleeve. “Let’s go, or the event will be over..”"]},{"number":3651,"title":"Chapter 3651: Courting Women (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3651: Courting Women (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan stopped Feng Wu. “Do you really know what’s going on here?” He had thought that Feng Wu was just an ignorant little girl.","Feng Wu smiled. “These men are enjoying some female company. How could I not know what they’re doing?”","Frowning, Jun Linyuan stared at her with a sharp gaze.","“Are you familiar with this?” Jun Linyuan’s voice was cold.","“Ahem...” Feng Wu almost choked on her own saliva. She looked up at him and said, “I was curious, so I asked Feng Xun about it. Gosh, you’re so talkative.","Let’s go downstairs.”","She tugged at his sleeve, and they went down to the deck together.","Because this was a man’s activity, the square table on the deck was filled with men. It was almost full.","Feng Xun was watching happily when he saw someone coming down the stairs, and he glanced in that direction.","He was drinking his tea, but what he saw almost made him spit it out.","Boss Jun?!","Boss Jun would actually come to such an occasion? It was really incredible!","Wait. Who was that person behind Boss Jun?","The moment Feng Wu showed her face, Feng Xun spat out the tea in his mouth.","“What’s going on?”","Qin Qi already knew who Feng Xun was, so he was trying his best to fawn at the latter.","Seeing how exaggerated Feng Xun’s reaction was, he moved closer.","Even the dancer beside them slowed down and changed to a gentle dance. She turned her head as well.","One look and the dancer was stunned. She even forgot to dance.","Two teenagers looked like gods from above!","The first one was tall and had a stern look on his face. Dressed in a brocade robe, he looked so majestic and proud!","The one behind him was a little shorter but had delicate features. His skin was much fairer and smoother than a woman’s. The dancer considered herself to be an outstanding beauty, but she felt she was nothing compared to that teenager.","His white robe was spotless, and he had a folding fan in his hand. He walked with a smile on his face, and there were dimples at the corner of his mouth. He looked so handsome!","How could there be such outstanding teenagers on this ship?!","She had thought that Feng Xun, the blue-robed teenager, was already an outstanding young man, but as it turned out, the two newcomers... What was going on here today? The dancer was secretly rejoicing.","A hush fell over the crowd as soon as Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan came out, and everyone turned to look at them.","Qin Qi was astonished.","He had never met Jun Linyuan before, but Qin Qi had guessed it from Feng Xun’s attitude toward him. Moreover, Jun Linyuan was the only person in the world that could look that way.","“J- Jun...” Qin Qi’s knees buckled, and he almost dropped to his knees.","“Is it him? Is it really him?” Qin Qi’s voice was trembling as he stared at Feng","Xun.","Feng Xun gave him a warning look.","Qin Qi covered his mouth, fearing that he would make another noise.","But he was very sure now. This was Jun Linyuan. It had to be him.","And the one next to him..","Qin Qi’s eyes widened when he recalled the pretty girl he had met earlier today.","Grabbing Feng Xun, he said, “Isn’t that shorter teenager the... the...”","That stunning girl from earlier?!"]},{"number":3652,"title":"Chapter 3652: Courting Women (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3652: Courting Women (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun gave Qin Qi another warning look. “Watch your mouth...","Qin Qi said, “I know... No, I don’t know. I don’t know anything..","Feng Xun knew that Qin Qi wouldn’t dare to tell anyone. After all, Jun Linyuan’s name could scare the crap out of all the influential families in the imperial capital.","Feng Xun waved at Feng Wu. “Over here!”","Feng Xun and Qin Qi had been sitting at the same table, but after Qin Qi realized what had happened, he quickly moved to the next table. Immediately after that, he rushed back and took away his plate as well.","A few steps away, the servant was dumbfounded.","Serving dishes... Shouldn’t they be the ones doing it? Why did Young Master Qin do it himself? That wasn’t appropriate!","The dancer lowered her gaze and had an idea of her own.","Qin Qi was fawning over Young Master Feng, who was so friendly toward the two young masters... So, these two young masters were probably the most prestigious ones here. The dancer wondered what their real identities were...","Feng Wu smiled brightly and sat down next to Feng Xun.","Jun Linyuan, on the other hand, looked very unapproachable.","Feng Xun looked from Jun Linyuan to Feng Wu and decided to talk to her.","Lowering his voice, he asked Feng Wu in a low voice that only the two of them could hear, “Hey, what’s wrong with you? Do you know what place this is? How could you come here?!”","Disguised as a man, Feng Wu looked very handsome. Together with the way she flapped her fan, she looked like a noble young master... Even Jun Linyuan wasn’t as good-looking as her, let alone Feng Xun.","Covering the lower half of her face with her fan, Feng Wu raised an eyebrow and glanced at Feng Xun. “How do I look?”","Feng Xun said in jealousy, “What do you think? Can’t you see those dancers, who have been staring at me, want to jump at you now?”","Feng Wu beamed at him. “Of course. A commoner like you can’t possibly be my match.”","Feng Xun clicked his tongue.","He finally saw that the girl was very playful and rebellious. She didn’t care about any rules, which reminded him a little of Jun Linyuan.","Feng Xun rolled his eyes at Boss Jun. “Aren’t you going to do something about","Jun Linyuan snorted.","Do something about her? How? The girl would sway his sleeve back and forth and call him “Brother Jun”. He would get the moon for her if she wanted to. Attending such an event was nothing!","Of course, the crown prince all thought to himself.","He glanced at Feng Xun. “Aren’t you supposed to be her big brother?”","Feng Xun rolled his eyes. “It’s none of my business.”","Jun Linyuan smirked. It was as if he could control her. The girl was a little fiend!","Seeing the look on Jun Linyuan’s face, Feng Xun knew that there was nothing he could do. He could only comfort himself with a wry smile. “Well, there are only female dancers. She’ll just watch and satisfy her curiosity. Nothing will happen.”","Feng Xun rubbed his chin. If those were male dancers, someone might already be killed by now.","While Feng Xun and Jun Linyuan were talking, Feng Wu asked the dancers to start dancing again.","Feng Wu noticed that there were twelve dancers in total.."]},{"number":3653,"title":"Chapter 3653: Courting Women (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3653: Courting Women (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The two most outstanding ones were the ones she had pointed out to Jun","Linyuan in the room earlier.","Feng Wu realized that they were all named after flowers.","One was called Miss Lotus.","One was called Tuberose.","Master Zhao wouldn’t let go of Miss Lotus.","Tuberose, on the other hand, was the dancer who had been with Feng Xun earlier.","The rest of the dancers were also named after flowers. Some were called Miss Rose, and some were called Pansy or Freesia.","But Miss Lotus and Tuberose were the best.","Right now, Miss Lotus was standing next to Master Zhao.","Master Zhao wasn’t alone. He had two servants with him.","Tuberose had been dancing around Feng Wu.","To her, Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan were equally outstanding, but Feng Wu seemed to be an unsophisticated young master who would spend a lot of money. The other one, on the other hand, was unapproachable.","Hence, she put all her attention on Feng Wu.","She danced around Feng Wu for a while before moving closer to Qin Qi. She then came back and danced between Feng Wu’s legs. She was doing everything she could.","“This is great!”","Feng Wu took out some money and stuffed it into Tuberose’s clothes.","She was moving around so much that Feng Wu had to stuff the money into her bra.","Seeing how generous Feng Wu was, Tuberose decided that she was going to stay by Feng Wu’s side tonight.","Jun Linyuan was speechless.","He saw the way the girl clapped, cheered, and rewarded the dancer like a veteran.","Feng Xun gave him a sympathetic look.","Feng Wu was the one who enjoyed the event here, and she had outshone all the real men here.","On any other day, Qin Qi wouldn’t have let anyone steal his thunder, but he didn’t dare to do that now. He could only steal glances at Feng Wu with an indescribable look in his eyes.","Seeing that Boss Jun’s face was getting darker and darker, Feng Xun couldn’t stand it anymore. Holding a silver note, he beckoned Tuberose over.","It wasn’t like Tuberose didn’t care about money. Swinging her arms, she headed for Feng Xun.","Feng Xun glanced at Feng Wu in satisfaction.","However, Feng Wu didn’t have time to meet his gaze. As soon as Tuberose left, other dancers began to move toward Feng Wu.","Rose and Freesia would have come as well, but Miss Lotus was the first to take the seat, and the others didn’t dare to come.","Miss Lotus was the dancer Feng Wu had been talking about. She was a top-heavy woman with a tiny waist and long legs. As she danced around Feng","Wu’s legs, she put Feng Wu’s hands on her waist and danced with her.","Holy crap!","Feng Xun couldn’t believe his eyes!","These women knew how to play!","Xiao Wu was so... amazing!","Feng Xun couldn’t bring himself to look at Boss Jun anymore. The guy hadn’t lost his temper yet, and that took a lot of self-control.","Feng Xun felt the temperature drop for a split second.","Seeing that Feng Wu’s seat had been taken, Tuberose, who had been dancing around Feng Xun, grew anxious. She quickly moved toward Feng Wu, and Feng Xun couldn’t stop her.","In the end, the two most popular girls, Tuberose and Miss Lotus, competed with each other in front of Feng Wu, doing everything they could to show off their graceful bodies.","Feng Xun and Qin Qi exchanged complicated looks.."]},{"number":3654,"title":"Chapter 3654: Courting Women (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3654: Courting Women (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then!","Thump!","The sound of a teacup hitting the floor startled everyone.","Feng Xun and the others turned their heads and saw that it was the neglected Master Zhao.","Zhao Yi was the soon-to-be mayor of Yong City and a fourth-ranked official.","A high-ranking official didn’t mean much in the imperial capital because a mere porter in the imperial capital might be able to crush a fifth-ranked official. However, things would be different once they were outside the imperial capital.","Zhao Yi asked, “What tea is this? It tastes awful!”","He threw the teacup in Feng Wu’s direction.","However, he restrained himself and didn’t dare to hit Feng Wu directly. Instead, he smashed the cup at Miss Lotus’s feet, splashing tea all over the floor.","The first reaction of the dancers was to stumble back.","Feng Wu frowned and glanced at Zhao Yi, looking displeased. “What’s wrong with you? Why did you do that?”","Since she was trying to experience the world, Feng Wu didn’t like to be disturbed.","Zhao Yi smirked.","He didn’t say anything, but his entourage said sarcastically, “It was just an accident. How unlucky. Young Master, sorry about that.”","Master Zhao couldn’t be bothered to talk to her, so he let his servant speak instead.","Master Zhao smirked and stared at Miss Lotus. “Get your ass over here!” Frightened, Miss Lotus turned to Feng Wu for help.","Zhao Hang, Master Zhao’s entourage, was a tall, burly man. One look and one could tell that he was Zhao Yi’s guard.","He walked up to Miss Louts, grabbed her, and threw her at Zhao Yi’s feet.","The impact brought tears to Miss Lotus’s eyes, but she didn’t dare to fight back.","Those who could live in luxurious cabins had to be very well-connected.","Zhao Hang picked up Miss Lotus as if she was a chicken. “I’ll take her upstairs now. ”","Zhao Yi nodded.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","What was going on? Why did he have to give her attitude when he was trying to take her dancer away?","Zhao Yi rose to his feet, threw a contemptuous look at Feng Wu, and crossed his hands behind his back. He was about to go upstairs.","“Hey, wait.”","Feng Wu didn’t have the strength to stand up. She leaned back in her chair, unrolled her fan, and looked at Zhao Yi in an indifferent manner.","A hush fell over the crowd, and the dancers moved aside, not daring to utter a word.","They had a feeling that the two of them were going to break into a fight. Feng Xun glanced at Jun Linyuan.","“How did it feel to have a girlfriend fighting with another man over a woman?” Jun Linyuan rubbed his forehead in resignation, but he didn’t say anything in the end.","Feng Xun realized that Boss Jun didn’t seem to want to stand up for Feng Wu... Should he go help the girl? Feng Xun didn’t know what to think if he was going to help Feng Wu take the woman away.","“Zhao Yi, are you going to leave just like that?” Feng Wu glanced at him.","Zhao Yi?","Sir Zhao halted and turned to stare at Feng Wu.","Not many people knew his real name and dared to call him by his full name.","“May I ask who you are?” Master Zhao stared at Feng Wu with a straight face. Feng Wu smiled a little. ‘Who am I? Are you ready to hear my name?”","She played an arrogant wastrel to the tee.."]},{"number":3655,"title":"Chapter 3655: Who Do You Choose (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3655: Who Do You Choose (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He complained inwardly. He didn’t even know how to do that. Xiao Wu was such a genius.","Zhao Yi was clearly frightened.","“Which family are you from? Who gave you the courage to be so arrogant?!” Zhao Yi tried to probe Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smirked. ‘Which family? My family owns this ship!” This ship...","“The Northern Feng Mansion?!” Zhao Yi stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu gave no reply.","Zhao Yi smirked. “Northern Feng General only has one son, and his name is Feng Xun. He’s a Spiritual Overlord and His Royal Highness’s best friend. Are you saying you’re him?”","What?!","Immediately, all eyes were on Feng Wu, and Feng Xun was staring at her as well.","“Gosh! I’m sitting right next to you, and you’re blaming it on me? If my mother hears about this, I’ll be whipped!”","Feng Xun turned to Feng Wu for help, but Feng Wu only gave Zhao Yi a half-smile. “Of course. What’s the point of talking about my social status in a place like this? It’ll be abusing my power.”","Zhao Yi was speechless.","Feng Wu smiled at Zhao Yi. “You don’t look that young anymore. You’re in your 40s, aren’t you? It’s not every day that you get to be a governor. You’d better keep that position while you can.”","Zhao Yi stared at Feng Wu.","He wasn’t sure if the young “man” was telling the truth. If “he” really was Young Lord Feng, Zhao Yi knew he would definitely lose this battle.","If “he” wasn’t Young Lord Feng... Even Qin Qi, the second son of Earl Nanfeng, had given his seat to that “man”. “He” had to be a very important person.","At that thought, Zhao Yi stared at Feng Wu. “You’re definitely not Young Lord Feng! Who on earth are you?!”","Feng Wu flapped her fan and gave him a half-smile.","Zhao Yi said, “I know Dugu Mengxi. He’s the son of the Dugu family. Do you know him?”","Dugu Mengxi? Feng Wu recognized that name. He used to be with Feng Liu, but Feng Wu had taught him a lesson. He had been running away from Feng Wu since then.","Feng Wu said, “It’s been a while since I last saw him. Why? Are you on friendly terms with him?”","Zhao Yi only said that to show that he had connections with the Dugu family and to warn Feng Wu not to be too arrogant.","Hearing that, Zhao Yi had an idea.","He decided that the young “man” was indeed from an influential family, but","“he” wasn’t too important because “he” couldn’t even get Dugu Mengxi’s help.","At that thought, Zhao Yi sneered at Feng Wu. “I’m going to have Miss Lotus tonight!”","Feng Wu shook her head. “That won’t do. Everything has to be consensual. Miss","Lotus doesn’t like you. You can’t force her.”","Zhao Yi smirked. “Are you saying she likes you?”","Feng Wu chuckled. “All young women like good-looking people. Aren’t I good-looking?”","Zhao Yi didn’t know what to say.","Of course, “he” was good-looking!","“He” was a handsome teenager with a casual air about “him”. Even if ‘he” didn’t spend any money, “his” good looks would get “him” into every door.","Feng Xun and Qin Qi exchanged looks.","None of them was as popular as Feng Wu, and they had to admit their defeat.","Feng Xun stole another glance at Boss Jun, and as expected, Boss Jun’s cheek was twitching.","Feng Wu even asked Miss Lotus. “Do you want to go with him? No one will force you if you don’t want to.”","Miss Lotus was put in a difficult spot.","Needless to say, she wanted to keep the young master company, for “he” was indeed too handsome. “He” had a nice smile and a nice voice.. She had never met anyone as beautiful as “he” was..."]},{"number":3656,"title":"Chapter 3656: Who Do You Choose (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3656: Who Do You Choose (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","But “he” was too prestigious, and Miss Lotus felt she wasn’t good enough.","She wondered if the teenager was more prestigious than Zhao Yi.","Zhao Yi gloated. “Dugu Ling is my godfather. Young man, I don’t care who you are. You won’t dare offend the Dugu family!”","Feng Wu was surprised. “Dugu Ling is your godfather? He’s not much older than you, is he?”","Zhao Yi was rendered speechless, and his face went scarlet red. “You don’t even dare to tell me your real name! You’re just a fake! I’ll write a letter to the Dugu family now, and they’ll know who you are!”","Feng Wu said, “The Dugu family is just like any other family.”","Zhao Yi smirked. “You don’t even respect the Dugu family? Do you think you’re His Royal Highness?","“The Dugu family is the empress’s family, as well as the second prince’s. Even His Majesty has to address Dugu Ling as his uncle.”","Zhao Yi referred to Dugu Ling as his godfather, which meant he was very close to that family.","After Zhao Yi showed his strength, Miss Lotus went up to him.","Zhao Yi laughed.","He gave Feng Wu a gloating look as he put his arm around Miss Lotus, then left with her.","Feng Xun was dumbfounded.","As a matter of fact, if Feng Wu had really tried, Miss Lotus would have come with her. The mayor of Yong City was nothing.","“How could you live with that?” Feng Xun couldn’t believe his eyes.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “What was I supposed to do? What would I do if she spends the night in my room? I can’t sleep with her, can I?”","Feng Xun cleared his throat.","Just then, Tuberose was about to move closer to Feng Wu when Qin Qi stopped her and reminded her in a low voice, “We can’t afford to offend that master.","Stay out of trouble.”","Tuberose said, “But... didn’t he lose to Sir Zhao? That means Sir Zhao is better than him.”","Qin Qi said, “No, that’s not what happened. That young master only needs to flick his fingers, and Zhao Yi has to kneel. He just couldn’t be bothered to do that. Come and have some fun with me.”","After that, Qin Qi took her back to his room.","Meanwhile, Jun Linyuan’s face had turned livid. Turning around, Feng Wu saw that her Brother Jun was genuinely angry. She cleared her throat and said, “It’s late. We should go to bed.”","After that, she rose to her feet and walked up the stairs.","Jun Linyuan followed her as soon as she left.","His shadow completely enveloped Feng Wu.","Thump!","The door closed.","The crown prince glared at Feng Wu. “Were you having fun?!”","Feng Wu sat down on a chair and flapped her fan. She then glanced at Jun Linyuan and said, “The atmosphere isn’t right tonight. If that was a civilized banquet, I could write poems that would make them the most famous dancers!”","Jun Linyuan rubbed his forehead.","The more she thought about it, the more pleased Feng Wu became. “What a pity. Why did Zhao Yi try to sabotage everything? I didn’t get to write any poems. That might be the biggest regret in my life.”","Jun Linyuan couldn’t bring himself to be mad at her. In the end, he patted her on the head. “What on earth are you thinking all the time? Why did you enjoy that kind of thing so much?”","Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan in disbelief. “Are you a saint of something? Can’t you feel a thing when such a pretty woman dances around you?”","Jun Linyuan’s face darkened.","Feng Wu said, “I had a lot of fun. Next time...”","Jun Linyuan said angrily, “What next time?!”"]},{"number":3657,"title":"Chapter 3657: Who Do You Choose (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3657: Who Do You Choose (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu cringed. “No, there won’t be a next time...”","Only then did Jun Linyuan look a little happier.","Feng Wu mumbled.","Jun Linyuan glared at her. “What did you say?”","Feng Wu said gingerly, “Why couldn’t you enjoy it? That’s just silly.”","The crown prince said, “What?!”","Feng Wu said, “No, I didn’t say anything...”","Jun Linyuan was a little mad at the girl, and he stuffed her under the blanket, “Go to sleep!”","Feng Wu’s face was covered. “Hm, I...”","Jun Linyuan knocked her on the head over the blanket. “Be quiet! Sleep!” Feng Wu closed her eyes, knowing that she couldn’t fight back.","She was as weak as she was before she started cultivating. After that night’s event, she was exhausted. She fell asleep almost right away.","Jun Linyuan watched in disbelief as Feng Wu snored under the blanket...","With her head covered, the girl was sound asleep. Her cheeks were flushed and bubbles were coming out of her mouth. She was sleeping as soundly as a baby.","Jun Linyuan let out a breath of relief and mumbled in resignation, “What a baby.”","Qin Qi and Tuberose chatted after they slept with each other.","“Young Master Qin, I’m still very curious. Who is that young master?” Tuberose lay in bed and held Qin Qi’s arm. ‘You seem to respect him a lot, but Lord Zhao won the competition. I’m so confused.”","Qin Qi was amused. “Do you think that teenager was defeated by Zhao Yi?”","Tuberose said, “That’s right. Miss Lotus is our most popular girl, and everyone wants to get close to her. If anyone has a chance, they’ll want to compete over her. Otherwise, they’ll have to sleep alone tonight...’","Qin Qi almost burst out laughing. “Sleep alone? You’re making me laugh.”","Tuberose patted Qin Yi’s chest shyly. “You’re such a naughty boy. Just tell me.”","Qin Qi said, “Miss Lotus won’t be able to sleep with that teenager because she’s a girl.”","Huh? She stared at Qin Qi in disbelief. ‘You’re lying! ”","Qin Qi said, “I’m not. You’ll see tomorrow.”","Tuberose said, “That girl... That girl was making fun of us, wasn’t she? Was she looking down on us? She’s a woman. Why didn’t attend such an event? Why did she flirt with us? She...","Tuberose was a little vexed and didn’t choose her words carefully.","Qin Qi glanced at her. “Don’t say those words once you leave this room. If you offend that girl, no one will be able to save you. Now, get lost.”","“Young Master Qin...” Panic-stricken, Tuberose wrapped her arms around Qin","However, Qin Qi didn’t want the woman to offend Feng Xun, so he told her to get lost.","Tuberose was kicked out before she was fully dressed. However, someone grabbed her and dragged her into another cabin.","The sun shone brightly the next morning.","Feng Wu had changed back to her female outfit and was taking a walk on the deck with Jun Linyuan.","Thanks to Jun Linyuan’s Spiritual Saint Liquid every day, Feng Wu was getting better. Although she was still weak. she could walk a few steps now.","A woman had been staring at Feng Wu from behind the door with a grim look in her eyes.."]},{"number":3658,"title":"Chapter 3658: Who Do You Choose (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3658: Who Do You Choose (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She stared at Feng Wu with eyes filled with hatred.","Feng Wu was walking when she sensed someone staring at her. She looked up in that direction involuntarily.","The door was tightly shut, and there was nothing out of the ordinary.","Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan in bewilderment. “Is someone looking at me?”","Jun Linyuan nodded. “Yes.”","Feng Wu asked, “Who’s that?”","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu but didn’t say anything.","As smart as Feng Wu was, she suddenly realized something and chuckled. “It couldn’t have been one of those women from last night, could it?” Jun Linyuan helped Feng Wu sit down and put some food on the table.","Feng Xun couldn’t believe his eyes.","Boss Jun was such a respected figure that even Emperor Wu couldn’t let him do anything. But now, Jun Linyuan was taking care of Feng Wu and had done a great job.","Feng Xun asked Feng Wu as he stuffed some buns into his mouth, “Did you sleep well last night?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “I was exhausted yesterday and went to bed right away. I slept for 12 hours. It’s such a wonderful day to come out and enjoy the sun.” She sipped her tea as she spoke.","Feng Xun smiled mysteriously and whispered to Feng Wu, “When the ship stopped at the harbor this morning to replenish its supplies, I actually saw Zhao Yi’s servant leave the ship in a hurry and come back when the ship was about to set out. I sent someone to ask around and found out Zhao Yi had sent a letter to the Dugu family.”","Feng Wu said, “Did he ask Dugu Ling for help? I didn’t hit him or anything.”","Feng Xun said, “Of course, it’s not that simple. Take a look at this letter.” Feng Xun had even gotten that letter? Zhao Yi didn’t have a chance at all. Feng Wu asked, “Is it a bad idea to read other people’s letters?”","Feng Xun said, “You wouldn’t have asked that if you knew what the letter said about you.”","Feng Wu glanced at him, then read the letter.","How interesting.","There was a portrait of Feng Wu in the letter. Although it couldn’t depict a","fraction of Feng Wu’s charm, one could still recognize her features. Everyone in the Dugu family had met her before, and they could tell it was her right away.","Zhao Yi was asking Dugu Ling if the person was Feng Xun. If that was the case, he could use the opportunity to frame Feng Xun. As for how to do it, Zhao Yi even wrote down the plan in the letter, saying that it was a preliminary plan and that he needed his godfather’s advice.","That plan... Feng Wu frowned as soon as she saw it. It was malicious!","She gripped the letter. If the target hadn’t been her but an ordinary person, they would be doomed by this letter. Life away from the court was just as dangerous.","Feng Wu looked up at Feng Xun and apologized. “I’m sorry, but I only mentioned the Northern Feng Mansion on a whim...”","Because Feng Wu was the goddaughter of the Northern Feng Mansion, she had no problem mentioning her identity. However, she didn’t deny it when the other party suspected that she was Feng Xun.","She didn’t deny it because she tried to mislead Zhao Yi, but...","Feng Xun said grumpily, ‘What’s there to apologize for? I’m only showing you this letter because I want to ask you if we should kill Zhao Yi now or keep him for later. If we can do it now, I’ll cut his head off.”","Feng Xun was furious.. Someone had set him up like this, not to mention that it was a petty fourth-ranked official!"]},{"number":3659,"title":"Chapter 3659: Have an Egg (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3659: Have an Egg (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu rubbed her chin. Should she kill him now or later?","“There’s another sentence here that mentions the former governor of Yong City.” Feng Wu pointed at the last sentence. “His death might actually have something to do with Zhao Yi.”","Feng Xun stood up angrily. “I’m going to...”","Feng Wu shook her head. “Calm down. We still have a few days before we reach Yong City. Let’s do some investigation in the next few days. We don’t want to alarm them.”","Feng Xun nodded and fought back his anger.","Feng Wu chuckled. “Just think about it. Not only hasn’t he given out his letter, but you’ve also gotten hold of it. You now know all his plans. Won’t it be fun to watch him pretend to be innocent?”","Jun Linyuan removed the top two-thirds of the eggshell, scooped up a spoonful of yolk, and fed it to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu ate it off his hand.","She liked the soft and buttery texture of the half-cooked egg. No one else could make it, but Jun Linyuan could keep the temperature under control and cook the raw eggs with his hands.","Feng Wu was so surprised and happy when Jun Linyuan made the egg for her for the first time that he had gotten used to doing it every day after that. But Feng Xun wasn’t used to it. This was the first time he had ever seen it.","He stared at Boss Jun in bewilderment...","Why did it feel like Boss Jun was raising a daughter?","Feng Wu only spoke to Feng Xun after finishing the egg. “Go on.”","Feng Xun said, “Right... Where was I?”","Was Boss Jun still the same Jun Linyuan who had put a destructive sword on Emperor Wu’s neck? Feng Xun was really curious. Would everyone become like this when they fell in love with a girl?","Feng Wu said, “Eat an egg to nourish your brain.”","Feng Xun cleared his throat. “Ahem, I meant...”","Just then, two people slowly walked down the stairs. It was Zhao Yi, and next to him was Miss Lotus.","Miss Lotus gave Feng Xun and the others an apologetic look, but she was amazed when she saw Feng Wu.","What a beautiful girl!","Her eyebrows were like distant mountains, her eyes were as limpid as autumn water, her skin was as smooth as jade, and she looked as pretty as a picture... She was so unique!","Miss Lotus was already a top courtesan and had great looks, but she was nothing compared to Feng Wu.","Zhao Yi couldn’t believe it.","He let go of Miss Lotus and stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Xun was worried that Jun Linyuan would slap him to death, which would hinder their investigation. Hence, he reminded him, “Master Zhao, what are","you looking at?”","Zhao Yi cleared his throat.","“May I ask for your name?” He cut to the chase.","Feng Wu suddenly smiled. “Didn’t you ask me that question last night? Why are you asking me again? That’s just annoying.”","Last night? How was that possible? Last night...","“It’s you?!” Miss Lotus came back to herself and stared at Feng Wu. “That noble young master from last night was you?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Miss Lotus was speechless.","Zhao Yi was astonished.","So, this woman was the one who had been competing with him the night before! That teenager was a woman!","And he had just tried to...","Zhao Yi didn’t know what to say. He couldn’t sit still anymore and went back to his cabin.","Miss Lotus gave her an apologetic look and followed Zhao Yi.."]},{"number":3660,"title":"Chapter 3660: Have an Egg (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3660: Have an Egg (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu had a good impression of Miss Lotus, so she reminded her, “Zhao Yi isn’t a nice person. Be careful.”","Miss Lotus stopped, turned around, and gave Feng Wu a wry smile. “It’s not up to me.”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s going on?”","Miss Lotus looked up at the cabin on the second floor, where the door was tightly shut.","After some thought, she sat down in front of Feng Wu and couldn’t hold back her sorrow anymore.","“He tricked me...” Miss Lotus buried her face in her hands and burst into tears.","Feng Wu and Feng Xun exchanged looks. Was it that serious?","“What happened? What did he do to you?” Feng Wu was curious. Had Zhao Yi put some undead insect or poison in Miss Lotus?","Miss Lotus smiled bitterly. “Last night...”","Hearing that, Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan, who wasn’t interested at all. He was only interested in looking after Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at Feng Xun again, and they both saw astonishment in each other’s eyes.","“What? Is that even possible?!” Qin Qi was astonished when he walked over and heard what Miss Lotus said. “I’ve never heard such a thing before!”","As it turned out...","Last night, Zhao Yi took Miss Lotus back to his room. After they slept together, Zhao Yi had a pot of soup brought to him. He drank half of it before putting it back on the table.","After getting on board, Miss Lotus was parched from all the dancing and fiddling, and there was no teapot on the table...","Seeing that Zhao Yi had fallen asleep, she thought that he wouldn’t drink the soup anymore, so she drank it.","She had been complaining inwardly about how stingy Zhao Yi was. He had only brought a little pot of soup and... what was that soup? After drinking it, she felt refreshed as if she had been washed clean.","Zhao Yi woke up when Miss Lotus was still in a trance-like state. Seeing this, he panicked and snatched the bowl out of her hands. One look and Zhao Yi was furious!","“How could this happen?! How could you drink it?! You bitch!” He was furious.","Frightened, Miss Lotus dropped to her knees without getting dressed.","Zhao Yi was furious. “That’s the medicine for my breakthrough! I’m about to make a breakthrough, and I’ve just taken a sip! I was going to take a second sip, but you drank it!”","Knowing that things were getting out of hand, Miss Lotus panicked and kept crying for mercy.","She went pale and cried. “I’ll pay for it.”","However, Zhao Yi only grew angrier as he spoke. He kept telling her what precious herbs and potions were in the soup and that they couldn’t be bought on the market. The Dugu family had prepared them for him...”","In the end, he gave her a price, which frightened Miss Lotus.","“1000 spiritual stones! My soup is worth 1000 spiritual stones!” Zhao Yi pointed at Miss Lotus’s head and said angrily, “You wouldn’t be worth that much even if you’re sold a hundred times.”","Miss Lotus had served cultivators before and knew a thing or two about cultivation. She couldn’t help but retort, “How could it be that expensive...you!”"]},{"number":3661,"title":"Chapter 3661: A Trap (1)o","paragraphs":["Chapter 3661: A Trap (1)o","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhao Yi said, “You’ve stopped me from making a breakthrough, and you’re still trying to retort? Fine. Give me back my medicine. Not your vomit!”","Miss Lotus was speechless.","After much persuasion, Zhao Yi finally nodded and agreed to let Miss Lotus sell herself to him.","Poor Miss Lotus. She had already freed herself from her previous brothel and had accumulated quite a lot of wealth over the years. However, not only had she lost all her savings, but she had also been forced to sign a contract to sell herself to Zhao Yi.","Feng Wu found it preposterous. “What medicine was that? 1,000 spiritual stones?”","Feng Xun couldn’t figure it out either. “That Zhao Yi set you up. Big time.”","Feng Wu looked at Miss Lotus. “And you sold yourself like that?”","Miss Lotus nodded, still crying. “If I didn’t sign the contract, Master Zhao said he would report it to the officials. He’s a government official, and the other officials will always protect him. He’ll win no matter what. So...”","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead in resignation. “You really are...”","Just then, someone walked out. Feng Wu looked up and saw that it was indeed her archenemy.","Zhao Yi stood there and stared at Feng Wu.","Of course, Feng Wu wasn’t scared. She glared back at him.","Zhao Yi smirked and turned to Miss Lotus. “Get over here!”","Despite her frustration, Miss Lotus had no choice but to slowly walk up to Zhao Yi.","Seeing her red eyes, Zhao Yi knew that she had been crying. When he saw how angry Feng Wu and the others were, he realized what had happened.","“You complained to them! Bitch!” Zhao Yi kicked Miss Lotus.","The kick was so hard that it sent Miss Lotus flying backward.","They were on the deck.","Such a force could send someone overboard, and that was what happened.","Feng Xun rose to his feet when Miss Lotus flew backward and dragged her back.","Otherwise, she would have flown off the deck and fallen into the surging river.","Feng Wu was really angry now.","She stared at Zhao Yi with cold eyes.","Zhao Yi smirked and stared at Miss Lotus. “Get your ass over here!”","Seeing the look on Zhao Yi’s face, Miss Lotus was terrified. Holding her waist, she timidly walked toward him...","Feng Wu said to her, “If you don’t go, no one can force you.”","Miss Lotus stopped and turned to look at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at her with a reassuring look in her eyes, which gave Miss Lotus a very safe feeling.","But... Miss Lotus smiled bitterly.","This beautiful girl was only trying to help her out of kindness. However, Zhao Yi was backed by the Dugu family, and she couldn’t afford to offend him.","Miss Lotus smiled bitterly and shook her head at Feng Wu. In the end, she went up to Zhao Yi.","Feng Wu shook her head and said to Feng Xun, “I don’t like him.”","She pointed at Zhao Yi.","Many people were shocked.","What was that supposed to mean?","Did this pretty girl just say that she didn’t like Master Zhao?","Feng Xun nodded as he rolled up his sleeves. “What a coincidence. I don’t like him either.”","As he spoke, he stretched and cracked his knuckles.","Zhao Yi panicked for no reason.","“W- What are you doing?” He glared at Feng Xun. Feng Xun smiled. “I’m going to hit you.”","Feng Xun raised his fist before he said another word.","With a thump, Zhao Yi flew backward.."]},{"number":3662,"title":"Chapter 3662: A Trap (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3662: A Trap (2)","Everyone stared at Feng Xun in astonishment.","He had made a move!","Miss Lotus blanched!","“He’s the mayor of Yong City!”","Then, they saw Feng Xun raise his hand and drag Zhao Yi back.","He could move objects across the air!","Luckily, the teenager didn’t throw Mayor Zhao overboard. That was proof enough of his apprehension.","At that thought, Miss Lotus let out a breath of relief.","However, before she could relax, she saw that Feng Xun had clenched his other hand into a fist.","He then punched Zhao Yi in the stomach!","“How dare you pick on Xiao Wu when she’s too weak to do anything to you?","“She’s not someone you can pick on! I’m making it clear!","“How dare you snort in front of Xiao Wu? You clown!”","Zhao Yi was furious.","Before he knew it, he had been punched a few times in the stomach.","The punches were so hard that he thought his ribs were going to break.","Zhao Yi’s guards and entourage ran toward him.","But Feng Xun was too fierce.","These people were nothing in front of him. Young Lord Feng was a Spiritual Overlord now, and he could do whatever he wanted on this continent!","Thump, thump, thump!","Feng Xun kicked the four guards into the river before they could get close enough.","Zhao Yi’s heart sank...","He shouted, “Stop! Stop!”","But Feng Xun wouldn’t stop until he had had enough.","Zhao Yi looked enviously at his servants and wished he had been kicked into the river.","Feng Xun smirked. “I haven’t had enough yet. Do you think I’ll let you go?”","Master Zhao was a cultivator himself, but he was no more than an ant in front of a Sniritnal Overlord-","Seeing that the fight was over, Feng Xun tossed Master Zhao aside and smirked. “I’m only going to teach you a little lesson. If you dare to glare at Xiao Wu again, you’ll see!”","Zhao Yi used to be the most prestigious man on this ship, but he was in so much pain that he couldn’t even make a sound.","His servants climbed back onto the ship and gingerly walked up to Zhao Yi. When Feng Xun turned to look at Feng Wu, two of the guards picked Zhao Yi up and jumped into the river together.","“Hey, you...’","When Feng Xun looked over his shoulder, he saw that they had jumped into the water.","Feng Xun didn’t know what to say. “Why did they run away so soon? I’ve vented my anger, and I won’t hit him again.”","Feng Wu already didn’t like Zhao Yi when he forced Miss Lotus to sign the contract. Now that he had kicked Miss Lotus for no reason, she didn’t like him at all.","Therefore, Feng Wu had no problem when Feng Xun beat him up.","Seeing that he had run off, Feng Wu frowned a little.","Feng Xun studied Feng Wu’s face. “How about I go get them back?” The river was nothing to a Spiritual Overlord.","Feng Wu gave it some thought and smiled. “Don’t worry. He’ll come back.”","Seeing how hard Zhao Yi was trying to swim away, Feng Xun was suspicious.","“Will he?”","Feng Wu smiled. “Yes.”","Meanwhile, Miss Lotus finally burst into tears.","Feng Wu said in resignation, “We’ve chased him away. Why are you still crying?","Miss Lotus cried even harder. “Miss, I’m worried about you..”O"]},{"number":3663,"title":"Chapter 3663: Forever Flower House","paragraphs":["Chapter 3663: Forever Flower House","Feng Wu looked at her in bewilderment. “Why are you worried about me?","Miss Lotus said in tears, “He told me that he was going to Yong City to take up his post. He’s the future mayor, and he has connections with the Dugu family, where Empress Dugu is from. Miss, if you help me like this, you’ll get yourself in trouble as well. What should we do?”","Zhao Yi and Miss Lotus weren’t the only passengers. There were many others on board.","Although the others enjoyed watching Feng Xun beat up Zhao Yi, they were still worried about the consequences he would face.","Uncle Zhao said to Feng Wu and the others, “We’re almost at the wharf of Yi City. You should take this opportunity to get off the ship and hide from the limelight.”","Aunt Wang nodded. “That’s right. Master Zhao doesn’t look like a good person at all. He’s gone for now, but he’ll definitely come back with more people. He won’t let you off the hook! So, please leave!”","Feng Wu only smiled.","Feng Xun smiled as well. “If he wants to come, let him. We’re not afraid of him.","The others didn’t know what to say. They felt Feng Wu and her friends were so arrogant that they were bound to lose out.","Seeing that Miss Lotus still wanted to say something, Tuberose tugged at her sleeve.","“Don’t say another word, or you’ll get yourself into trouble later.” She asked","Miss Lotus, “Are you getting off at Yi City?”","Miss Lotus said, “I... I don’t know.”","Lowering her voice, Tuberose threw a dirty look at Miss Lotus. “You started this! Do you think Master Zhao will let you off the hook? You’re so dead!”","Seeing that Miss Lotus was silent, Tuberose added, “Run as fast as you can.","Your life is more important than anything else!”","She then walked past Miss Lotus and went back to her own room.","A cold voice rang out next to her. “Done?”","Tuberose was a little scared, but she soon nodded. “I’ve told her everything as you instructed. As for if she’ll run away...”","The eerie voice smirked. “Does it really matter?”","Huh? Tuberose looked at the mysterious masked man in bewilderment. When she was kicked out by Qin Qi, the masked man dragged her away, and she became part of a scheme.","However, an official boat arrived before they reached the harbor of Yi City.","“Shit!”","The first mate had been watching anxiously from the deck, and soon, he saw a government boat sailing in their direction at an unbelievable speed.","The look on his face changed a little, and he turned to Feng Xun. “The boat supervisor is here.”","Feng Xun was confused. “Boat supervisor? What’s that?”","The first mate didn’t seem pleased. Before he could say anything, Uncle Zhao beat him to it. “They’re in charge of supervising the ships sailing in this river. The highest-ranking official is Li Chaodeng, the eldest son of Duke Li.”","The first mate looked at Uncle Zhao in bewilderment. “You know a lot.”","Uncle Zhao stroked his beard and chuckled. Next to him, Madam Wang said grumpily, “He’s not some ignorant old man. If I remember it correctly, you’re from the Shadowless Sect, aren’t you?”","Uncle Zhao smiled and didn’t retort.","The Shadowless Sect? Feng Wu remembered that Elder Dongfang and","Dongfang Ziyun were from that sect, which was one of the four major sects.","“You’re not an ordinary middle-aged woman either. You’re in charge of running the Flower Forever House in the capital..”o"]},{"number":3664,"title":"Chapter 3664: How Could It Be Them","paragraphs":["Chapter 3664: How Could It Be Them","Feng Wu glanced at them curiously. She had heard of Flower Forever before. It was the second-largest brothel in the imperial capital.","She didn’t expect to see so many capable people on board.","“Well, we still haven’t figured out who you are.” Madam Wang looked from Feng Wu to Feng Xun and Jun Linyuan. “You’re too outstanding to be an ordinary man. I’ve met quite a few young lords, but I’ve never met anyone like the three of you.”","The first mate said anxiously, “The inspection boat is coming soon. Normally, we won’t meet them before we pass Yi City and on our way to Luan City. I’m afraid Master Zhao has reported to them.”","The first mate still had no idea that Feng Xun was Young Lord Feng. Dragging Feng Xun aside, he asked in an anxious voice, “Do you have something to tell","Feng Xun was confused. “Tell you what?”","The first mate said anxiously, “If you’re caught and locked up, no one will be able to save you. If you want to live, tell me your plan!”","Feng Xun rubbed his nose.","The first mate sighed. “You have a point. Master Li Chaodeng is coming, and Master Zhao has connections with the Dugu family. The Li family and the Dugu family are long-time friends. You’ve really run into some trouble this time. “I just hope that the Soaring Wings won’t be dragged into this,” the first mate murmured.","Feng Xun gave him a strange look.","The first mate gave Feng Xun a pleading look. “Young Master Feng, you’re not going to make our ship in trouble, are you?”","Feng Xun gave him another strange look. “Young Master Feng?”","The first mate was confused. Had he addressed the young man incorrectly?","Just then, Feng Xun tossed him a token.","The first mate was confused. Why did Young Master Feng give him that token? Was he some kind of master in the imperial capital?","However, one look at the token and his legs gave out!","Because it was...","“Feng... Feng...” The first mate couldn’t utter a word.","Just then, a hand landed on his shoulder.","Qin Qi gloated. “Didn’t I tell you? He’s your master. What did you say before?","You said if he was your master, you would eat this ship! Come, eat it for me.”","The first mate was almost in tears. Covering Qin Qi’s mouth with his hand, he turned to Feng Xun with an ingratiating look on his face. “My lord.”","As he spoke, he was about to kneel down.","Feng Xun waved him off. “Don’t bother.”","After that, he took back the token and went back to Feng Wu.","The first mate was amazed when he saw how obedient his young lord was when he walked up to that girl.","Feng Xun was already the young lord of the Northern Feng Mansion, but he looked so docile when he stood next to the girl..","Wasn’t Young Lord Feng supposed to be unruly and short-tempered?","Who was this girl?","And who was the even more outstanding teenager?","If one didn’t know who Feng Xun was, it would be very hard to guess who Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan were. But now that Feng Xun was here...","“Don’t tell me that they’re...” The first mate stared at Qin Qi in excitement.","Qin Qi looked pleased. “Bingo.”","“OMG!","“Oh, my lord!","“How can it be them? How..."]},{"number":3665,"title":"Chapter 3665: Slander His Royal Highness (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3665: Slander His Royal Highness (1)","“How can it be them? How?” The first mate stared at Qin Qi in disbelief. Qin Qi smiled. “Hasn’t it happened already?”","The first mate took a deep breath. “That’s...”","Most of the people in this empire had never met Jun Linyuan or Feng Wu before, but most of them had heard of their names.","The others didn’t notice the conversation between Qin Qi and the first mate.","By then, Li Chaodeng had boarded the ship.","He wasn’t alone. Behind him was a group of strong cultivators.","The guards were all Spiritual Lords because they needed to supervise all the ships sailing in this river.","However, they were still an entire stage below Feng Xun, who was a Spiritual Overlord.","Dressed in his official uniform, Li Chaodeng crossed his hands behind his back and was escorted onto the ship.","By then, the Soaring Wing had stopped at the center of the river, and Captain Wu led a team of people toward them.","“Temporary inspection.” The subordinate next to Li Chaodeng, who had a broad saber at his waist, said loudly with a cold look in his eyes.","After that, they were ready to charge out.","Captain Wu frowned and said, “Wait.”","The man in the lead turned to look at Li Chaopan.","The only ones that hadn’t moved were Li Chaopan and the person next to him.","It was none other than Zhao Yi himself.","Captain Wu frowned. “Master Li, may I ask what crime we’ve committed to warrant such an inspection?”","Li Chaodeng slowly put his hands in front of him and hid them in his sleeves.","“What crime?” He turned to Zhao YI. “Tell him.","Zhao Yi glanced at Captain Wu. “Old Wu, if you don’t intervene now, you’ll have nothing to do with this. If you do, everyone on this ship will be arrested!”","Captain Wu was furious. “Master Zhao, you...’","Zhao Yi waved his hand. “I’m done talking. Hand over the criminals!”","“What criminals?” Captain Wu frowned.","“Them!”","Zhao Yi pointed at Feng Xun, Feng Wu, and Jun Linyuan.","Zhao Yi turned to Li Chaodeng. “It’s them! They’re trying to start a rebellion!”","“Rebellion?” Feng Wu was speechless. “What rebellion?”","Zhao Yi ignored Feng Wu and turned to Li Chaodeng. “They were criticizing His Royal Highness, saying that he... that he...’","Feng Wu and Feng Xun exchanged looks. Things were getting interesting.","Feng Wu had thought that Zhao Yi had brought Li Chaodeng here to accuse Feng Xun of beating him up, which was why he wanted to arrest them. As it turned out, he was slandering them...","However, that accusation...","Feng Wu only wanted to know how Zhao Yi would react when he found out that Jun Linyuan was one of the accused.","Feng Xun was standing in the shadows, so Li Chaodeng couldn’t see his face.","Feng Xun was going to come out, but he stopped when he heard Zhao Yi’s ridiculous excuse.","Right now, Feng Xun was leaning against a pillar with his arms crossed and a","smile on his face. He wanted to see what other ridiculous things Zhao Yi could come up with.","Just then, Jun Linyuan heard the noise and was walking down the stairs.","The teenager was an extraordinary sight.","He slowly walked down the stairs and looked straight ahead.","Zhao Yi panicked a little when he saw Jun Linyuan, but he still summoned up his courage.."]},{"number":3666,"title":"Chapter 3666: Slander His Royal Highness (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3666: Slander His Royal Highness (4)","Zhao Yi panicked a little when he saw Jun Linyuan, but he still summoned up his courage.","“It was him!” Pointing at Jun Linyuan, Zhao Yi turned to Li Chaodeng. “Master","Li, it was him. He was saying wild things about His Royal Highness Jun","Linyuan, saying that the crown prince of the empire was...” Zhao Yi tried his best to make things up in his head.","Meanwhile, Li Chaodeng was so baffled that his knees buckled.","He recognized Jun Linyuan!","Having lived in a remote corner for so long, Zhao Yi didn’t know who Jun Linyuan was. However, Li Chaodeng was the son of Duke Li, so of course, he knew what Jun Linyuan looked like.","Meanwhile, Zhao Yi was still making up stories.","He knew that if he told the others that he had been beaten up, those people might not be arrested for long, but if it involved insulting His Royal Highness, it would be very serious!","Hence, Zhao Yi said loudly, “He insulted His Royal Highness and said that he wasn’t good enough to be the crown prince. He also said other bad things...”","Everyone stared at Zhao Yi in astonishment.","He was lying through his teeth!","No one on the ship had ever mentioned His Royal Highness, let alone saying bad things about him.","But no one here was stupid. They knew that Zhao Yi had brought it up on purpose so that he could kill those people with that excuse. Meanwhile, the look on the first mate’s face was very interesting.","He gave Zhao Yi a sympathetic look.","Young Lord Feng was here in person!","And that exceptional teenager was the crown prince himself!","Seeing that Captain Wu was about to say something, the first mate rushed over, grabbed him, and whispered something in his ear. When Captain Wu looked up again, he stared at Jun Linyuan in astonishment.","Jun Linyuan walked up to Feng Wu and stopped by her side.","Li Chaodengs legs gave out, and he almost dropped to his knees.","“What else did we say?” Feng Xun walked out of the shadows with a grin.","Li Chaodeng knew Feng Xun as well.","He was ghastly pale when he recognized Feng Xun.","“Brother Feng...” Li Chaodeng’s knees buckled, and he grabbed Feng Xun’s arm to stop him from adding fuel to the fire.","“Brother Feng? Did you just call me that?” Feng Xun patted Li Chaodeng on the shoulder and smiled at him.","Li Chaodeng immediately corrected himself. “Boss Feng! You’re Boss Feng!”","The others gave him strange looks.","Sir Li was one of the most influential men on the river, and no passing boat would dare to offend him, not to mention that he was backed by someone as intimidating as the Li family.","But now...","Zhao Yi was equally dumbfounded and gave Li Chaodeng a questioning look.","“Master Li...”","Li Chaodeng was going to kneel down at Jun Linyuan’s feet, but judging by the look on Jun Linyuan’s face, if he dared to do that, the guy would probably kick him into the river.","After all, the crown prince wouldn’t have come here if it wasn’t for a private visit.","A private visit?!","That idea made Li Chaodeng break into a cold sweat again.","Without hesitation, he slapped Zhao Yi in the face.","The slap was so hard that Zhao Yi rolled around on the deck.","“What are you talking about?!” Li Chaodeng waved at his men. “Take him away!”","Zhao Yi was baffled.","He didn’t expect this turn of events and couldn’t react in time.."]},{"number":3667,"title":"Chapter 3667: The Supreme Crown Prince (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3667: The Supreme Crown Prince (1)","Li Chaodeng’s subordinates were also dumbfounded. According to Zhao Yi, the people on the ship were obviously rich. If they were arrested, they would pay a small fortune for their freedom. But now...","But in the end, they still listened to Li Chaodeng.","Therefore, Deputy Wang walked toward Lord Zhao skeptically.","Zhao Yi panicked. ‘Why... Why are you arresting me?! He’s the one you should be arresting!”","He pointed at Jun Linyuan as he spoke.","Li Zhaodeng was so frightened that his legs went weak. He kicked Zhao Yi and told his men, “Hurry up and take him away!”","“Hold on.”","Just as Zhao Yi was about to be taken away, Feng Xun chuckled and stopped them.","Everyone looked at him suspiciously.","What was this young man doing? The matter was about to calm down, and he still wanted to complicate the situation?","Uncle Zhao winked at him. “Young man, that’s enough.”","Madam Wang also tugged at his sleeve. “Don’t cause any more trouble!”","Everyone else on the ship agreed.","Feng Xun gave Li Chaodeng a half-smile. “Do you think I’m causing trouble?”","Li Chaodeng glanced at Jun Linyuan and put his hands in a hurry. “No, of course not!”","He smiled. “If that’s the case, why don’t you sit down?","Li Zhaodeng was pinned to the chair and couldn’t move.","Most importantly, he was frightened.","Feng Xun gave him an indifferent look. “The accusation of slandering the crown prince...”","Of course, Zhao Yi didn’t like how things were going, but judging by Li Chaodeng’s reaction, it seemed that the other party had a more powerful background, so Zhao Yi felt a little uneasy.","Li Chaodeng said, “Of course not! Others might dare to slander the crown prince, but you’re Feng Xun, his childhood friend. How can you slander him? Master Zhao was making things up!”","Feng Nun?","Zhao Yi frowned. Why did this name sound so familiar?","“Feng Wu? Young Lord Feng!” Madam Wang recognized that name first. Zhao Yi’s heart skipped a beat, and his expression turned extremely ugly!","It was Young Lord Feng from the Northern Feng Mansion...","No wonder he was so domineering previously!","Compared to General Northern Feng, Zhao Yi felt that the Dugu family was slightly inferior, so he felt even more uneasy.","“How do you think we should deal with this Master Zhao who slandered us?” Feng Xun grinned at Li Chaodeng.","Li Zhaodeng immediately slammed the table. “How should we deal with him?","Of course, we’ll...’","He had wanted to say they should lock Zhao Yi up, but the look in Jun Linyuan’s eyes told him that wasn’t enough.","“Why don’t we...”","“Why don’t you ask our girl here?” Feng Xun smiled at Feng Wu. “Xiao Wu, what do vou think we should do with him?”","Xiao Wu?!","Li Chaodeng’s heart sank when he heard the name!","He stared at Feng Wu with his dark eyes.","How could he not know about the conflict between Duke Li’s family and the Feng clan?","In the beginning, they were still in-laws. Later on, Li Chaopan divorced the eldest daughter of the Feng clan. This lawsuit actually reached the Imperial Court, and His Majesty personally tried it. In the end, the Li family was the one who suffered!","As the heir of Duke Li, Li Chaodeng naturally remembered this enmity. But now...","He stared at her. “You’re Feng Wu?!”","If he hadn’t been busy with work that day, he would have rushed back to the capital. Instead, he found out about all of this from his brother’s letter. Feng Wu looked at him and smiled. “I guess enemies are bound to meet.” Li Zhaodeng wasnt an official for nothing.. When he saw the crown prince..."]},{"number":3668,"title":"Chapter 3668: The Supreme Crown Prince (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3668: The Supreme Crown Prince (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Li Chaodeng wasn’t an official for nothing. When he saw the crown prince standing next to Feng Wu, he was discouraged. With Jun Linyuan’s protection, Feng Wu would be able to do anything she wanted.","Feng Wu gave Li Chaodeng a casual look. “What? Do you want to avenge your brother? To be honest, I didn’t have time to do anything for him because I was busy with something else. By the time I realized what was going on, I was already on this ship.”","She sat down opposite Li Chaodeng and looked at him expectantly. “So, are you really going to avenge your brother now?”","Li Zhaodeng’s face darkened.","No matter how much he wanted to avenge his brother, he wouldn’t dare to because Jun Linyuan’s eyes were as cold as ice.","His subordinate, Deputy Wang, had ready to rush forward when he heard Feng","Wu’s name.","However, when he heard Li Chaodeng’s words, he was puzzled. Li Chaodeng had been cursing Feng Wu behind her back, but now...","“My lord, didn’t you say that once we see Feng Wu...’","However, before Deputy Wang could finish, Li Chaodeng gave him a dirty look.","Deputy Wang was speechless.","Li Chaodeng turned to look at Feng Wu with a smile.","“Haha, Miss Feng Wu, I’ve heard so much about you but never had the chance to meet you. Finally!” Li Chaodeng was extremely enthusiastic as if meeting Feng Wu was his greatest honor.","Feng Wu was amazed.","If his brother had such a flexible attitude, he would not have gone through such humiliation from her.","Feng Wu looked at Li Chaopan indifferently. “Does that mean you really want to see me?”","Li Chaodeng said, “I’ve been looking forward to meeting you! I see that Miss Feng Wu is really... beautiful!”","Li Chaodeng gave her a thumbs-up as he spoke.","Feng Wu grinned.","Li Chaodeng didn’t feel embarrassed at all and became even more enthusiastic.","Feng Xun was speechless.","The onlookers were even more so.","The turn of events was too unexpected.","She smiled. “Oh? Then why are you here on this ship?”","“Why? Of course, we’re here to arrest you and take you back to split the ransom,” Deputy Wang thought to himself, but if he dared to say this now, he knew Li Chaodeng would slap him.","Li Chaodeng was all smiles. “It’s just a routine inspection.”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “Are you done?”","She had made it very clear, and Li Chaodeng could tell.","He rose to his feet in a hurry. He cupped his fists at the crown prince first, then said goodbye to Feng Wu. “We’re done. You can go now.”","Of course, Li Chaodeng wanted to get close to the future emperor, but Jun","Linyuan’s gaze was as cold as ice.","He could only leave with a bitter smile.","Li Chaodeng soon disappeared from everyone’s sight.","After he left. the people on the shin didn’t discuss what had just happened-","The backgrounds of these three teenagers seemed to be a little beyond their reach.","She rubbed her forehead with a wry smile. As a matter of fact, almost everyone’s identity had been exposed, especially Jun Linyuan. There was only one outstanding young man like him in the world, and he was too easy to guess.."]},{"number":3669,"title":"Chapter 3669: The Supreme Crown Prince (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3669: The Supreme Crown Prince (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“D-d-don’t tell me...” “They... they can’t be...”","“That was...","Everyone looked at each other and whispered, but they didn’t dare to ask. She rubbed her forehead. That was why she didn’t like to reveal her identity. If she did, it wouldn’t be fun anymore.","She was already thinking of moving to another ship.","Just then, someone asked gingerly, “Miss... Miss Feng Wu? You’re Miss Feng Wii?”","She turned around and saw that it was Miss Lotus.","She had been tricked into signing a contract with Zhao Yi to sell herself to him. Right now, she was standing in front of Feng Wu with a look of disbelief on her face, and her eyes wide open.","She threw up her hands. “Take a wild guess.”","At this moment, someone rushed over and bumped into Miss Lotus, knocking her to the side.","Tuberose glared at Miss Lotus, finding the latter utterly stupid.","Miss Lotus was puzzled. Why did Tuberose do that?","Tuberose was already kneeling on the floor. “Miss, you’re the young lady of a rich family. How can you not have a maid with you? I might be from a brothel, but I’m an excellent servant. Miss, let me stay by your side and serve you.”","Feng Wu looked down at Tuberose.","She was a smart woman, but she was too smart.","She knew why Tuberose didn’t let Miss Lotus ask about her identity, because once she said who she was, Tuberose wouldn’t even be qualified to be her maid.","She glanced at Tuberose and said nothing.","Tuberose said anxiously, “Miss, I was sold to a brothel when I was little and has lived a miserable life. I’m thinking about hanging myself all the time. Finally, I met such a kind young lady like you. Please help me.","“I can do everything. I can wash, cook, play musical instruments, paint...","“I don’t want to sell myself for money either. I only hope that you can take me in! ”","As she spoke, Tuberose prostrated on the ground and kowtowed for a long time.","Feng Xun didn’t know if Feng Wu was touched by her sincerity, but many onlookers were. They pitied her when they saw her cry.","Tuberose, you...” Miss Lotus looked at Tuberose in confusion.","Why did she say she lived a miserable life and wanted to hang herself? She was the madam’s favorite and was treated like a treasure. She lived more comfortably than noble young ladies. What was she talking about?","Miss Lotus wasn’t that smart. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been tricked by","Zhao Yi and signed a slave contract.","Her target wasn’t Miss Feng Wu, but...","Miss Lotus was shocked!","She never dreamed that Tuberose would have aimed so high.","“Miss Feng Wu, actually, we’re doing fine...” Miss Lotus reminded Feng Wu.","She felt Feng Wu looked weak, sickly, and not very energetic. If the kind young lady fell for Tuberose’s plan, her future would be ruined!","At that thought, Miss Lotus shifted her gaze from Feng Wu to Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince indeed had the ability to make women go crazy for him. However, Feng Wu had helped Miss Lotus, so the latter didn’t want Feng Wu’s future husband to be seduced by another woman.","As a member of a brothel, Miss Lotus knew what could happen.."]},{"number":3670,"title":"Chapter 3670: The Supreme Crown Prince (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3670: The Supreme Crown Prince (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She knew very well how powerful the charm techniques of the women in the brothel were.","Hence, Miss Lotus secretly reminded Feng Wu not to fall for Tuberose’s trick and take her in as a maid.","Tuberose understood what Miss Lotus was getting at. She raised her head and glared fiercely at the latter.","She had no intention of taking in a maid. Even if she did, she wouldn’t take in someone from a brothel, let alone a person as scheming as Tuberose.","A man could easily be seduced with such a woman around.","She glanced at Tuberose and said with a frown, “I have no intention of taking in a maid. Get up.”","However, the greatest opportunity in her life was right in front of her. How could Tuberose give it up? She banged her forehead on the floor.","Feng Wu didn’t know what else to do.","Jun Linyuan wanted to take Feng Wu back upstairs, but Feng Wu hadn’t settled the matter yet, so she didn’t want to leave just yet.","Knowing that Feng Wu was in poor health, Feng Xun was worried that she would get upset, so he tried to push her away. “Go to your room. I’ll take care of this.”","Feng Wu hesitated. “Are you sure?”","Feng Xun said proudly, “Of course!”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “Fine. You take care of it.”","She didn’t even look at Tuberose and followed Jun Linyuan upstairs.","Feng Wu really wasn’t feeling well. After the incident with Li Chaodeng, she went back to her room and fell asleep. By the time she woke up, it was already night.","She really thought that Feng Xun would take care of the situation, but...","At dinner time, she saw Tuberose serving at the table.","Feng Wu was confused.","Feng Wu, Feng Xun, and Jun Linyuan ate together, which was why Tuberose was here.","Feng Wu looked at Feng Xun in confusion.","Feng Xun shook his head.","“Leave us.” He gestured at Tuberose, dismissing her.","Tuberose lowered her head and obediently left the room. She never looked up, behaving as obedient as she could be.","The table was full of dishes, but Feng Wu had no appetite. She looked at Feng","Xun. “Did you take her in?”","Feng Xun said in a hurry, “Just as a maid, not a concubine. Why are you looking at me like that?”","Feng Wu wanted to slap him. “Feng Nun! What are you thinking?!”","Feng Xun dodged right away. “Hey, don’t hit me. Let me explain.”","Feng Wu glared at him. “I’m giving you one chance.”","Feng Xun sat up straight and said in a serious tone, “Actually, there are a few reasons why I’m doing this.","“First of all, she was crying so badly, and her forehead was bleeding. There were so many people watching. It didn’t feel right if I didn’t take her.” Feng Wu gave him a half-smile. “I didn’t know you were so kind, Feng Xun.”","“Ahem, there’s another reason, of course. She’s determined to stick to us. If neither of us agreed, she would beg Boss Jun later. Can you imagine the consequences?”","Feng Wu asked, “What consequences?”","Would Jun Linyuan say yes?","“Boss Jun is such an unyielding person. He would have sent her flying with a slap. She’s a living human life, and she’s so good-looking. It would be a pity if she dies like that.”","Feng Wu looked at him. “So?”","Feng Xun said, “She’s just a maid. I let her sign a contract with me. If she doesn’t behave, I’ll just sell her off. Besides, she insists on following us. Well... I can’t refuse her..”"]},{"number":3671,"title":"Chapter 3671: New Maid (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3671: New Maid (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu gave Feng Xun a strange look. “Are you serious?”","Feng Xun nodded.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t you think there’s something wrong with Tuberose?”","Feng Xun was confused. “What’s wrong with her?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Was it because men and women saw things differently? Why did Miss Lotus see through Tuberose’s plan right away? Why couldn’t Feng Xun see it?","“She’s quite pretty.” Feng Xun grinned. “She looks docile, has been trained, and knows how to serve people. If you ever need a maid, feel free to have her serve you.”","Feng Wu said, “Thank you, but that won’t be necessary.”","Only then did Feng Xun realize how serious the situation was.","“What’s wrong ?” He looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “Her life was so miserable. Her father died, and her mother remarried. Her stepfather then sold her to a brothel, and she had a hard time living there. She was getting beaten up every day...”","Feng Wu felt a headache coming on.","She gave Feng Xun a resigned look. “You can leave now.”","Feng Xun said, “What? Xiao Wu, why are you like this? We’re only taking in a maid who serves us tea. Why are you so mad? We have hundreds of maids like that in the family. One more won’t make much of a difference.”","Feng Wu said, “I’m not going to explain it to you. Just leave.”","After that, Feng Wu pushed Feng Xun out of the room and closed the door behind her.","Feng Xun scratched his head. What on earth was going on? One more maid like this wouldn’t make any difference. Xiao Wu wasn’t feeling well, and Boss Jun couldn’t help her when it came to washing her. What was wrong with having Tuberose help her?","Feng Xun scratched his head. Women were so unpredictable. He couldn’t understand it.","After Feng Wu pushed Feng Xun out, she sat down in a chair, crossed her legs, and lowered her head.","Jun Linyuan looked at her and saw that she was sulking. He smiled a little.","The crown prince was used to being aloof and arrogant, and he hardly ever smiled. That was why his smile was so bright.","Hearing the noise, Feng Wu couldn’t help but look up at Jun Linyuan.","“Why are you smiling?” Feng Wu didn’t like the sound of it.","With a flick of Jun Linyuan’s fingers, Feng Wu and her chair moved to within an inch of him.","“What are you angry about?” Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu snorted.","Jun Linyuan was confused. “Is that even worth getting angry over?”","Frustrated, Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan and was agitated. “That’s not worth getting angry over? That’s so frustrating! I can’t believe Feng Xun did such a thing! ”","Jun Linyuan looked at her in resignation. “What did Feng Xun do?”","Feng Wu said, “He took her in!”","Jun Linyuan rubbed his forehead. “She’s just a maid.”","Feng Wu flared up again. “What do you mean by that? The first step is to become a maid, but what about the second and third steps? Miss Lotus would seeing that Feng Wu sounded like Feng Xun’s mother, Jun Linyuan chuckled again. “So what if she has other ideas?”","Feng Wu glared at Jun Linyuan. “You men... You’re all the same!”","Holy crap! Jun Linyuan was thinking the same thing as Feng Xun, and they both thought that it wasn’t a big deal. Feng Wu was furious.."]},{"number":3672,"title":"Chapter 3672: New Maid (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3672: New Maid (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan was amused by the blushing girl. She was so serious.","Feng Wu puffed out her cheeks and glared at him. “Stop laughing!”","Finding the girl adorable, Jun Linyuan rubbed her head.","Frustrated, Feng Wu dodged.","Jun Linyuan sighed. “So what if she has further plans? Why are you so angry?”","Feng Wu stared at him. “So what?! Jun Linyuan, I didn’t know you were this kind of person!”","Feng Wu pushed Jun Linyuan away and wanted to rise to her feet. She had misjudged the teenager!","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu in resignation.","Feng Wu took a few steps away, then went back to Jun Linyuan and glared at him. “So, you’re going to the same thing, aren’t you?!”","Jun Linyuan said, “What?”","Feng Wu flared up and glared at him.","The smart crown prince finally came back to himself and shook his head with a smile. “Of course not.”","Only then did Feng Wu feel better, but she was still angry. “Why not?”","Seeing her like this, Jun Linyuan felt so sorry for her that he wanted to hold her in his arms and dote on her. Fighting back his impulse, Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu and said seriously, “The empress dowager has given me a lot of maids over the years. Have you seen one that has succeeded?”","On second thought, Feng Wu realized that he was right. Jun Linyuan was unapproachable, and anyone who dared to go near him would be turned to ash.","“Then why do you think Feng Xun is alright?” Feng Wu asked.","Jun Linyuan said, “That’s his business.”","Feng Wu didn’t agree with him.","Jun Linyuan looked at the girl affectionately and in resignation. “One will learn from their mistakes. It may not be a bad thing if he suffers a little this time.”","Seeing that Feng Wu still didn’t agree, Jun Linyuan patted her on the head. “Better late than never. Don’t you think so?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s true, but...","That was Feng Xun they were talking about here. Feng Wu wouldn’t like the idea of him falling head over heels for Tuberose.","“Have some confidence in him. He’s not stupid. It’s just that he’s a Spiritual Overlord now and thinks that he’s invincible.” Jun Linyuan didn’t feel guilty at all about talking about his childhood friend behind his back.","Feng Wu asked, “Really?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Just wait and see. With you around, he won’t suffer too much.”","Feng Wu nodded and clenched her fists. “I’ll make some medicine for Feng Xun later. ”","Jun Linyuan was perplexed.","Feng Wu said, “After he eats it, he can make a woman pregnant!”","Jun Linyuan rubbed his forehead. The girl was overthinking it.","Feng Wu said, “It’s not that I’m overthinking it, but someone like Tuberose, who grew up in a brothel, may never have such a great opportunity. I’m sure she’ll try her best. After all, Feng Xun is a naive and overconfident teenager. I’m worried that he won’t be able to handle her.","“What if Tuberose gets pregnant? We can’t sell her off, so we’ll have to prevent it beforehand.” Feng Wu started working on the medicine as she spoke.","Jun Linyuan was amazed.","However, he frowned when he saw the potion Feng Wu made. He stared at Feng Wu and asked, “You know a lot, don’t you?”","Compared to the girls Jun Linyuan had met before, Feng Wu was so different.","Not only did she like to watch strippers, but she also competed with that Zhao Yi for a dancer. Moreover, she was very good at making the medicine, which confused Jun Linyuan.."]},{"number":3673,"title":"Chapter 3673: The Crown Prince’s Confusion (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3673: The Crown Prince’s Confusion (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan was perplexed. Wasn’t the girl a little too knowledgeable?","Had it been any other woman, Jun Linyuan would have been displeased by such bold behavior.","However, he would only find his beloved girl adorable.","He let Feng Wu make the medicine as long as she had fun.","Feng Wu asked Jun Linyuan as she made the second tube, “Am I meddling too much?”","She mumbled, “You’re right. It’s Feng Xun’s own business. Don’t you think it’s inappropriate for me to get involved like this?”","That was an understatement. She was being very nosy.","The crown prince, who had always been sharp-tongued, only said, “Of course not. Isn’t he your brother? You have every right to look after him.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up, and she looked at Jun Linyuan in delight. “Really?”","Jun Linyuan said matter-of-factly, “Of course! You’re doing this for his own good!”","Feng Wu’s face lit up.","Jun Linyuan was satisfied when he saw the smile on the girl’s face.","Meanwhile, Feng Xun...","Inside his room.","“Young Lord Feng, you’ve been sitting here for too long, and your palms are sweaty, aren’t they? I’ve fetched some water. Would you like to wash your hands?","“Young Lord Feng, would you like to take a walk? I’ll keep you company.","“Young Lord...”","Tuberose couldn’t be more attentive.","Right now, she wore a dress that completely covered her body. The white outfit gave her a delicate and pitiful look.","Feng Xun wanted to say no, but he couldn’t bring himself to do it every time he saw her pitiful face.","He was a kind teenager after all.","But he was also a little fidgety, for somehow, he felt conflicted when he saw","her running around so eagerly.","He rose to his feet and headed for the door.","“Young Lord Feng...” Tuberose immediately followed him.","Feng Xun walked into Qin Qi’s room and frowned at her. “I’m talking to Qin Qi.","Don’t come in.”","Tuberose nodded obediently and stood timidly by the door.","Raising her head, she gave Feng Xun a pleading look. “Young Lord Feng, please go in. I’ll stay here by the door.”","It was windy outside, and her clothes were thin, which looked quite chilly.","She forced a pitiful smile. “Young Lord Feng, please go inside... I’ll wait here.”","As the saying went, one shouldn’t slap a smiling face. Not only was Tuberose smiling, but she was also acting so pitiful... Feng Xun had always been a soft-hearted person. Seeing this, he didn’t know what to say. He walked in in frustration and frowned when he saw Qin Qi.","Qin Qi winked at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun smacked him on the head. “Stop laughing!”","Qin Qi glanced at the door and beamed at him. “That was wonderful, wasn’t it?”","Feng Xun was even angrier and kicked him. “Nonsense! I don’t know what happened, but she followed me everywhere. She won’t leave my sight. Before I can scold her, she’s already crying. Damn it...’","Feng Xun rubbed his head in frustration. “I’m done talking! Take her away now! ”","Take her away? Qin Qi chuckled. “Are you really going to give her to me?”","Feng Xun said impatiently, “Yes, now.”","Before Qin Qi could say anything, someone rushed in.","“Young Lord Feng, please don’t chase me away! Please!","“I’ll do anything for you. Please don’t chase me away..”"]},{"number":3674,"title":"Chapter 3674: The Crown Prince’s Confusion (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3674: The Crown Prince’s Confusion (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Please, Young Lord Feng, please don’t chase me away...”","Tuberose cried her eyes out. She then told Feng Wu about her past one more time and said in a teary voice, “Young Lord Feng... Young Lord Feng...” She cried so hard that Feng Xun thought she was going to pass out.","Feng Xun was amazed.","He used to like soft gentle girls like the way Xiao Wu was in front of Boss Jun, but this one was so...","Feng Xun threw a dirty look at her.","Tuberose immediately stopped talking, but she couldn’t stop weeping, which only made her look more pitiful.","Feng Xun scratched his head.","“If Young Lord Feng doesn’t want me... I’d rather die...”","Tuberose quickly walked to the window, through which she could see the surging river.","By then, she was halfway up the window.","Not again...","Why did Feng Xun agree to let her be his maid? She had threatened him with her own life and forced him to do it. She just wouldn’t let him go.","Since when was Feng Xun short of maids? He thought Feng Wu might need","one, so he reluctantly agreed.","“Fine, fine.” Feng Xun was frustrated. “Whatever!”","He went back to his room after that.","Seeing that Feng Xun was leaving, Tuberose wanted to follow him. However, Qin Qi stopped her before she could take another step.","“Tsk, tsk—”","Crossing his arms, Young Master Qin smiled at the girl. “You’ve cornered Young","Lord Feng. That’s very impressive.”","Tuberose knew that Qin Qi wasn’t gentle, so she tried to leave without looking at him.","“Hey.”","Qin Qi stopped her. “Shall we talk?”","Tuberose glanced at Qin Qi and didn’t want to talk to him.","However, Qin Qi wouldn’t let her go, so she asked coldly, “What on earth do you want?!”","Qin Qi grinned. “Why, didn’t you cry your eyes out in front of Young Lord Feng just then? Why are you yelling at me now?”","“Qin Qi!” Tuberose gave him a warning look.","Qin Qi said, “Fine, fine. I’m not joking. You want to hook up with Young Lord Feng, don’t you? I can help you.” Tuberose smiled a little.","Was she smirking at him?","Qin Qi’s eyes widened. “What? Young Lord Feng isn’t good enough? Do you have a higher goal?”","Tuberose didn’t deny it.","Qin Qi teased her, “Your target isn’t His Royal Highness, is it? Hahaha!”","However, he was still laughing when Tuberose asked calmly, “Why can’t it be him?”","Why not?!","Qin Qi stopped laughing abruptly because he was frightened.","He stared at her. “What did you just say?","Tuberose wasn’t intimidated at all. “Why can’t it be His Royal Highness?”","‘You...”","Qin Qi was frightened.","Qin Qi was amazed when he thought Feng Xun was her target, but as it turned out, it was His Royal Highness... Damn it!","“With my background, I know I can only be a concubine. If that’s the case, why can’t I be the most prestigious concubine in the world?” Tuberose’s eyes lit up. “Young Lord Feng is indeed an outstanding man. Without His Royal Highness, he’s indeed my top priority.","“But why does His Royal Highness have to be in this world?” Tuberose’s eyes were glassy, and she was infatuated. ‘With him in this world, why do we need other men?”","Qin Qi couldn’t believe his ears.."]},{"number":3675,"title":"Chapter 3675: Compliment (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3675: Compliment (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Qi couldn’t believe his ears.","“You can praise the crown prince all you want, but you can’t defame us.","“So what if you’re only descendants of influential families? It’s not like a brothel girl like you can be a concubine just because you want to, okay?”","Crossing his arms, Qin Qi stared at Tuberose and smiled coldly. “Then I’ll see how you’re going to impress the crown prince.”","Tuberose glanced at Qin Qi and sneered. “You’ll beg for my help one day. Mind your attitude, Young Master Qin.”","Qin Qizhen was so angry that he laughed. “I really don’t understand. Are you blind? Can’t you see Miss Feng Wu Are you really confident that you can seduce her fiancé right under her nose?”","Tuberose smiled charmingly, and her voice was as mellow as an oriole. “Young Master Qin, as a man, don’t you know that sometimes, looks aren’t the only thing that matters?”","With that, Tuberose swayed her slender waist and walked past Qin Qi confidently.","Excuse me?!","Qin Qi looked at Tuberose and rubbed his chin with one hand. Could she really have a chance?","Tuberose was only behaving that way in front of Qin Qi. Around Feng Xun, she was still the obedient, gentle, and pitiful girl who had been rescued after being sold to a brothel.","She followed Feng Xun wherever he went.","Feng Xun loved to be around Feng Wu, so Feng Wu ended up seeing Tuberose hiding behind him every time.","Feng Wu gave Feng Xun a brooding look.","Feng Xun gave Tuberose a dirty look, and she took a few steps back obediently.","She couldn’t take any more than that because she was about to cry.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Rubbing her forehead, she looked at Feng Xun in resignation. “Are you really going to take her in as a concubine?”","Feng Xun was frustrated as well. “She tried to kill herself the moment I said I didn’t want her around. I said that seriously one time, but she really jumped into the water and didn’t get up for a long time. In the end, I had to jump in to save her.”","Feng Xun frowned. “Without me, she’ll die.”","Feng Wu was astonished.","No matter how many reasons she had, she couldn’t say a word now.","She could see that Feng Xun looked a little smug.","Feng Wu rested her head on her hands in frustration. Did all teenagers like to be needed and pestered? Was that how young men proved their charm?","Feng Wu waved him off. “Forget it. I’m done with you.”","Feng Xun wanted to say something else, but Feng Wu pulled a long face. “I don’t want to see her.”","Feng Xun said, “But she’ll cry...”","Feng Wu stared at Feng Xun with unprecedented seriousness in her eyes. “So, don’t ever show up in front of me again.”","Feng Xun was flustered.","He realized that Xiao Wu was serious this time.","She had always been a nice person, and she had never been so serious. Feng Xun turned to Jun Linyuan for help.","However, Boss Jun shook his head at him, indicating that he couldn’t do anything.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu again. “Xiao Wu...”","Feng Wu stared at him and said slowly, “You’ve reached the Spiritual Overlord Stage at such a young age, so it’s inevitable that you’re a little smug. This is a process that all young people go through, so I won’t blame you.","“There are some lessons you have to learn because no matter how much I reason with you, it’s useless. If you can’t understand it, you just can’t.","“There are some women that you’re meant to meet. If you don’t suffer a few times, you won’t learn your lesson.","“Your father is loyal to your mother. She’s the only woman in his life, so you never know what it’s like to have many women competing for a man’s love..”"]},{"number":3676,"title":"Chapter 3676: Compliment (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3676: Compliment (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun didn’t think much of Feng Wu’s words.","He retorted, “Of course, I know that many women in the world are pretentious. I also know that they act one way in front of others and another behind their backs. But Xiao Wu, you have to trust my judgment. Tuberose is really a very good girl. She...”","Feng Wu didn’t want to hear this anymore. She waved her hand. “Get out.”","Feng Xun was angry too. “Xiao Wu!”","Feng Wu couldn’t get through to Feng Xun. She lost her temper and said angrily, “I don’t want to talk to you right now. Get out!”","Feng Xun was genuinely angry as well and stood his ground. “You keep telling me not to take her in, and because of that, she’s going to stay!”","After that, Feng Xun slammed the door and left.","That pissed Feng Wu off...","Seeing Feng Wu’s flushed face, Jun Linyuan rolled his eyes at her. “Is that necessary?”","Feng Wu’s eyes reddened. “Of course, it is! He’s obsessed now! He can’t see what kind of a person Tuberose is! You men are the same, no matter what your ages are!”","The implicated crown prince rubbed his nose. He wasn’t like that anyway.","“Feng Xun won’t fall for her, but you’re forcing him, so he’s doing this out of defiance.” Sitting next to Feng Wu, Jun Linyuan told her patiently.","The crown prince had always been a tough guy, and he had never been patient with anyone else.","Jun Linyuan said, “He’s just angry because as a young lord, he feels he’s entitled to. After all, he’s one of the most respected people in the empire. If anyone else other than you and me spoke to him that way, he would have lost his temper already.”","Feng Wu said, “He said that he was going to keep Tuberose. How bad would it be if someone like that joined Northern Feng Mansion?”","Jun Linyuan smiled. “Even if he does, Lady Northern Feng can handle her without breaking a sweat. Why are you so angry?”","Feng Wu glared at him. “Don’t you know that woman has a trick up her sleeve? She’s going to get pregnant and join the family! What will Lady Northern Feng do to her when there’s a baby in her belly?","“I can’t let that happen!” Feng Wu shook her head. “It’s fine if Feng Xun really likes her, but he doesn’t. I can’t stand being manipulated by her!”","Jun Linyuan nodded and smiled at Feng Wu. “Have you calmed down?”","Feng Wu nodded. “I was so mad at Feng Xun that I fought him head-on.”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly at Jun Linyuan. “It’s just that I’ve overlooked something. You men don’t dislike women from brothels, especially at Feng Xun’s age. He’s a hero, and he’s proud to save weak women.”","The crown prince reacted immediately and mumbled, “Just talk to him. Don’t bring me into this.”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Are you not like that?”","The crown prince looked serious. “Do you think I’m into those women?”","Feng Wu thought about it and agreed. Jun Linyuan had high standards, and he was cold and heartless. He didn’t take it upon himself to save weak women, and he wouldn’t even spare a glance at the women that the empress dowager chose for him, let alone...","Feng Wu was in a better mood, so she began to speak up for Feng Xun. “Actually, Feng Xun doesn’t like her. He disagreed with me just to win the argument. He’s probably regretting it now.”","Feng Wu was right. Feng Xun regretted it as soon as he slammed the door.","However, he couldn’t bring himself to apologize to Feng Wu, so he paced around the deck in frustration.."]},{"number":3677,"title":"Chapter 3677: Compliment (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3677: Compliment (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Tuberose wanted to comfort him, but Feng Xun glared at her, and she took a few steps back in fear, not daring to go any closer.","Sitting cross-legged on the round chair, Feng Wu’s mind raced. She had to get rid of Tuberose as soon as possible, and she had to make Feng Xun feel defeated. Otherwise, he would never see how good a pretty girl was at deceiving people.","He would suffer greatly in the future if he didn’t learn.","Seeing Feng Wu rub her chin and ponder, Jun Linyuan knew that his smart little girl was going to make her move.","He stared straight at the girl in red in front of him. The hazy lights gave her a","different kind of beauty, making her even more attractive.","Why was his girl so irresistible?","“Found it!”","Feng Wu snapped her fingers and looked excited. She was about to share her beautiful plan with Jun Linyuan when she met Jun Linyuan’s dark eyes. For a moment, she was intoxicated.","What kind of gaze was that?","His doting and misty gaze was fixed on her...","“Ahem, Jun... Jun Linyuan, what are you looking at?”","Jun Linyuan was so close to her that Feng Wu tried to push him away.","This time, Jun Linyuan came back to his senses and pulled the girl’s chair closer to him. After sitting down calmly, he had regained the gracefulness and nobility of a crown prince, looking extremely dignified.","“Ahem, have you thought of a solution?” he asked casually.","As a matter of fact, he wasn’t interested in Feng Wu’s plan.","He only liked to see her sparkling eyes and the confident smile on her face.","She was the only one he could see.","Feng Wu, on the other hand, said excitedly, “I know how to make Tuberose reveal her true colors. Feng Xun will be mortified this time!” Jun Linyuan, who never liked to smile, was finally amused by her.","“Mortified?”","Feng Wu gritted her teeth. “Once this is over, I’m going to make him call me his big sister. He’s just an inexperienced kid who’s tricked by a prostitute. Let’s see if he’ll ever disobey me again!”","Seeing the smug look on the girl’s face, the crown prince chuckled and rubbed her head. “Look at you.”","She was just like a kid.","“I can’t move around freely at the moment, and I have to keep it a secret from Feng Xun, so could you fetch Qin Qi for me?” Feng Wu asked the crown prince for help.","Jun Linyuan didn’t want to be ordered around like that.","Other people couldn’t do anything about Jun Linyuan, but Feng Wu could.","“Brother Jun...”","The crown prince sighed and said dotingly, “... Just this once.”","Feng Wu nodded and raised her hands. “Just this once, I promise!”","Crossing his arms, the crown prince leaned against the door to Qin Qi’s room.","Qin Qi frowned. Who would disturb him at this hour? How annoying!","Hence, he asked impatiently, “Who is it?”","No one answered.","Qin Qi became more and more impatient.","However, he was worried that it would be Feng Xun, so he put on his clothes, unbolted the door, and opened it in a huff. Then, he saw...","The crown prince leaned against the pillar and glanced at him casually...","“Jun...’","Qin Qi, who had always had a glib tongue, stuttered!","His legs gave in, and he dropped to his knees.","He was so doomed...","Gosh, how could he talk to the crown prince so impatiently just now..."]},{"number":3678,"title":"Chapter 3678: Compliment (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3678: Compliment (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Even his father wouldn’t dare to do this. No, no one in his family would dare...","Qin Qi wondered if he would die here.","While Qin Qi was fantasizing about all kinds of horrors, Jun Linyuan tilted his head and said, “Follow me.”","After that, the crown prince walked away.","Qin Qi was scared to death!","Follow him?","Was the crown prince going to lead him to a deserted place, kill him, and throw his dead body in the river?","When Qin Qi entered the room, he saw Feng Wu sitting cross-legged on a chair.","He turned around and saw that the crown prince had already walked up to the desk under the window. He was reading a book leisurely.","Qin Qi’s eyes widened. So... so he didn’t have to die?","Feng Wu waved at him. “Come here.”","Feng Wu was scary, too...","Compared to Jun Linyuan, however, Feng Wu was... adorable.","Qin Qi ran up to Feng Wu.","Before he could say anything, Feng Wu told him to sit down.","Qin Qi didn’t dare sit down right now. He thanked her and sat at the edge of the chair. He then asked Feng Wu sincerely why she had summoned him so late at night.","Qin Qi was a little flustered...","Feng Wu didn’t beat around the bush. She went straight to the point and asked him what he thought of Tuberose.","Qin Qi’s heart skipped a beat!","Had Miss Feng Wu found out about his interaction with Tuberose?","Did that mean that Miss Feng Wu also knew that Tuberose was after the crown prince? Was she here to test him?","Qin Qi didn’t dare to hide anything from her.","He repeated what Tuberose had told him to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was surprised.","“Are you saying that she’s after...”","Feng Wu pointed at the crown prince, who was reading under the light.","Qin Qi raised his hands and swore. “Those were her own words. I didn’t do anything! I swear!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","“What a surprise...” Feng Wu smiled bitterly.","She had underestimated Tuberose. To her surprise, that woman’s target wasn’t Feng Xun, but Jun Linyuan.","“If Feng Xun finds out about this...” Feng Wu rubbed her forehead. “He’ll be furious, won’t he?”","Qin Qi said, “Shouldn’t you be worried about...”","Feng Wu thought that this would be an unprecedented blow to Feng Xun... She almost couldn’t bear to do it anymore.","Feng Wu changed her plan and said something to Qin Qi.","“Are you willing to cooperate?” Feng Wu asked seriously. “I owe you one.” How could Qin Qi dare to refuse? This was the future crown princess’s future wife!","“Of course!”","Among everything else, Feng Wu was a Supreme Level medicine refiner, and Qin Qi was so excited that she would owe him a favor.","In the end, Feng Wu had to tell Jun Linyuan. Hence, she went up to Jun Linyuan and told him about her plan.","Jun Linyuan looked at her in resignation.","He didn’t say anything and just waved his hand.","Feng Wu knew that he had agreed.","Feng Wu took out a robe that Jun Linyuan had never worn before and handed it to Qin Qi to put on. At the same time, she fiddled with his face for a while. Soon, a person who looked a lot like Jun Linyuan appeared. Under the dim candlelight, one almost couldn’t tell the difference.","Qin Qi was very excited. “I’m on it!”","Feng Wu had told him everything, and it was time for him to make his move!"]},{"number":3679,"title":"Chapter 3679: He Shouted at Me (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3679: He Shouted at Me (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Qi walked out confidently.","How excited he was!","Feng Wu was giving him a very important task!","Qin Qi thought of his own home.","Earl Nanfeng was a low-ranking lord among the many nobles in the imperial capital. He was also the second son of the family and wasn’t born to be the successor to the title. His father actually gave the honorary spot to his third brother...","Qin Qi was a civilian with no title and might have to continue living like that.","But now, he was given such a generous offer.","He was going to work for the crown prince. If he missed this opportunity, Qin Qi knew that he would never have such a chance in his life.","Therefore, he took a deep breath and warned himself that he had to do this well.","Qin Qi liked famous actors, so he played a lot of roles. Recalling Jun Linyuan’s gaits, he soon managed to mimic the way the crown prince walked.","Feng Wu played her role well. When Qin Qi got up and was about to leave, she deliberately shouted angrily, “Get out! Don’t come back!”","Then, there was the sound of the door slamming shut.","Jun Linyuan watched Feng Wu and Qin Qi’s little show. He then rubbed his forehead and went back to his book.","Qin Qi leaned against the railing and pretended to be angry!","The river breeze blew his hair.","Feng Wu gave him some extra chin and nose bridge while putting makeup on Qin Qi, so he looked very much like Jun Linyuan from the side. Coupled with the fact that he was wearing a robe the same color as Jun Linyuan’s, he looked 70% to 80% like the crown prince under the moonlight.","As a matter of fact, Tuberose had been listening to what was going on in Feng Wu’s room.","That was because her target was Jun Linyuan, not Feng Xun.","Feng Xun sat there in a huff, resting his chin on his hands. All he could think about was the fight with Feng Wu.","As a matter of fact, he regretted saying those things as soon as he came out of Feng Wu’s room. The wind calmed him down, but the pride of a young man was really unreasonable.","Although he usually joked around, this time, because the argument was genuine, he couldn’t bring himself to apologize.","Feng Xun held his cheek with one hand, feeling depressed and vexed. Why did he have to argue with that girl? He believed girls were petty and couldn’t tolerate other women. “Feng Wu must have felt that I’ve been seduced by another woman and don’t care about her anymore.”","How could that be?","Tuberose meant nothing to him. She was just another servant and was no different from any Tom, Dick, or Harry. When Feng Xun saw an abandoned puppy, he would reach out to save it. It was the same for Tuberose.","He really felt that it was his responsibility to take Tuberose with him now that she was so dependent on him. He would find her a good family when they got ashore.","She was really different from the other flirtatious women in the brothels.","While he was lost in his thoughts, he heard a noise from next door.","He heard Feng Wu’s voice.","“Go out! Don’t come back!”","Feng Xun almost jumped to his feet. Xiao Wu and Boss Jun had a fight?!","Then he heard the door slam shut.","That strength was enough to reflect the emotions of the person who closed the door.","The look on Feng Xun’s face changed.","What was going on?","He could no longer sit still and immediately opened the door.","Then, he saw a familiar figure walking down the stairs.","He called out to Boss Jun a few times, but the person ignored him.","He was about to chase after that person when Feng Wu stuck her head out of the window and shouted, “How dare you leave? Don’t ever come back!”"]},{"number":3680,"title":"Chapter 3680: He Shouted at Me (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3680: He Shouted at Me (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She swayed and looked very weak.","Feng Wu was so angry that she almost fell into the river. Seeing this, Feng Xun didn’t have time to think about anything else. He went in through the door and jumped into the window.","“Xiao Wu, what’s wrong? Did Boss Jun upset you? He...”","Before Feng Xun could finish, he saw a man sitting leisurely by the window with a book in his hand. The man was looking up at him with brooding eyes.","Feng Xun was shocked.","“B- Boss Jun?”","The young man sitting by the window was none other than Boss Jun.","He was dumbfounded.","What the hell?","“Boss Jun, didn’t you leave just now?”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Xun as if the latter was retarded. He shook his head and ignored Feng Xun.","Feng Xun also felt stupid. He turned around and looked at Feng Wu inquiringly.","He was about to say something when Feng Wu gestured for him to keep quiet.","Feng Xun stopped talking.","However, after waiting for a long time, he couldn’t help but ask, “Xiaowu, what are you doing?","She glanced at him before looking away.","There was a person standing in a shadovvy corner downstairs.","Seeing that Feng Wu was ignoring him, he had no choice but to follow her gaze. What he saw shocked him again.","Because there was a person standing there.","Under the hazy moonlight, his black robe fluttered in the wind...","He looked very much like Jun Linyuan from the side.","“Isn’t... isn’t that...” Feng Xun tried to poke his head out to take a closer look, but Feng Wu immediately stopped him.","He looked at the man, then back at Jun Linyuan...","“Xiao Wu, what are you up to?” Feng Xun was baffled.","Feng Wu gave him a cold look. “I’m just waiting for someone to take the bait.”","“Huh?” Feng Xun looked at her in confusion.","Feng Wu didn’t say anything else.","Feng Xun rubbed his nose and thought about it for a while, but he still couldn’t figure it out.","“If that’s all, I’ll go down now...” Feng Xun was ready to leave.","Feng Wu said coldly, “Are you going back to your Tuberose? Are you worried that she’ll jump into the river if she can’t find her?”","Feng Xun blushed, for Feng Wu had hit the nail on the head.","He was indeed worried that Tuberose would jump into the river because she was like that last time.","He decided to have a serious talk with Feng Wu, hoping that she would understand him.","“Xiao Wu, I know she came from a brothel, but she was sold into it when she was young... She didn’t want that life.”","Feng Wu looked at him as if he were a retard.","Feng Xun didn’t notice the look of resignation in Feng Wu’s eyes. He was too immersed in his dream of being a hero.","“She’s a kind and timid girl. If she can’t find me, she’ll really jump into the river...","“If you can’t like her, can you just treat her as an abandoned cat or dog and give her a place to stay?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Xun tried to convince Feng Wu. “She really isn’t a threat to you, and she won’t hurt you.","“I know you’re worried. Even if she’s a bad woman, she’ll seduce me, not Boss Jun. You don’t have to worry.”","Jun Linyuan, who had been sitting there pretending to be reading, glanced up at Feng Wu at the right time.."]},{"number":3681,"title":"Chapter 3681: He Shouted at Me (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3681: He Shouted at Me (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She blushed when she saw the look in Jun Linyuan’s eyes, and she glared at Feng Xun. “What are you talking about?!”","“Ahem... I mean, even if she wanted to hit on someone, she wouldn’t...","Feng Wu smirked. “Are you sure you’re her target?”","Feng Xun looked at her in resignation. “I’m the one she’s been clinging to...”","Just then, Feng Wu saw a figure slowly walking toward Qin Qi.","She asked Feng Xun, “Are you sure?”","He said smugly, “Of course. I’m sure of that. I still want to believe that she’s just a poor, helpless girl. She told me that she didn’t like those easy women who would sleep with men to get what they wanted. Xiao Wu, don’t think too badly of other girls. There are still many good girls in this world.”","Before he could finish, Feng Wu pointed at someone outside. “Do you know that girl?”","He followed her finger, and his eyes widened.","He had good eyesight, so even though the moonlight was dim, he could still tell at a glance that the person in the white dress was Tuberose, who was always sticking to him!","Meanwhile, Tuberose was approaching the man who looked very much like Jun","Linyuan.","Feng Xun’s stomach lurched!","He suddenly remembered that Xiao Wu was good at using disguise, so the man who looked so much like Jun Linyuan was...","“So that’s your bait?","Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu. “You’re testing her!”","Feng Wu said matter-of-factly, “Yes, I am.”","Feng Xun had a feeling that he was not trusted!","“You don’t trust my judgment?!” He stared at Feng Xu. “Don’t you trust me at all? I’m good at reading people!”","Feng Wu said seriously, “Keep watching, then.”","Feng Xun was so angry that he wanted to turn around and leave but in the end...","He fixed his gaze on Tuberose.","He wanted to prove to Feng Wu that Tuberose was a kind and timid girl. She would only stick to him and wouldn’t have any improper thoughts about Jun","Linyuan.","But what did he see?","Tuberose slowly moved closer to “Boss Jun”.","She was getting closer and closer.","She kept talking.","Others might not be able to hear him, but Feng Xun was a Spiritual Overlord, so he could hear everything.","The first thing she said was, “Your Royal Highness, why are you here alone? It’s windy and cold.”","The next sentence was, “Did you quarrel with Miss Feng WII?”","Then she said, “Your Royal Highness, that’s what Miss Feng Wu is like. Please forgive her...”","As she spoke, she reached out and rubbed her hand against his.","Feng Xun’s face turned livid!","Even if he told himself a thousand times that these words and actions weren’t too out of line, he knew he was lying to himself.","Feng Wu glanced at Feng Xun and saw that his face was dark as if he wanted to rush out right away. She stopped him. “This is nothing. Keep watching.”","Feng Xun gritted his teeth!","But she was right. He continued to watch and wanted to see how kind and pure Tuberose really was.","At that moment, Tuberose had reached out and was touching Jun Linyuan.."]},{"number":3682,"title":"Chapter 3682: He Shouted at Me (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3682: He Shouted at Me (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Qi thought of his mission, so he still pretended to be indifferent. He didn’t wave her away, nor did he take the initiative.","Seeing that the “crown prince” didn’t wave her away, Tuberose went on. “It’s all Miss Feng Wu’s fault. How could she make Your Royal Highness angry..","She leaned into the “crown prince’s” arms as she spoke.","The veins on Feng Xun’s forehead bulged!","“I’ll kill her!”","Holding his sword, Feng Xun was about to rush out.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “What’s the rush?”","Feng Xun couldn’t breathe. He couldn’t even look Feng Wu in the eye...","As expected, the good show was still to come.","Seeing that the “crown prince” didn’t push her away, Tuberose took the initiative. She took his hand and placed it on her slender waist while putting the “crown prince’s” palm on her chest with her other hand.","“Your Royal Highness, she doesn’t like you, but I’ve admired you for a long time... ”","As she spoke, she fixed her gaze on “Jun Linyuan”.","Feng Xun flushed in anger.","Everything he had said to Feng Wu just now felt like a slap in the face!","He didn’t have any feelings for Tuberose, but the way she had been clinging to him made him feel like a hero...","But now...","Feng Xun watched as Tuberose led the “crown prince” into an empty room.","The door was opened and closed. In the candlelight, two figures intertwined...","Feng Wu turned around and looked at Feng Xun.","In the dark, Feng Xun’s face was livid.","Feng Wu sighed inwardly.","In fact, she really didn’t want to expose the truth to Feng Xun. That would be too deliberate, but he should see the truth instead of being blindly confident in himself.","It was fine now. What if he did this at the critical moment of the battle?","Feng Xun gritted his teeth. “So, that’s Qin Qi?!”","Feng Wu said, “It’s Qin Qi.”","Feng Xun looked back at Feng Wu. “Did you do that on purpose?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, I planned it.”","Feng Xun said, “So, this is how you humiliate me?!”","Feng Wu said, “It’s not a humiliation.”","Feng Xun said, ‘You’ve proved how smart you are and how stupid I am. Does that make you happy?!","After that, Feng Xun pushed open the door and left.","He didn’t disturb those two people. Instead, he jumped out of the ship and soon disappeared.","Feng Wu watched him leave in a daze, her face grim.","Putting down the book, Jun Linyuan walked up to Feng Wu and put a robe over her shoulder. “It’s late. You’ll get a cold.” He reached out to close the window.","Tears welled up in Feng Wu’s eyes, but she raised her chin stubbornly, or tears would fall.","Her nose was red as she bit her lower lip hard. “Was I wrong?”","Jun Linyuan reached out and pulled Feng Wu into his arms.","He let out a long sigh. “Are you upset?”","Feng Wu had been stubborn, but when Jun Linyuan said those words, she couldn’t help but burst into tears.","She asked aggrievedly, “Am I wrong? Did I really do something wrong? I’m doing this for his own good.”","Jun Linyuan rubbed her head. “Don’t cry.”","Feng Wu said in an aggrieved voice, “I’m doing this for his own good... I’m not doing this for myself. He yelled at me and ran away...”","Jun Linyuan didn’t know whether to laugh or cry at that. Sometimes, the girl seemed like a tough nut to crack, but right now, she looked like an aggrieved little girl.."]},{"number":3683,"title":"Chapter 3683: Fright (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3683: Fright (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun left.","But that wasn’t the end.","When Feng Wu went to knock on the door, Tuberose answered it, only semi-dressed. For a brief moment, she looked pleased to see Feng Wu, but she soon lowered her eyes and dropped to her knees.","When she looked up again, her eyes were filled with tears, making her look exceptionally pitiful.","“Miss Feng Wu... I... I didn’t mean to...","“I said no, but His Royal..","“You can kill me or chop me up. I have no complaints. Please... don’t hate the crown prince...”","Feng Wu looked at her in bewilderment. “What are you talking about?”","Tuberose cried even harder. ‘Miss Feng Wu, please don’t blame His Royal","Highness. He, he couldn’t help it...”","Feng Wu looked at Tuberose in confusion. “What are you talking about? I don’t get it.”","Tuberose sneered inwardly.","“You don’t understand?’","“You’re not supposed to understand.","“You argued with the crown prince. You’re so arrogant and willful? Blame yourself.”","Tuberose was feeling extremely smug when she saw a pair of black combat boots. A shadow fell and enveloped her.","Tuberose looked up and saw a face that made her tremble!","His Royal Highness?!","How was that even possible?!","That was impossible!","Wasn’t the crown prince in the room with her...","Tuberose subconsciously turned around and saw a person walking out.","The young man was quite good-looking, but he was nothing compared to the crown prince!","Qin Qi glanced sideways at Tuberose, who was kneeling on the ground and","frowned slightly. “Why are you crying at the door in the middle of the night? Those who don’t know better might think that something has happened.”","Qin Qi!","The second son of the Earl of Nanfeng.","Tuberose was trembling. Her heart was beating violently, but her mind was","blank..","How did this happen?","How could this be?","It was the crown prince who had sex with her... Why did it suddenly become Qin Qi?!","“You... you...” Tuberose’s face was pale.","Qin Qi, on the other hand, became very respectful when he saw Feng Wu. When he saw Jun Linyuan, he was in awe and fear.","He knelt before Jun Linyuan and addressed him as His Royal Highness.","Although Jun Linyuan never openly admitted it, everyone already knew.","Jun Linyuan didn’t look too pleased. He only glanced at Qin Qi and didn’t say anything else.","But to Qin Qi, this was already the highest honor!","The crown prince nodded at him. Even his father’s father didn’t deserve this honor! Qin Qi was so excited that he almost flew into the sky.","However, Feng Wu darted a look at Tuberose. “Aren’t you with Feng Xun all the time? You were going to jump into the river when Feng Xun got back late. Why are you here now?”","Tuberose realized what had happened.","The crown prince was out of her reach now, but Feng Xun was much better than Qin Qi. Hence, Tuberose tried to explain.","However, before she could say anything, Qin Qi had already wrapped his arms around her waist.","Qin Qi smiled at Feng Wu. “As the saying goes, you never know how many men a woman in a brothel has served. Miss Feng Wu, do you really think she’s faithful to Young Lord Feng?”","Tuberose said, “I...”","Qin Qi said, “If she was really loyal to Young Lord Feng, she wouldn’t have climbed into my bed.. Am I right, Tuberose?”"]},{"number":3684,"title":"Chapter 3684: Fright (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3684: Fright (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was very easy to settle the matter with Tuberose.","Once Feng Xun was gone, it would be easy to deal with her.","Since Qin Qi said that he would handle it, Feng Wu let him do the job. She really didn’t want to see Tuberose again.","“Where’s Feng Nun?”","Feng Wu stood on the deck, and her clothes fluttered in the wind.","She looked at Jun Linyuan in frustration and sighed.","Feng Xun hadn’t come back since he stormed off a few days ago.","Feng Wu waited and waited, but he never came back.","While waiting for him, Feng Wu reflected on herself.","“Was I wrong?” Feng Wu frowned and blamed herself. “Did I push him too hard? Did I disrespect him? Did I...”","Jun Linyuan patted her on the head.","Feng Wu dodged his hand and mumbled, “I won’t grow tall if you do that.”","The crown prince couldn’t help but chuckle.","If she could, it meant that her mood wasn’t too bad.","The crown prince sat down on the bench and patted the empty spot next to him.","Reluctantly, Feng Wu sat down and looked at him pitifully. “Do you think I did something wrong too?”","Jun Linyuan nodded, then shook his head.","Feng Wu said, “Why are you nodding and shaking your head at the same time?","Whose side are you on?”","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu. “Don’t you know which side I’m on?”","Feng Wu said, “Um...”","Jun Linyuan said, “Don’t worry about that. He’ll be back when he figures it out.”","Feng Wu asked, “Aren’t you worried about him?”","Jun Linyuan raised an eyebrow. “Worried about a Spiritual Overlord cultivator?","Why don’t you worry about the person he uses as a punching bag?”","Feng Wu asked, “A punching bag? Who?”","Why did she feel that Jun Linyuan knew something that she didn’t?","At this moment, there was a soft sound.","But soon, the voice disappeared.","Feng Wu’s attention was drawn to it.","“I think I heard something. Did you hear it?” Feng Wu got up from the bench and walked toward the source of the noise.","It was at the bottom of the river.","Hence, Feng Wu moved closer to the edge of the deck and looked down.","The river below the ship was extremely calm. Nothing seemed out of place.","But right at that moment...","Whoosh!","There was a loud noise.","Before Feng Wu could react, a bloody mouth opened and almost covered her!","Feng Wu didn’t have any cultivation ability at this moment.","Just as Feng Wu was about to be taken away, Jun Linyuan made his move.","One move!","With a bang, a huge ball of light landed on the black monster.","Poof!","The black monster was sent flying with a loud bang.","Ignoring the black monster, Jun Linyuan put an arm around Feng Wu and asked anxiously, “How are you? Are you hurt?”","He checked Feng Wu up and down and only let out a sigh of relief when he saw that she was fine.","Seeing Jun Linyuan’s pale face, Feng Wu was touched.","In fact, he had reacted so fast that he must have known that she wasn’t injured, but he was still so anxious.","“I’m... I’m fine.”","To be honest, Feng Wu was a little frightened.","That black monster was invincible to her, who had no cultivation ability right now.","Her reaction was so slow that she was almost swallowed. Only then did Feng Wu have the time to look at the river.","Ssss —","Feng Wu gasped when she saw what was happening.."]},{"number":3685,"title":"Chapter 3685: Fright (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3685: Fright (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was gigantic!","Its entire body was as black as ink, and its skin was as smooth as a mirror. It was soft and emitted a cold light.","At this moment, everyone in the cabin was alarmed and ran out.","They saw the enormous creature.","It was...","When they saw the monster, their eyes almost popped out!","“What is this?”","“It’s huge! It’s several times bigger than our ship!”","“Is it going to swallow our ship?”","Everyone started to talk about it.","Qin Qi, the first mate, and Captain Wu all rushed forward.","When the first mate saw the black monster, he was so frightened that his legs trembled. “Isn’t this the inky flood dragon beast?! Heavens, it really is!”","As the first mate spoke, he turned to look at Captain Wu.","Captain Wu nodded solemnly.","Qin Qi frowned. “What’s that? Is it very powerful?”","The first mate’s voice trembled. “What kind of bad luck is this? We actually encountered an inky flood dragon beast... Someone can die!”","Qin Qi asked, “I’m asking you. What’s an inky flood dragon beast? Is it really that powerful?”","The first mate nodded. ‘Yes, it’s very powerful!”","He paused for a moment and explained, “In the Nanyang River, the most terrifying monster is this beast. From time to time, it’ll stir up trouble.","“It’s a terrifying creature. Do you know how powerful is it?","“For the safety of the merchant ships along the way, the Imperial Court once sent several cultivators down to capture it, but it was too difficult...","“Even the Spiritual Overlords couldn’t capture it because it’s as fast as the wind. The entire Nanyang River is its territory. When it’s in danger, it’ll hide in the mud. No one can find it after that.","“Therefore, all these years, the beast has come out to cause trouble from time to time, but no one can do anything to it.","“In the past two years, it gradually stopped coming out. Everyone thought that it had settled down, but here it is again.","“Our ship won’t be able to handle its power.”","The first mate’s voice trembled as he looked into the distance.","Although the Nanyang River was hundreds of kilometers wide. At this moment, they were at the center of the river and were very far from the shore... It was impossible for them to swim to the shore.","“Captain Wu, what should we do now?”","The first mate looked at Captain Wu for help.","At this moment, Captain Wu looked at the beast, and a hint of confusion appeared in his eyes.","“It’s not moving.” Captain Wu frowned.","The first mate looked like he was about to cry. “When it moves, the entire ship will be finished.”","The first mate was panicking, and so were the passengers on the ship.","They had also heard of the beast before.","“I’ve heard of it! It’s said that when it appeared two years ago, all the ships within a hundred kilometers were swallowed by it.’","“Will we die today?”","“What should we do? What should we do now?”","Everyone was in a mess. Some people were even about to jump into the river and quickly swim to the opposite shore.","Captain Wu’s gaze fell on Jun Linyuan.","If he really was the legendary crown prince, then there was nothing to be afraid of.","He didn’t dare talk to Jun Linyuan because the crown prince looked very unapproachable.","Hence, Captain Wu went up to Feng Wu and asked respectfully, “Miss Feng Wu, did His Royal Highness do anything just now?”"]},{"number":3686,"title":"Chapter 3686: Fright (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3686: Fright (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","After some thought, Feng Wu nodded.","That nod meant that she had admitted that he was Jun Linyuan.","Captain Wu let out a shaky breath. “Thank goodness.”","Fortunately, Jun Linyuan was here. Otherwise, everyone on the ship would be dead.","Captain Wu said to his first mate, “That beast is already dead. Don’t worry.”","Everyone turned to look in Feng Wu’s direction.","The inky flood dragon beast... was dead?","There were guards on the ship. At this moment, they had already dragged the beast back to the side of the ship.","As expected, the head of the terrifying beast had caved in. It had died a long time ago.","Everyone turned to look at Jun Linyuan again.","Their crown prince was indeed an invincible man!","But...","Everyone only dared to watch from afar. No one dared to take a step closer.","Their crown prince was intimidating and unapproachable.","At this moment, the first mate exclaimed, “Wait!”","“This inky flood dragon beast isn’t the same one from back then.” The first mate turned to look at Captain Wu, a grave expression appearing on his face. “That one we met back then had an obvious scar on its abdomen, but this one doesn’t.”","Captain Wu was also shocked. If that was the case, then something big had happened.","As expected, he carefully observed the abdomen of the beast, but he didn’t see anything!","“It’s not there, right?” The first mate’s expression was equally solemn. “This isn’t the one from back then. Such a terrifying scar won’t disappear.” Qin Qi listened to their conversation.","He couldn’t help but frown and ask, ‘Why don’t I understand what you’re saying? What previous one? Could there be a second inky flood dragon beast?” The first mate smiled bitterly and said nothing.","Captain Wu’s expression was extremely solemn. He took a deep breath and said, “As everyone knows, the strength of the beast is extremely terrifying. Some people say that it’s at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord Stage. All along, everyone has tried to avoid it, and no one dares to provoke it.","“We were lucky to have His Royal Highness on board, so the beast didn’t harm us, but...","“If this beast is dead, the other one will definitely not let it go. It might not dare to find trouble with our ship but along the way...”","Captain Wu exhaled. “But other merchant ships on the river will be in trouble.”","She frowned and grabbed Jun Linyuan. “Will Feng Xun run into the other beast?”","Jun Linyuan frowned a little.","Feng Wu said, “He’s just reached the Spiritual Overlord Stage. If he runs into the inky flood dragon beast, he’ll be doomed.”","The more she spoke, the more worried she became, and the more she blamed herself.","Jun Linyuan rubbed her head, telling her to calm down.","She bit her lower lip. “Of course, I’m worried. Feng Xun is so frustrated that he must be looking for a place to vent his pent-up anger. He might have been the one who alerted that dead beast in front of us.","All of a sudden!","A violent sound came from not far away!","Feng Wu turned around and saw a small boat less than ten meters long being smashed into pieces.","The children on the boat fell into the river one after another.","Something huge moved fast in the river.","It was probably the inky flood dragon beast.","“Those are children!”","Others might not be able to see it clearly from hundreds of meters away, but Feng Wu had excellent eyesight.. She saw at a glance that it was a group of very young children who had fallen in the surging river!"]},{"number":3687,"title":"Chapter 3687: Unexpected Event (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3687: Unexpected Event (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was a group of very young children.","They were hundreds of meters apart.","On the other side, the wind was high and the waves were fast. It was as if a thousand piles of snow had been swept up.","The beast’s furious roar made people tremble.","“Hurry up and help them!” Feng Wu shouted at Captain Wu.","Captain Wu nodded. However, before he could turn the ship around, a huge wave came. The Soaring Wing was swept up by the wave and fell heavily. The people on the ship couldn’t stand still, and a few of them almost flew out of the ship.","“Hold on!”","“No one can save you if you’re thrown overboard, so hold on tight!”","Everyone was shouting at the same time.","Of course, she would be fine with Jun Linyuan around, but she was frustrated.","Why didn’t she have any cultivation ability now?!","She needed other people’s protection, so forget about helping others.","At this time, she saw an incomparably huge inky flood dragon beast open its bloody mouth and swallow the waves in front of it!","There was...","“Those kids!”","“I saw it. There were boys and girls. There were at least ten of them!” “They were all swallowed by that beast!”","When everyone saw this scene with their own eyes, they were more shocked than when they heard the first mate’s description. They didn’t know how to describe their astonishment.","Their faces were pale, and their eyes were filled with fear. People kept shouting at Captain Wu, “Set sail!” “Do you want to die? Hurry up and leave!”","Captain Wu turned to look at Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu shook her head at Captain Wu. ‘We can’t leave. We have to save them.” Everyone glared at her.","Someone immediately said angrily, “Save my ass! Those children have already been eaten by the beast and are already dead. How can we save them?!”","“If we die, how can we help others?”","“Miss Feng Wu, we don’t want to die. Please let us live!”","When their lives were threatened, many people only cared about themselves. How could they care about saving others?","Feng Wu turned around and looked at Jun Linyuan pleadingly.","Jun Linyuan frowned a little.","Neither Feng nor Feng Xun was around, so she didn’t have anyone to protect her.","Feng Wu pointed at Qin Qi. “He can protect me for now.”","He thought for a moment, then nodded.","He gave Qin Qi a threatening look.","Qin Qi’s chest tightened.","He didn’t want to protect her at all... However, under Jun Linyuan’s terrifying gaze, Qin Qi had no choice but to say, “... Alright.”","Jun Linyuan made his move.","No one knew how Jun Linyuan did it, but the next moment, the inky flood dragon beast was punched in the stomach.","“Hm...”","The beast trembled violently and immediately spat out a mouthful of water like a rain of arrows.","It happened to hit the deck of the ship.","Thump, thump, thump!","Those children rolled out of the beast’s mouth and fell onto the deck.","Meanwhile, Jun Linyuan was already fighting the beast.","This beast was much more powerful than the previous one, so even Jun Linyuan couldn’t take it down with one move.","Moreover, they were on the river.","It was the beast’s territory.","Jun Linyuan and the beast fought in the distance, while Feng Wu was trying to save the children on the deck.","There were a total of twelve children, six boys and six girls.","They were all around five or six years old. All of them were beautiful, but at this moment, they had all fainted.","Although the ship had stabilized a little, many people were still holding onto what they could grab by their sides. They didn’t dare to take a step forward, fearing that the huge wave would rise again.."]},{"number":3688,"title":"Chapter 3688: Unexpected Event (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3688: Unexpected Event (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu didn’t have time to think about anything else. She rushed over to rescue the children.","After these children were swallowed by the beast, they all fainted because of a lack of oxygen.","If they weren’t rescued in time, they would die very quickly.","Feng Wu instructed Qin Qi, “Undress them. I’ll do the acupuncture.” Acupuncture?","Although Qin Qi was confused, he followed Feng Wu’s order and immediately began to make the preparations.","The others gathered around and shook their heads when they saw this scene.","“These kids are dead. They can’t be saved.”","“Poor children. They were swallowed by the beast. How can we expect them to survive?”","She ignored them and stuck the silver needle into the acupoint in their chest.","She did the same to all twelve children.","However, nothing happened.","Qin Qi tried to comfort her. “They’re probably gone. Don’t be too sad. After all, it’s the inky flood dragon beast...”","Feng Wu didn’t think so.","These children were just unconscious for a while. If she stimulated the acupoint, they would wake up soon..","However, before she could say anything, a black wind suddenly blew past.","Before anyone could react...","Everyone fell back.","Some people were swept into the river.","Even the first mate was thrown overboard.","Everyone rushed over to help those people.","After finally fishing up the first mate, the twelve children woke up.","After a moment of chaos, Qin Qi suddenly realized something.","“Where is Feng Wii?!”","What?!","Only then did everyone realize a very serious problem!","Where was she?!","This was Miss Feng Wu, Jun Linyuan’s beloved girl! “She was here just now. She was treating these children.”","“Why did she disappear in the blink of an eye?”","“Has she gone into the cabin?”","“She’s not there!”","“There was a gust of black wind just now. Has she fallen into the river?”","“I saw three people fall into the river. They’re all out of the water now. Miss","Feng Wu isn’t among them.” “Then where did she go?”","Everyone was a little flustered...","Qin Qi was dumbfounded... His mind was blank, and the only thing he could think of was “I’m dead.”","“Where are the others? Who else is missing?!” The first mate hurriedly shouted, “Report to me!”","After checking everyone on board, he realized... Everyone was there except for Feng Wu.","“Where is Miss Feng Wu?!”","Everyone panicked.","Qin Qi’s legs went weak, and he fell to the ground. He was trembling in fear.","“Qin Qi? Young Master Qin?” The first mate looked at Qin Qi for help.","Qin Qi burst into tears. “What should I do? If I lose Miss Feng Wu, His Royal","Highness will kill me!”","The first mate comforted him. “No, I’m sure that won’t happen.”","The others also comforted him. “You’re not the one who lost Miss Feng Wu. You can’t be blamed.”","“Our crown prince is smart and reasonable. He won’t take it out on you.”","Qin Qi didn’t know what to say.","Others might not know, but he knew that Feng Wu meant everything to Jun Linyuan.","Just then, Jun Linyuan finally killed the beast and returned to the ship.","His robe fluttered in the wind, and his face was cold and solemn. He looked around but didn’t see Feng Wu. His sharp eyes stared at Qin Qi.."]},{"number":3689,"title":"Chapter 3689: Feng Wu Is Missing (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3689: Feng Wu Is Missing (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Under Jun Linyuan’s cold gaze, Qin Qi’s mind went blank again...","“Your, Your Royal...” He couldn’t even speak properly. Jun Linyuan’s face darkened, and he asked, “Where is she?”","He was undoubtedly referring to Feng Wu.","Qin Qi said, “She, she...”","Jun Linyuan looked even more furious.","He extended his mental force and scanned the entire ship, but there was no trace of Feng Wu!","That was a very big surprise!","“She, she...” Qin Qi finally said it. “There was a gust of wind, and Miss Feng Wu was gone... She was taken away by that wind...”","Everyone nodded, indicating that Feng Wu had really been blown away by the wind and had nothing to do with them.","Just then, someone walked out.","It was none other than Tuberose herself.","She was the most excited to see Feng Wu missing.","The man was indeed very capable. He was able to take Feng Wu away in a moment like this.","“Your Royal Highness...” Tuberose came in gracefully and bowed at Jun Linyuan. Her voice was soft and seductive. “Miss Feng Wu doesn’t want to stay with you. I...”","However, Jun Linyuan only stared at her.","He recognized the person.","Before Tuberose could finish, a bloody hole appeared between her eyebrows. The next second, she exploded!","Everyone watched as she was blown to pieces.","They were all horrified.","They all looked at the crown prince involuntarily.","Only then did they realize how serious the matter was.","The temperature kept dropping...","The wind was chilly.","It was freezing...","Everyone shivered when they felt the cold air.","It was such a terrifying power.","They felt as if the end of the world was coming, and their hearts almost stopped.","Jun Linyuan looked at Qin Qi.","Qin Qi was dumbfounded.","He pointed in a direction. “The wind, the black wind... came from that direction, and when Your Royal Highness wasn’t looking, it took Miss Feng Wu away... It must have been prepared from the very beginning...” Jun Linyuan closed his eyes and opened them again.","It was such a terrifying look.","His eyes were as cold as ice and were filled with a murderous intention!","No one dared to meet his gaze.","One look and they might be dead.","Jun Linyuan glanced at Qin Qi, who was about to beg for mercy.","When the crowd looked again, Jun Linyuan was nowhere to be seen.","Phew...","Everyone let out a breath of relief.","“I knew it. His Royal Highness is a magnanimous man. Since he knows that we have nothing to do with Miss Feng Wu’s disappearance, he won’t blame us for","it.”","“His Royal Highness is unmatched in his capability.”","“His Royal Highness...”","However, Qin Qi had a bad feeling.","No, the crown prince was never that magnanimous. He had heard Feng Xun describe how much the crown prince cared about Miss Feng Wu. He was practically protecting her with his life.","Right at that moment...","Crack...","There was the sound of wood cracking.","“What’s that sound?”","“What’s going on? Why does it feel like the ship is swaying?”","“Is the beast not dead? Has it come back to life?”","“That’s not right. His Royal Highness has killed both beasts! Is there a third one? Why are there so many beasts in this river?”","Just then..."]},{"number":3690,"title":"Chapter 3690: Feng Wu Is Missing (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3690: Feng Wu Is Missing (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then, everyone realized that something was wrong.","Because the wooden planks under their feet made a cracking sound.","“What’s going on?”","“This ship...”","Captain Wu paled as well. He was the first to react.","“The bottom of the ship is cracking!","“Abandon the ship!” Abandon the ship?","Jumping overboard?!","“Captain Wu, what’s wrong with the ship? Why did it crack all of a sudden?”","“This isn’t the time to ask! We need to remedy the situation! Captain Wu, what should we do now?!”","Captain Wu’s face was ghastly pale. He shook his head and said, “If I could, I wouldn’t have let you jump off the boat. You should swim northeast now. The waterflow will help you. Maybe you can get ashore alive...’","“But no matter how smooth the journey is, there’s still 15km to go to the northeast! ”","Everyone disagreed.","Captain Wu smiled bitterly. What choice did he have?","“What’s going on with this boat?”","“Why is this happening all of a sudden? Why...”","Qin Qi gave them a strange look.","“Haven’t you figured it out? His Royal Highness is venting his anger on us.” Qin Qi looked desperate.","“That’s impossible. Why would His Royal Highness blame us for Miss Feng","Wu’s disappearance? That’s impossible...’","Qin Qi smiled bitterly. “Feng Xun said that His Royal Highness would lose his mind if anything happened to Miss Feng Wu. His Royal Highness is only venting his anger now. If we can’t find Miss Feng Wu...” Qin Qi looked like he was going to cry.","Even if they made it to the bank alive, they would all be killed.","No one believed him at first, but when they saw Qin Qi’s pale face...","Then they remembered Tuberose, who had been blown to pieces.","They all fell silent.","Just then, Captain Wu took out a small boat.","Everyone looked like they had lost their minds.","They all tried to get into the boat.","But the boat was so small that it could only fit three or four people.","Captain Wu shook his head and wouldn’t let the adults get in.","Qin Qi realized what the captain wanted to do and said, “The kids have all woken up. Miss Feng Wu has saved them.","“Maybe His Royal Highness will spare our lives for the sake of the children.","“That’s why they can’t die.","“No one is allowed to fight with these kids over this boat!”","What Qin Qi said was so frightening that no one dared to take the boat away from the children.","“We still have two dead beasts. Look, they’re half-floating on the surface of the river. We can circle around them and push them forward.”","“That’s right! That’s a way out! Maybe we’ll run into a life-saving boat!”","Everyone tried to save themselves.","What Feng Wu didn’t know was that because of her disappearance, Jun Linyuan was so angry that the Soaring Wing had shattered into pieces.","Feng Wu, on the other hand...","Her head was spinning, and she felt awful.","It was bumpy, and she was swaying back and forth.","Feng Wu thought her head was going to explode.","Yes, a hand seemed to have grabbed her and smacked her on the head, knocking her out. But now, she woke up again.","Where was she now? Where was Jun Linyuan?","Feng Wu rubbed her eyes and looked around.","It was so dark that she couldn’t see anything.","Moreover, she seemed to be suspended in mid-air as she kept moving forward. Feng Wu did socalculationsion in her head and realized how fast he was moving.."]},{"number":3691,"title":"Chapter 3691: Where’s Feng Wu (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3691: Where’s Feng Wu (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu did some calculation in her head and realized how fast he was moving.","She felt as if she could travel 5 km in a second!","Where was she?","Feng Wu realized that she had been stuffed into a sack and was being carried around like a piece of cargo.","Feng Wu closed her eyes and tried to recall what happened before she lost consciousness.","She was trying to save the kids when she felt a gust of wind. Before she knew it, a strong arm caught her.","Before Feng Wu could call for help, someone knocked her out by hitting her on the back of her neck","Hence...","Who was this person? Where was she? What was his purpose? Had Jun Linyuan found out...","Questions kept popping into Feng Wu’s head, but she couldn’t utter a word, for she had been rendered mute for the time being.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","The mute acupoint wouldn’t have been able to do anything to her under normal circumstances.","However, Feng Wu didn’t have any cultivation ability at the moment, so she couldn’t do anything about it.","She couldn’t let her kidnapper keep running like this.","Feng Wu thought, “This person is running too fast. At this speed, I’ll be out of the Junwu Empire in a few days, and it’ll be very difficult for Jun Linyuan to find me.”","Feng Wu tried to summon Little Phoenix and the cub.","To her disappointment, the two spiritual pets seemed to have disappeared without making a sound.","No, to be more precise, Feng Wu’s spiritual essence had been sealed, and she couldn’t open the mental space at all. She had lost contact with her spiritual pets.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Right now, she had no one else to turn to but herself.","No, she had to make this person stop.","Feng Wu struggled with all her strength.","The man carrying Feng Wu frowned. He wanted to ignore her, but Feng Wu kept scratching him.","Did she need to pee?","At the thought of the smell of urine, the man stopped.","He spotted a dilapidated temple a short distance away, so he carried Feng Wu toward it with the sack over his shoulder.","After they entered the temple, the man tossed Feng Wu on the ground, untied the rope around the bag, and found a clean corner to sit down.","Feng Wu rolled out of the sack with much difficulty.","Right now, Feng Wu felt so stiff that she could barely feel her legs.","While she was waiting for her legs to recover, Feng Wu looked around.","It was a dilapidated mountain temple. At the center of the hall was a broken Maitreya Buddha statue. One of its ears had fallen off, and the temple had been in disrepair for so long that there were gaps in the roof. If it rained, the temple would probably get very wet.","Soon, Feng Wu saw a man in a black robe.","He sat there with his legs crossed and his eyes closed. Half of his face was hidden in the shadows.","Who was that?","Was he the one who had brought her here?","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes, and her face darkened.","Just then, the man opened his eyes and stared at Feng Wu.","It was a pair of eyes that reminded one of a frozen lake, and one would shudder at the sight of them!","Other people might be frightened, but Feng Wu remained unperturbed when she looked into his eyes, but she was on guard now.","The man had no intention of talking to Feng Wu. He only said indifferently, “We’re leaving in five minutes.”","He closed his eyes after that and didn’t say another word.."]},{"number":3692,"title":"Chapter 3692: Where’s Feng Wu (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3692: Where’s Feng Wu (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu wanted to say something but realized that she couldn’t utter a word.","But she wasn’t discouraged. She slowly walked up to the man.","Feng Wu pointed at her throat and hummed.","The man glanced at her but didn’t say anything. He went back to his cultivation.","Feng Wu stubbornly stood in front of him and pointed at her throat, making protesting sounds.","She couldn’t speak, and that was a big problem. She had to remove the restriction.","The man glared at Feng Wu impatiently.","Right now, Feng Wu was as stubborn as a lamb.","The man felt a headache coming on.","If he let this little mute make all the noises, he wouldn’t be able to cultivate.","They were high up in the mountains and there was no one around, so he wasn’t afraid of her shouting.","Staring at Feng Wu, the man warned her in the end. “If you do something out of line, I won’t just take away your voice.”","Feng Wu nodded immediately. The man asked, “Do you know what’s considered out of the line?” Feng Wu nodded again.","The man was defeated and let Feng Wu have her voice again.","“Who are you?”","Feng Wu’s husky voice almost frightened herself.","The man gave Feng Wu a strange look.","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","After clearing her throat, Feng Wu asked, “Who are you and why did you take me away? What’s your purpose?”","The man stared at Feng Wu with a frown as if he was thinking about something.","Feng Wu immediately took a few steps back and asked the man, “Is that too much?”","The man stared at Feng Wu. Although he didn’t say anything, it was obvious what he meant. What else could it be?","Feng Wu took another step back. “Alright, alright. I won’t ask. That’ll do.”","“I need to relieve myself. Don’t come with me!” Feng Wu warned the man.","The man looked up at the sky and waved at Feng Wu.","Picking up the lower hem of her dress, Feng Wu ran out of the temple.","After leaving the temple, Feng Wu stood halfway up the mountain and looked into the distance. One look and she lost all hope.","Right now, they were halfway up a high mountain. Beneath them was a deep cliff with heavy mist. In the distance, she could see the endless jungle...","Fenz Wu had no idea where she was.","She found a bush and crouched down, pretending to be in the toilet. Resting her chin on her hands, she racked her brain for a way out.","It was actually very difficult...","Although Feng Wu could walk and jog now, her cultivation level was sealed, and she couldn’t activate any spiritual essence.","Even the mental space was blocked, and she couldn’t communicate with the two spiritual pets.","Feng Wu was all by herself now.","Jun Linyuan had to be looking for her like a madman... She had to find a way to let him know that she had been taken away by that man.","Feng Wu rested her chin on her hands, and her eyes lit up.","Just then, footsteps came from a short distance away.","Apart from Feng Wu, that man was the only one here, so it had to be him.","As expected, the man stood a short distance away and stared in Feng Wu’s direction. “Let’s go.”","Feng Wu said, “Alright, alright! I’ll be right there!”","In the end, Feng Wu feigned an angry tone. “Go away! Don’t you know how shy a girl can be?!”","The man looked up at the sky again.","He wanted to shut her up.","Before long, Feng Wu came back.","He stared at Feng Wu’s hand.","Her hands were wet and covered with green liquid. The man was vigilant by nature, so when he saw Feng Wu..."]},{"number":3693,"title":"Chapter 3693: Pursuit","paragraphs":["Chapter 3693: Pursuit","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The black-robed man was a vigilant person, so he frowned when he saw the green juice on Feng Wu’s hand.","“Clean yourself up.” He stared at Feng Wu with a fierce look in his eyes. Feng Wu said reluctantly, “I’m just trying to get rid of the smell..","The black-robed man glared at Feng Wu.","Seeing that he was about to make a move, Feng Wu said in a hurry, “Alright, alright, I’ll wash it. I’ll wash it, alright?”","After that, Feng Wu walked to the stream and washed her hands carefully.","The man looked at the sack and gestured for Feng Wu to go in by herself.","This was simply a great humiliation.","Feng Wu didn’t want to be carried in a sack again.","“I can walk. Why don’t you let me walk by myself?” Feng Wu protested.","However, the man didn’t give her a chance to retort. He took a step forward, picked Feng Wu up, and tossed her into the sack like a chicken.","Feng Wu grabbed his clothes and tried to struggle, but the man only waved his hand.","With a thud, Feng Wu fell to the ground and couldn’t get up again.","Before she could say anything, the man had already pulled up the sack, slung Feng Wu over his back, and strode away.","Feng Wu wanted to say something, but then she realized that the man would seal her acupoints if she started talking. So, she shut her mouth and didn’t dare to move.","Sitting cross-legged in the sack, Feng Wu pricked up her ears and listened carefully.","She noticed the terrain around her when she went out, and although the man could cover hundreds of meters with a single step, she could still tell that they were walking on a ridge.","And all the way up.","Feng Wu had a hunch, so she kept her ears open.","Sure enough, after the man climbed over the mountain ridge, he quickly descended the mountain from the other side.","Feng Wu was already certain that they were heading north.","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan had been heading northwest, but the black-robed man was heading northeast... They were on completely opposite sides, and it would be hard for Jun Linyuan to catch up.","The black-robed man walked all the way through the uninhabited mountains, but there were also cities that he had no choice but to walk through.","Right now, he had no choice but to enter the city.","Finally, there were other people around.","Feng Wu heaved a sigh of relief and prayed at the same time.","She hoped that her little tricks would work.","Feng Wu’s trick was simple.","Previously, when she pretended to pee, she tore a piece of cloth from the inside of her shirt and wrote a line of words on it.","Of course, the green juice on her hand was only to distract that man. As expected, the black-robed man no longer suspected her. This line of words was now stuck on the black-robed man’s back.","What did she write?","Naturally, she wrote the most shocking thing she could think of.","In this world, there were only three things that caused a stir and were widely discussed: scandal, scandal, and scandal.","If there was something that was more shocking, it was the scandal of celebrities.","So, in order to spread the word, Feng Wu wrote...","Jun Linyuan.","No one in the Junwu Empire was more talked about than Jun Linyuan. Besides, Feng Wu wasn’t writing about Jun Linyuan’s scandal, but his gossip.","“Jun Linyuan is getting married. Is Feng Wu the bride?” Was Feng Wu the bride?","This matter would definitely cause widespread discussion.","Feng Wu was hoping that Jun Linyuan would come after her as soon as he heard the news because it would be almost impossible for her to escape by herself.","As a matter of fact, Feng Wu’s trick worked.","The black-robed man would have to pass by a city sooner or later.."]},{"number":3694,"title":"Chapter 3694: Passing by the City","paragraphs":["Chapter 3694: Passing by the City","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The black-robed man would eventually enter the city. Someone would definitely see him.","That was indeed the case.","After running for a long time, the man finally couldn’t take the hard life in the wilderness anymore and carried Feng Wu into the city.","After entering the city, he noticed that the gazes of the surrounding people were a little strange.","They all stared at him.","The man frowned slightly. Was there something wrong with him?","Not only was he dressed in a black robe, but he was also carrying a large sack.","At that thought, he found a secluded spot, threw down the sack, and asked Feng Wu to climb out.","“You want to come out?” He looked down at Feng Wu.","Naturally, Feng Wu figured it out.","Stuffed in the sack, Feng Wu couldn’t do anything to save herself. The only way was to stick a strip of cloth on the sack.","Feng Wu climbed out of the sack and put away the cloth without a word. The man didn’t even notice.","Feng Wu looked up at the man and nodded. The black-robed man said, “If you dare to do anything overboard, you’ll die!”","After that, the man handed a pill to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu frowned. “What’s that?”","The man said, “Three-day Soul Devouring Pill.”","Feng Wu was speechless. She had heard of this pill before.","Not only had she heard of it, but to put it bluntly, she was the one who created this pill.","Feng Wu looked up at the man.","The black-robed man sneered. “You do know medicine, but you’re only a Supreme Level Apothecary! You can’t find an antidote, so stop trying!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. She really had an antidote. The man ordered, “Swallow it!”","Without hesitation, Feng Wu took the pill and swallowed it!","Seeing how cooperative Feng Wu was, the man nodded.","He took out a set of men’s clothes for Feng Wu and changed her appearance. Her face was smeared with dirt, and she looked like a little beggar.","“Let’s go.”","The black-robed man led the way.","He wasn’t worried that Feng Wu would escape at all.","Feng Wu didn’t have any cultivation ability, and she had taken the poison pill.","Right now, Feng Wu was like a fish on a chopping board, at his mercy.","The man had changed into an ordinary person’s outfit. His face wasn’t covered by a black scarf, but Feng Wu could tell that he was wearing a human skin mask.","After some observation, Feng Wu realized that his human skin mask wasn’t as good as hers. It was only half as good.","Still, it was enough for people to not recognize him.","The man stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu took a step back. “What do you want?”","The black-robed man thought for a moment and sneered. “No matter how you hide your face, you can’t hide your natural beauty. Forget it, put on a human skin mask.”","As he spoke, he pulled out a human skin mask and put it on Feng Wu’s face. Before that, Feng Wu was a little beggar with a dirty face but good-looking features.","However, now that the black-robed man had covered her face up, Feng Wu looked like an ugly beggar with a flat nose, small eyes, and a big mouth.","Feng Wu glanced at her face from the pool by the side of the road. One look was enough to make her depressed.","“Isn’t this too ugly? I don’t like it!” she protested.","However, the man was very pleased with his work. He nodded and said to Feng wu, “Let’s go.”","As he spoke, the black-robed man swaggered away.","Feng Wu had no other choice at the moment, so she could only..."]},{"number":3695,"title":"Chapter 3695: Away for Too Long","paragraphs":["Chapter 3695: Away for Too Long","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu had no other choice but to follow him.","The black-robed man walked into the bustling area. What he didn’t know was that Feng Wu still had a stripe of cloth on her.","Feng Wu thought to herself, “Hurry up and spread the word.” Once Jun Linyuan heard about it, she would be saved.","Many people were staring at Feng Wu’s cloth, but she didn’t know if it would work.","They arrived at a restaurant called the Nameless Residence.","The black-robed man might feel that he had run quite far away, so he let down his guard and sat by the window.","Feng Wu sat opposite him.","When the man wasn’t looking, Feng Wu left a mark on the railing.","Those were the two ugly ducks that Feng Wu had embroidered for Jun Linyuan.","She knew Jun Linyuan would recognize them right away.","Feng Wu didn’t dare to leave too big a mark because the black-robed man was still very wary of her. She would be in trouble if he found out.","“Help yourself.”","Feng Wu didn’t feel like a prisoner at all. Instead, she acted like a hospitable host and kept asking the man to eat.","The man looked at Feng Wu in amazement.","He specialized in kidnapping. Over the years, he had kidnapped quite a number of people, but every person he kidnapped ran for their lives and wouldn’t eat anything.","The girl was different. She kept drinking, eating, and almost singing loudly.","The man in the black robe glared at Feng Wu and reprimanded her. “Be quiet!”","Feng Wu nodded and sat down in silence.","Feng Wu’s plan was simple, but it would work.","She had to create as many accidents as possible to impress the people around her. That way, it would be easier for Jun Linyuan to find her later.","Feng Wu didn’t dare to do anything else after being reprimanded by the black-robed man. She couldn’t push too far or provoke his sensitive nerves.","Feng Wu sat there and ate the porridge in silence.","However, her big intelligent eyes were rolling around. She had been silently looking for an opportunity to create an accident so that she would be remembered.","Behind Feng Wu sat a group of pugilists. They were brawny and strong-looking.","“Hey, have you heard? The Peace Grassland is at war!”","“I know more than that. I heard that the Junwu Empire has its own fighter jet!”","“I know, I know. I heard that Feng Wu was the one who invented the fighter jet!”","“Which Feng wu?”","“The crown prince’s little Feng Wu! You don’t even know that?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Had she been out of touch with the real world for too long, or were people much more open-minded now? What did they mean by the crown prince’s little Feng Wu? Weren’t they afraid of being beaten to death by Jun Linyuan’s female fans?","“Indeed, once this fighter jet appears, the situation on the Peace Grassland will no longer be the same as before. Previously, we were always at a disadvantage and were losing miserably. Now, we can fight to a draw in the sky!”","“I knew it. This little Feng Wu is amazing. I won’t accept anyone else as the crown prince’s wife apart from her!”","Feng Wu rubbed her own forehead.","She really hadn’t expected that everyone’s attitude toward her had changed so much that they were looking forward to her getting together with Jun Linyuan.","Therefore... the information on the cloth that she had used previously wouldn’t cause much of a stir.","It seemed like she had to change the gossip.."]},{"number":3696,"title":"Chapter 3696: Sakiya l s Words","paragraphs":["Chapter 3696: Sakiya l s Words","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu glanced up at the black-robed man as she thought about it.","Her heart skipped a beat.","The man obviously didn’t seem happy.","She was sure that the man’s face had darkened because he had heard what those people said.","He wouldn’t be so mad about what had happened between her and Jun Linyuan. So, the only explanation was the fighter jets.","Therefore, Feng Wu was 80% sure that the man was from the Dongsang Kingdom.","It made sense. He was able to steal her away under Jun Linyuan’s watch and get away for a few days. He had to be very capable.","However, Feng Wu hadn’t figured out how capable the man was yet.","Just then, a waiter came in with some hot fish soup.","Feng Wu didn’t order the fish soup because she liked it but because it was hot. She needed to use it.","Feng Wu apologized inwardly. The next second...","She stuck her foot out and tripped the waiter.","The waiter threw the big bowl of hot water at the man’s face.","The man reacted quickly and struck out with his palm before the soup could touch his face.","He didn’t throw the soup at Feng Wu because he would be the one in trouble if she was injured.","Therefore, he had no choice but to throw the soup at the people on the other side.","Those martial arts practitioners were still chatting happily when something unexpected happened.","Caught off guard, the soup splashed all over them, making them jump around in pain.","They all turned to stare at Feng Wu’s table.","The waiter, who had brought the fish soup, was dumbfounded.","Feng Wu stepped out and blocked the waiter’s way. She then turned to those men and apologized profusely. “I’m so sorry. It was all my fault. I didn’t get my leg back and tripped him. That’s why this happened.","“My... My master was so protective of me that he splashed the fish soup on your face. Please don’t blame him...","“It’s not his fault? Should we blame you, then?” People in the martial arts circle were very tough to handle because they were all short-tempered. Blood rushed to their heads, and they drew out their swords.","After that, the leader bumped into Feng Wu.","No one knew how much force he exerted, but Feng Wu flew away before he could touch her.","The leader didn’t care because the man in the black robe was his target.","Of course, he was no longer wearing a black robe. Instead, he was dressed like a native of the Junwu Empire.","But he couldn’t do anything because if he fought, the special spiritual essence of the Dongsang Kingdom would be detected.","The Junwu Empire and the Dongsang Kingdom were fighting in the Peace Grassland. If they found a mysterious Dongsang man in the Junwu Empire, the latter would be in a lot of trouble.","As expected, the man was staring at Feng Wu so hard that he could dig a hole in her skin.","He regretted letting Feng Wu out.","According to the intel, Feng Wu was cunning and full of tricks. Even if they caught her, they couldn’t let their guard down. They had to lock her up.","That was what Mr. Sakya said.","Frustrated that he had been tricked by the girl’s pitiful look, the man made up his mind. Once this was over, he would do as Mr. Sakiya said and tie the girl up.","But..."]},{"number":3697,"title":"Chapter 3697: A Man of the Dongsang Kingdom","paragraphs":["Chapter 3697: A Man of the Dongsang Kingdom","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, things turned south before he could carry out his plan.","The five men were capable cultivators as well, so they wouldn’t let it drop after they were splashed with hot soup. Therefore, they went up to the man.","The previous black-robed man was now wearing a disguise and looked like an honest old man.","He seemed to be an easy target.","Feng Wu tried to stir things up and shouted, “Don’t go near him! I mean it! Don’t go! You’ll get beaten up! He’s so capable...”","It would have been fine if Feng Wu hadn’t said that. However, those words were enough to embarrass all the other cultivators.","The leader patted the man on the shoulder. “Old man, I heard you were very capable. Come, hit me. I’d like to see how capable you are.”","The others chimed in. “Bring it on. Hit my brother. We’ll see how good you are.","Hahaha...","Another man said, “We only wiped out an entire family yesterday. Aren’t you afraid?!”","The man took a deep breath and told himself not to be provoked.","However, those cultivators were simply too infuriating. Seeing that the old man wouldn’t answer, they became even more relentless.","Grabbing Feng Wu, the man frowned and turned to leave.","The leader’s eyes lit up when he saw Feng Wu’s fair wrist.","“Hey, guys, look at that wrist. It doesn’t look right. How can a beggar have such fair skin?”","“Gosh, is she a girl?”","“But she’s so ugly.”","“Hey, buddy, don’t be ridiculous. Don’t you know that there’s a medical skill known as ‘disguise’? What if the girl is wearing a disguise?”","The leader stopped the man right away and asked Feng Wu, “Little beggar, is he really your master?”","Feng Wu...","She had started the conflict on purpose, and she wanted to make as much trouble as possible.","Hence, Feng Wu put on her best performance.","“I... I...” She sounded a little nervous and made sure the others could recognize a teenage girl’s voice.","The leader melted at the sound and couldn’t care less about anything else.","With that soft skin and that tiny voice... Needless to say, the person under that beggar’s costume was definitely a beauty!","Seeing that things were getting out of hand, the man wanted to leave with","Feng Wu.","But the leader wouldn’t let her.","“You human trafficker! Put the girl down!” The leader was greedy and tried to grab the man.","To be able to wipe out an entire clan so easily, these so-called martial arts practitioners were anything but chivalrous.","The man was so frustrated that he couldn’t control himself anymore.","He clenched his right hand into a fist and punched the leader in the chest.","There was a loud thump.","The man flew backward and smashed into countless tables and chairs. However, he couldn’t stop himself and quickly slid backward.","When he finally stopped, he spat out a mouthful of blood and fell to the ground.","“Brother! ”","Quite a few men ran toward their brother.","Their brother was still breathing, and he pointed at the man. “The spiritual essence of the Dongsang Kingdom... He’s...” As soon as he said that, he fainted.","WHAT?!","Everyone was astonished?"]},{"number":3698,"title":"Chapter 3698: News on Miss Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Chapter 3698: News on Miss Feng Wu","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone was astonished.","A Man of the Dongsang Kingdom?","That lousy old man?!","By then, the “old man” had dragged Feng Wu away.","“Stop!”","“He’s a Dongsang spy! Stop them!”","Because of the war, everyone was very patriotic. They were excited to see a Dongsang man sneaking around.","“Wait, there’s a piece of cloth here. What does it say?","Just then, someone noticed a bundle of white cloth on the table and unfolded it.","It read, “Feng Wu is being held hostage. A second-generation fighter jet has been stolen by the Dongsang Kingdom.” Everyone was shocked when they saw the cloth.","WHAT?!","Feng Wu was kidnapped?","That was to say...","“That little beggar?!”","“Have you noticed? That little beggar’s hands are so fair and tender. They belong to a girl!”","“So, she’s the legendary Feng Wu, His Royal Highness’s Feng wu?!”","Everyone was shocked by the news.","It was too big a piece of news for anyone to handle.","Soon, the cloth was in the restaurant owner’s hand.","The owner didn’t dare to delay and immediately delivered the news to the","dLIL110LIL1es.","The mayor’s residence.","The city they were in was called Yu City.","The mayor of Yu City was holding a sea arrest warrant from the imperial court. The person wanted was none other than the black-robed man, and Feng Wu herself was missing.","Feng Wu’s disappearance couldn’t be kept a secret. Now that Emperor Wu had heard about it, so did many other important figures.","Important documents of the empire could be delivered through special channels without any manual labor. Therefore, it was very efficient.","Looking at the decree in his hand, the mayor shook his head and said to his assistant, “Why did we receive this? They disappeared around Yong City. It has nothing to do with our city.”","The others all agreed.","They only read the decree for a moment before putting it aside.","“Speaking of which, is Miss Feng Wu really His Royal Highness’s fiancee?” It was Master Tang, Mayor Yu’s deputy.","Mayor Yu nodded. “I think so. Otherwise, His Majesty wouldn’t have activated a special channel to send the warrant to the entire Junwu Empire. It would cost more than a few spiritual stones.”","Master Tang shook his head. “What a pity. If that kidnapper passes by Yu City, we can use this opportunity to make a contribution. My lord, you may be able to get what you want.”","Mayor Yu smiled bitterly. “Although it’s a good thing for the empire and the people, it’ll cost too much. I’m afraid I won’t be able to get what I want.”","Sir Tang smiled bitterly as well. “His Majesty might grant our wishes if we save her, judging by how much he cares about Miss Feng Wu. Miss Feng Wu has always been a very capable fighter. She’s the one who has developed all the fighter jets of the Junwu Empire.”","Mayor Yu was still smiling wryly when someone hurried into the room.","It was Mayor Yu’s chief steward.","“Sir, Mr. Yun of Yunlai Inn said he needed an audience.”","Mayor Yu frowned.","He had never interacted with these merchants, so why did the owner of Yunlai Inn want to see him?","“Just say that I’m busy...”","Before Mayor Yu could finish, he heard a hubbub of voices outside.","Many people were talking.","“Don’t stop me! I have information on Miss Feng Wu! This is a great opportunity! Let me in!”"]},{"number":3699,"title":"Chapter 3699: They’re Coming","paragraphs":["Chapter 3699: They’re Coming","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Don’t stop me! I have information on Miss Feng Wu! This is a great opportunity! Let me in!”","Noisy voices kept coming from outside.","The high-ranking officials of the city were in a meeting, so they all heard it.","News on Miss Feng Wu?","“Is it about THAT Miss Feng Wu?” The deputy mayor pointed at the decree they had put aside.","Mavor Yu didn’t think much of it at first, but he almost iumDed to his feet when he heard those words!","The next second, he was out the door.","He wasn’t the only one.","With Mayor Yu gone, the others couldn’t sit still anymore.","Hence, they all ran out of the room.","Mayor Yu grabbed the owner of the restaurant, who was stopped outside.","“Mr. Yun, what did you say?","Without another word, Mr. Yun handed a piece of cloth to Mayor Yu and said loudly, “I know where Miss Feng Wu is! Yes, THAT Miss Feng Wu!”","Seeing the strip of cloth, Mayor Yu asked anxiously, ‘What’s going on? Tell me!”","By then, Mr. Yun had caught his breath. He briefly described what happened in his restaurant today and concluded by saying, “There were quite a few people in the restaurant at the time, and they can all testify to that!”","The deputy mayor’s eyes widened.","Miss Feng Wu?!","They had been saying that it was impossible for Miss Feng Wu to show up in Yu City, but as it turned out... It was unbelievable!","“Are you sure it was Miss Feng Wu? Are you sure she was kidnapped by a Dongsang man?!”","The series of questions rendered Mr. Yun speechless.","Moreover, the deputy mayor was so agitated that he was pinching Mr. Yun’s shoulders.","That cleared Mr. Yun’s head right away.","Well... that...","Most of the time, commoners like them wouldn’t ask for meritorious service, but to avoid making mistakes. If he gave them the wrong information...","At that thought, Mr. Yun cringed a little.","“I- I can’t be completely sure that she’s Miss Feng Wu. Maybe... maybe I’m mistaken.","“Of course, we can’t be completely sure when all we have is this piece of cloth...","“So, if I’m wrong..","Mayor Yu threw a dirty look at the deputy mayor.","The decree was delivered by the fastest method. A small merchant like Mr. Yun would never know such confidential information about the imperial court, nor would he know that Miss Feng Wu had really been taken. So, he was probably telling the truth!","“Where did they go?”","Mayor Yu cut to the chase.","Mr. Yun said in a hurry, “To the northeast. That Dongsang man offended a group of martial arts practitioners, and they’ve been chasing him. It should be easier to find him..","“Great!” Mayor Yu was elated.","He made the arrangement right away.","He sent a group of people to chase the kidnapper while reporting the news to the imperial court.","The lords of cities had the means to report to the imperial court as soon as possible, but because of the high cost of using this channel, they didn’t use it that often.","But this was a special situation.","Therefore, Emperor Wu received the news in a few minutes.","That special channel was equivalent to a portal to the Peace Grassland.","Of course, these cities weren’t qualified to build a portal to send people around, but the channel was good enough to deliver a small box.."]},{"number":3700,"title":"Chapter 3700: Pursuit (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3700: Pursuit (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Therefore, Mayor Yu quickly reported the situation here.","He also sent the cloth Feng Wu had left behind.","The empire wouldn’t think much of it if there was only Mayor Yu’s report, but that strip of cloth was a different story...","Soon, it reached Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu didn’t expect that the cloth would reach Jun Linyuan so soon. Right now, she was being carried away by the man.","The man was obviously angry, so he was very rough.","In the end, the man threw Feng Wu into a pool in a valley.","Caught off guard, Feng Wu took a few gulps of water.","She wished she could dive in and swim away... Unfortunately, she was in a pool and couldn’t get anywhere...","Wait!","Feng Wu suddenly realized that although it was a pool, there seemed to be a hidden river at the bottom.","She was thrilled.","However, before she could get excited, a big hand reached into the pool, grabbed her by her hair and pulled her out. He then tossed her into the mud.","Poor Feng Wu. She had been thrown into the mud and was covered in dirt.","The man knew that he had sealed up Feng Wu’s ability, so he didn’t exert much strength. Otherwise, Feng Wu would have been dead by now. Even so, Feng Wu still hit her head on a rock and was bleeding.","She glared at the man.","Crouching down, the man met Feng Wu’s gaze. There was a murderous look in his eyes, and he looked like he was going to lose his temper.","“Kiddo, you did it on purpose!”","It wasn’t a question, but a statement.","Feng Wu covered her forehead with a handful of mud. That way, she could stop the bleeding.","She glanced at the man and said innocently, “What do you mean by that? You’re abusing me for no reason! You’re mistreating a hostage!”","The man snorted. Instead of replying to Feng Wu, he went on with what he had just said.","“Do you think someone will come after you just because you make a noise here?","“Kiddo, you think too highly of yourself.","“It’s just a little noise. Nothing will happen.","“So what if Jun Linyuan hears about it in the end? It’ll be a long time before he gets here. As for the others, they’ll only get themselves killed. Do you know what you’re doing to them?”","The man sneered at Feng Wu. “Tsk, tsk. Do you really think you can keep such a petty trick from me?”","Feng Wu wasn’t scared, but she still looked as pitiful as ever.","It was a very useful disguise.","She gave him an aggrieved look. “I have no idea what you’re talking about...’","She burst into tears as she spoke.","The man almost choked.","He had scolded her and even hit her, but the girl was crying?","Was this girl really the evil Feng Wu that made many Dongsang Kingdom people tremble with fear?","Was she really the girl that even Mr. Sakiya was intimidated by?","He wondered if he had caught the wrong person.","The man looked at the poor girl crying in front of him and felt a headache coming on. However, he couldn’t care less now that he had caught her.","The man stared at Feng Wu. “Why are you crying? Your tears won’t change anything!”","The man didn’t know what to do. The Dongsang Kingdom had been doing fine, but the Sun Castle was suddenly destroyed, and Night Owl was still bedridden.."]}]);
